84b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T04:42:40Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T04:42:40Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Add vetted agent skills\n\nConstraint: Template forks should have high-value agent skills vendored locally instead of depending on a developer''s global ~/.agents directory.\n\nRejected: Firebase and Convex security skills | reason: they target platforms that are not part of this template''s default stack.\n\nRejected: bobmatnyc playwright-e2e-testing | reason: the Skills CLI could not find a matching installable skill in that repository, so mindrally/skills@playwright was used instead.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: medium\n\nDirective: Apply the new TypeScript, Turborepo, code review, Playwright, and accessibility rules when their scope signals match.\n\nTested: pnpm agents:check\n\nTested: pnpm test:scripts\n\nTested: pnpm check\n\nTested: git diff --check\n\nNot-tested: pnpm build and pnpm test were not rerun after this docs/rules-only commit.","tree":{"sha":"16aa21768eb16e694383f080f482c1d16830f57d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/16aa21768eb16e694383f080f482c1d16830f57d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/b034958086f36ed454f2da3b57a3649b1442084b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.gi