"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/c9c75fe9d0fea99838447c37a2dcf6060f0d1179/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T13:15:28Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T13:15:28Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Operations hardening: HTTP metrics, graceful drain, docs gate\n\nHTTP metrics: extracts the prom-client setup into apps/api/src/metrics/\nhttp-metrics.ts and registers two new Prometheus series — a request duration\nhistogram (`http_request_duration_seconds`, buckets 5ms→10s) and a request\ncounter (`http_requests_total`). Both labeled by method, route template\n(`req.route?.path`, falling back to `<unmatched>` so cardinality stays\nbounded), and status. Wired through the existing requestLoggerMiddleware so\nevery non-skip request observes once.\n\nGraceful shutdown: previous handler called `app.close()` directly, which\ncloses the Nest container but leaves the http server accepting new\nconnections during the drain. New order is httpServer.close() first (drains\nkeep-alive connections / lets probes fail over), then app.close(), then\nDatabaseClient.close + OTel shutdown. Wraps the whole thing in a\nSHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT_MS force-exit safety net (default 30s).\n\nDocs gate: `/openapi.json` and `/docs` are now opt-out via `EXPOSE_DOCS`\n(default true in dev, recommended false in prod). OpenApiController throws\nAppError(\"NOT_FOUND\") when disabled — returns 404, not 401, so the route\ndoesn''t signal \"auth required, this exists, try harder.\"\n\nAppErrorFilter side-effect: now translates Nest''s HttpException (incl. the\ndefault 404 for unmatched routes) into the AppError taxonomy so every error\nresponse uses the canonical `{ ok:false, error:{ code, message } }`\nenvelope. Previously these became INTERNAL/500.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ed4ea0acb2c41a7d9d6a5d82e56e7e4f3d6585a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/8ed4ea0acb2c41a7d9d6a5d82e56e7e4f3d6585a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/c9c75fe9d0fea99838447c37a2dcf6060f0d1179","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/c9c75fe9d0fea99838447c37a2dcf6060f0d1179","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGM5Yzc1ZmU5ZDBmZWE5OTgzODQ0N2MzN2EyZGNmNjA2MGYwZDExNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/dc84d5fd468d3a20ea675ec88caee3986d5830e3","sha":"dc84d5fd468d3a20ea675ec88caee3986d5830e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/dc84d5fd468d3a20ea675ec88caee3986d5830e3"}],"sha":"c9c75fe9d0fea99838447c37a2dcf6060f0d1179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/c9c75fe9d0fea99838447c37a2dcf6060f0d1179"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/dc84d5fd468d3a20ea675ec88caee3986d5830e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T13:11:41Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T13:11:41Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Security hardening: CORS allowlist, auth rate limit, prod stack scrub\n\nCORS: replaces `cors: true` (reflects every Origin) with an env-driven\nallowlist. `CORS_ORIGINS` is comma-separated; required in production via\n`requireInProduction`; local dev defaults to localhost:{3000,3001,3100,3101}\nso `pnpm dev` keeps working without env tuning. Pairs with credentials: true\nso cookie auth still works.\n\nAuth rate limit: enables Better Auth''s built-in `rateLimit` with custom\nper-route buckets — `/sign-in/email` and `/sign-up/email` capped at 5\nattempts per 15 min per IP. Defaults to in-memory storage (single-replica\nsafe); doc comment points multi-replica deploys at `storage: \"database\"` or\na Redis secondary store.\n\nAppErrorFilter stack scrub: stack traces leak internal paths and dependency\nlayout. Keep them in dev for debugging, drop them in production logs.\nResolved once at module load (APP_ENV doesn''t change at runtime) so the hot\n500 path doesn''t re-read env.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de9c886410b96eb2013ac6df84ca1a8cb4c06775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/de9c886410b96eb2013ac6df84ca1a8cb4c06775"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/dc84d5fd468d3a20ea675ec88caee3986d5830e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/dc84d5fd468d3a20ea675ec88caee3986d5830e3","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGRjODRkNWZkNDY4ZDNhMjBlYTY3NWVjODhjYWVlMzk4NmQ1ODMwZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/f845cdd109b3a79dc033a1f2aa3041d829b30096","sha":"f845cdd109b3a79dc033a1f2aa3041d829b30096","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/f845cdd109b3a79dc033a1f2aa3041d829b30096"}],"sha":"dc84d5fd468d3a20ea675ec88caee3986d5830e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/dc84d5fd468d3a20ea675ec88caee3986d5830e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/f845cdd109b3a79dc033a1f2aa3041d829b30096/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T12:49:41Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T12:49:41Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Add per-request access log middleware\n\napps/api/src/middleware/request-logger.middleware.ts logs one pino line per\nrequest with method, path, status, latencyMs, and requestId — joining the\nsame stream as application logs (and rendering under pino-pretty in dev).\nMounted in main.ts after requestIdMiddleware so the request id is on the\nresponse header by capture time.\n\nStatus drives log level: 2xx/3xx → info, 4xx → warn, 5xx → error. Skips\n/health/* and /metrics so liveness probes and Prometheus scrapes don''t bury\nthe actual traffic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daa04c37d4baa74d31237ed4ff9b805251a4fd00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/daa04c37d4baa74d31237ed4ff9b805251a4fd00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/f845cdd109b3a79dc033a1f2aa3041d829b30096","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/f845cdd109b3a79dc033a1f2aa3041d829b30096","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGY4NDVjZGQxMDliM2E3OWRjMDMzYTFmMmFhMzA0MWQ4MjliMzAwOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/583b692c377ab1fe1eea33065cfadfd7861c72c6","sha":"583b692c377ab1fe1eea33065cfadfd7861c72c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/583b692c377ab1fe1eea33065cfadfd7861c72c6"}],"sha":"f845cdd109b3a79dc033a1f2aa3041d829b30096","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/d