m/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/a429d28acfe0af462686cecd3a9bd72d013bc0d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T08:12:19Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T08:12:19Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Document GitHub-template scaffold paths in README\n\nRepo is now flagged as a GitHub template (is_template=true via gh api PATCH).\nREADME''s Quick Start now leads with three fork mechanisms — `gh repo create\n--template`, `npx degit`, and the GitHub UI''s \"Use this template\" button —\nfollowed by `pnpm bootstrap && pnpm template:rename && pnpm dev` so a new\nfork lands at a runnable, renamed state in well under five minutes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cec65a68fbf230192cc2fd6b95f440ce6dd40056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/cec65a68fbf230192cc2fd6b95f440ce6dd40056"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/a429d28acfe0af462686cecd3a9bd72d013bc0d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/a429d28acfe0af462686cecd3a9bd72d013bc0d5","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGE0MjlkMjhhY2ZlMGFmNDYyNjg2Y2VjZDNhOWJkNzJkMDEzYmMwZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/c78f576a87d33b4542e69d9349c73edf21774c6d","sha":"c78f576a87d33b4542e69d9349c73edf21774c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/c78f576a87d33b4542e69d9349c73edf21774c6d"}],"sha":"a429d28acfe0af462686cecd3a9bd72d013bc0d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/a429d28acfe0af462686cecd3a9bd72d013bc0d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/c78f576a87d33b4542e69d9349c73edf21774c6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T08:11:26Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T08:11:26Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Add web auth integration: sign-in / sign-up / /me pages\n\nWires the web app to the API''s Better Auth surface using a Next.js rewrite\nproxy (so the browser sees /api/auth/* and /api/me as same-origin, no CORS,\nno Domain= cookie quirks):\n  next.config.ts → /api/auth/:path* and /api/me forwarded to NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL.\n\nNew surface:\n  /sign-in   → email/password form, calls Better Auth react client signIn.email\n  /sign-up   → name + email/password, calls signUp.email, redirects to /me\n  /me        → useSession() + fetches /api/me (the AuthenticatedGuard route),\n               shows the session user, sign-out button.\n  /          → adds three navigation buttons to the new pages.\n\nBetter Auth react client lives at apps/web/src/lib/auth-client.ts. Setting\ndeclaration:false at the apps/web tsconfig level avoids TS2883 from the\ninternal Better Auth types leaking through; apps don''t need declaration files.\n\nVerified end-to-end live: anonymous /api/me → 401, sign-up via /api/auth →\n200 + cookie, authenticated /api/me → 200 with user payload (all via\nhttp://localhost:3200 with the rewrite to API on :4200).\n\nPage-render verification was blocked by host EMFILE limits (other Next dev\nservers on this machine consuming watchers); typecheck/lint/format all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36c6461590d2e9b2ad9f7d34430022b6d93f5158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/36c6461590d2e9b2ad9f7d34430022b6d93f5158"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/c78f576a87d33b4542e69d9349c73edf21774c6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/c78f576a87d33b4542e69d9349c73edf21774c6d","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGM3OGY1NzZhODdkMzNiNDU0MmU2OWQ5MzQ5YzczZWRmMjE3NzRjNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/2aa0d2b18b373e6a7df095f97e7bb9a4ec20c359","sha":"2aa0d2b18b373e6a7df095f97e7bb9a4ec20c359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/2aa0d2b18b373e6a7df095f97e7bb9a4ec20c359"}],"sha":"c78f576a87d33b4542e69d9349c73edf21774c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/c78f576a87d33b4542e69d9349c73edf21774c6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/2aa0d2b18b373e6a7df095f97e7bb9a4ec20c359/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T07:44:46Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T07:44:46Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Add AuthModule, AuthenticatedGuard, @CurrentUser, and a /me reference route\n\nThe Better Auth instance previously lived in main.ts. Moving it into a Nest\nmodule (`AuthModule`) gives the rest of the API a DI handle on the same\ninstance — `AUTH_INSTANCE` token, exported, fed by `API_ENV` + `DATABASE_CLIENT`.\nmain.ts now pulls both via `app.get(...)` and the resulting `auth` instance is\nthe same one that `/api/auth/*` is mounted on, so guard sessions and public\nsessions share state.\n\n`AuthenticatedGuard` requires a Better Auth session and throws\n`AppError({ code: \"UNAUTHORIZED\" })` (mapped to the canonical\n`{ ok:false, error:{ code, message } }` envelope by `AppErrorFilter`). When\n`AUTH_MODE` is anything other than `better-auth-embedded` the guard returns\n`UNAUTHORIZED` with a clear message — operators using external-oidc /\nsso-gateway / central-auth-service must write their own guard against the\nupstream IdP.\n\n`@CurrentUser()` reads the user the guard attached.\n\n`GET /me` is the reference route — exercises both, registered in `MeModule`,\ndocumented in `/openapi.json`, integration-tested end-to-end via Better Auth\nsign-up + cookie reuse (5 tests added; total 21/21 pass).\n\n`auth.tokens.ts` is a stand-alone token file because the guard imports\n`AUTH_INSTANCE` and the module imports the guard — putting the token in\n`auth.module.ts` directly creates an ESM circular import that resolves to\n`undefined` at decorator-application time.\n\nRecipe `docs/recipes/protect-an-api-route.md` walks through applying the\nguard to a new route, including OpenAPI updates and the test pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c926b85bd76569d6af113b90269ca608d54e401c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/c926b85bd76569d6af113b90269ca608d54e401c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/2aa0d2b18b373e6a7df095f97e7bb9a4ec20c359","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/2aa0d2b18b373e6a7df095f97e7bb9a4ec20c359","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKDJhYTBkMmIxOGIzNzNlNmE3ZGYwOTVmOTdlN2JiOWE0ZWMyMGMzNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/cd9d091e6ffccfae17bb3567ee2237b24979dc73","sha":"cd9d091e6ffccfae17bb3567ee2237b24979dc73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/cd9d091e6ffccfae17bb3567ee2237b24979dc73"}],"sha":"2aa0d2b18b373e6a7df095f97e7bb9a4ec20c359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/2aa0d2b18b373e6a7df095f97e7bb9a4ec20c359"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/cd9d091e6ffccfae17bb3567ee2237b24979dc73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T07:39:12Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T07:39:12Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"DX: tighten editor + Codespaces config\n\n- Tailwind class regex for cn()/cva() in .vscode/settings.json so IntelliSense\n  picks up classes inside those helpers.\n- Devcontainer adds Docker-in-Docker (so pnpm dev:db works inside the\n  container), forwards 5433 (dev Postgres), and switches postCreateCommand\n  from a bare pnpm install to pnpm bootstrap so env files land too.\n- README documents both — previously they shipped without a pointer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"319fc5fa2b9b65dd2cddd24d4a47e1db577755f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/319fc5fa2b9b65dd2cddd24d4a47e1db577755f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/cd9d091e6ffccfae17bb3567ee2237b24979dc73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/cd9d091e6ffccfae17bb3567ee2237b24979dc73","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGNkOWQwOTFlNmZmY2NmYWUxN2JiMzU2N2VlMjIzN2IyNDk3OWRjNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/0234db8ce27ae58f03e787ca3376e22ca8858a85","sha":"0234db8ce27ae58f03e787ca3376e22ca8858a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/0234db8ce27ae58f03e787ca3376e22ca8858a85"}],"sha":"cd9d091e6ffccfae17bb3567ee2237b24979dc73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/cd9d091e6ffccfae17bb3567ee2237b24979dc73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/0234db8ce27ae58f03e787ca3376e22ca8858a85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T07:02:35Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T07:02:35Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Replace JobsModule.forRoot static with a jobsModule() factory\n\nBiome''s `noStaticOnlyClass` rule rejects classes that contain only static\nmembers, which is exactly the shape NestJS dynamic-module conventions take\n(`SomeModule.forRoot(opts)`). Rather than ignore the rule, expose\n`jobsModule(enabled)` as a top-level factory and keep `JobsModule` as an\nempty class — Nest needs a class identity to key the dynamic module by, but\nthe factory is now a plain function. Behavior unchanged.\n\nCaught by CI on commit 81c8fe7 — `pnpm lint --error-on-warnings` failed on\nthe warning. The B-2 fixup commit (ee47f73) was clean because the JobsModule\nfile did not yet exist on that ref.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc8a2894fe8f2b700c4e0745f6a3b913b1311b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/bc8a2894fe8f2b700c4e0745f6a3b913b1311b84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/0234db8ce27ae58f03e787ca3376e22ca8858a85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/0234db8ce27ae58f03e787ca3376e22ca8858a85","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKDAyMzRkYjhjZTI3YWU1OGYwM2U3ODdjYTMzNzZlMjJjYTg4NThhODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/4f5b253941a5869e9e9ce4e256a572cdd0f6c880","sha":"4f5b253941a5869e9e9ce4e256a572cdd0f6c880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/4f5b253941a5869e9e9ce4e256a572cdd0f6c880"}],"sha":"0234db8ce27ae58f03e787ca3376e22ca8858a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/0234db8ce27ae58f03e787ca3376e22ca8858a85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/4f5b253941a5869e9e9ce4e256a572cdd0f6c880/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:59:45Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:59:45Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Add pnpm bootstrap onboarding + docs/recipes cookbook\n\n`pnpm bootstrap` (scripts/bootstrap.mjs) is an idempotent onboarding script\nthat runs preflight, `pnpm install`, and copies `env/local/*.env.example`\ninto each app''s canonical dev location (apps/api/.env, apps/web/.env.local,\n…). Supports --force to overwrite, --skip-install / --skip-preflight for\nfaster dev re-runs and the test fixture. Wired into root package.json (used\n`bootstrap` not `setup` because pnpm''s built-in `pnpm setup` shadows it).\n\n`docs/recipes/` ships five cookbook walkthroughs for the changes that come\nup most often: add an API domain module, add an env key, add a scheduled\njob, switch the auth mode, generate a client SDK from /openapi.json. The\nREADME and capabilities.md cross-link to the index.\n\nWhile verifying bootstrap end-to-end, found a pre-existing latent issue:\nonce an apps/api/.env file exists, vitest''s vite layer injects\nVITE_USER_NODE_ENV into process.env, which trips the strict foreign-key\nguard in @repo/env. Added a small allowlist of framework-internal keys\n(starts with VITE_USER_NODE_ENV) plus a regression test in api.test.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f88a627ac7b01ba3441b821a120e21df8a1041d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/f88a627ac7b01ba3441b821a120e21df8a1041d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/4f5b253941a5869e9e9ce4e256a572cdd0f6c880","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/4f5b253941a5869e9e9ce4e256a572cdd0f6c880","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKDRmNWIyNTM5NDFhNTg2OWU5ZTljZTRlMjU2YTU3MmNkZDBmNmM4ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/81c8fe7fc1a32b97077cdc93be10dc545b11acac","sha":"81c8fe7fc1a32b97077cdc93be10dc545b11acac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/81c8fe7fc1a32b97077cdc93be10dc545b11acac"}],"sha":"4f5b253941a5869e9e9ce4e256a572cdd0f6c880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/4f5b253941a5869e9e9ce4e256a572cdd0f6c880"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/81c8fe7fc1a32b97077cdc93be10dc545b11acac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:45:38Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:45:38Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"B-3: add @nestjs/schedule with an opt-in heartbeat sample job\n\nWire @nestjs/schedule (catalog 6.1.3) behind a new `JOBS_ENABLED` env flag\n(default false). When enabled, `JobsModule.forRoot(true)` registers\nScheduleModule plus a sample `HeartbeatJob` that logs an info-level pulse\nevery hour; when disabled it returns an empty dynamic module so multi-replica\ndeployments don''t multiply cron tasks by the replica count.\n\nProduction env example pins JOBS_ENABLED=false with a comment pointing\noperators to a separate scheduler workload or leader-election lock; local\nexample leaves it commented-off. Capabilities doc updates the API row to\nmention scheduled jobs and OpenAPI exposure, and removes the corresponding\n\"deferred\" entries from the rejected list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59e26354fa949b454b77518554b8da2004ce4885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/59e26354fa949b454b77518554b8da2004ce4885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/81c8fe7fc1a32b97077cdc93be10dc545b11acac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http