count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:41:40Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"B-2 fixup: apply biome + prettier formatting\n\nPure formatter pass on the B-2 files (openapi.config.ts, openapi.test.ts,\nADR 0003). No behavior change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"479e3b2c74834ff0a4e085d7d6ca6690cfd3e3fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/479e3b2c74834ff0a4e085d7d6ca6690cfd3e3fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/ee47f7326b67bf138769355f9c12490b85d5d678","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/ee47f7326b67bf138769355f9c12490b85d5d678","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGVlNDdmNzMyNmI2N2JmMTM4NzY5MzU1ZjljMTI0OTBiODVkNWQ2Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/51626214e9a946c9734d4497365ef379e4f6c7a0","sha":"51626214e9a946c9734d4497365ef379e4f6c7a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/51626214e9a946c9734d4497365ef379e4f6c7a0"}],"sha":"ee47f7326b67bf138769355f9c12490b85d5d678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/ee47f7326b67bf138769355f9c12490b85d5d678"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/51626214e9a946c9734d4497365ef379e4f6c7a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:36:41Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:36:41Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"B-2: expose OpenAPI 3.1 spec at /openapi.json and Scalar UI at /docs\n\nGenerate the document at request time from `@repo/contracts` using Zod 4''s\nbuilt-in `z.toJSONSchema` (draft-2020-12, accepted by OpenAPI 3.1) plus a\nsmall hand-authored envelope that mirrors the controllers. `OpenApiController`\nserves `/openapi.json` (rate-limit-skipped), and the Scalar UI is mounted on\nthe raw Express adapter at `/docs`. A unit test asserts the served `Note`\nschema is byte-identical to `z.toJSONSchema(noteSchema)` so contract drift\nfails CI.\n\nADR 0003 records the choice to use `z.toJSONSchema` instead of\n`@asteasolutions/zod-to-openapi`, which currently does not reach Zod 4 schema\ninstances via prototype patching.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b95d227e2a142535d9486e077f669cd2bc56afe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/3b95d227e2a142535d9486e077f669cd2bc56afe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/51626214e9a946c9734d4497365ef379e4f6c7a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/51626214e9a946c9734d4497365ef379e4f6c7a0","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKDUxNjI2MjE0ZTlhOTQ2Yzk3MzRkNDQ5NzM2NWVmMzc5ZTRmNmM3YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/ed07fa141bb534db073f315a0bbc472f54648ca9","sha":"ed07fa141bb534db073f315a0bbc472f54648ca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/ed07fa141bb534db073f315a0bbc472f54648ca9"}],"sha":"51626214e9a946c9734d4497365ef379e4f6c7a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/51626214e9a946c9734d4497365ef379e4f6c7a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/ed07fa141bb534db073f315a0bbc472f54648ca9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:24:21Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:24:21Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"B-1: API integration tests (supertest) for /notes + Better Auth runtime\n\nCover the full Nest router (ZodValidationPipe → controller → service → AppErrorFilter envelope) and the Better Auth Express mount (sign-up + session) with vitest + supertest. Both run as part of `pnpm test` — no e2e harness needed because supertest hits the in-memory Express server that `Test.createTestingModule` (Nest) and a bare `express()` instance (Better Auth) expose.\n\n- `apps/api/src/notes/notes.controller.test.ts` — 5 integration tests covering empty list, create + read round-trip, validation rejection (400 envelope), not-found path (404 envelope), and update + delete lifecycle.\n- `apps/api/src/auth/auth.integration.test.ts` — 3 integration tests against the in-process memory adapter: get-session for unauthenticated request returns null, sign-up issues a session cookie + token, and a follow-up get-session with the cookie returns the right user.\n\nCatalog adds:\n- supertest 7.2.2 + @types/supertest 7.2.0\n- @nestjs/testing 11.1.19 (Test.createTestingModule)\n- express 5.1.0 (the auth integration test imports it directly to mount toNodeHandler — under pnpm strict resolution this needs a direct catalog entry even though @nestjs/platform-express already brings express transitively)\n\nConstraint: The notes integration test must NOT register a global `ValidationPipe` from @nestjs/common. The Nest one requires class-validator at runtime; the route-level `ZodValidationPipe` already covers validation.\n\nConstraint: The auth integration test must mirror main.ts''s mount shape (`/api/auth/*splat` via raw Express). Hardcoding a different mount path would let the test pass while production breaks.\n\nConstraint: Test isolation — each test that creates a user uses a fresh `${Date.now()}` email so the in-memory store doesn''t fail uniqueness checks between cases.\n\nRejected: Use Playwright API testing instead | Playwright is fine for browser flows, but supertest + vitest runs in the same process, finishes in <1 s, and returns full type info on response shapes. Browser-spec-grade testing of a JSON API is overkill.\n\nRejected: Spin up the full apps/api `main.ts` boot path via tsx + a real port for the auth test | the integration shape mirrors main.ts closely enough; full boot would require port allocation, signal cleanup, and slow down `pnpm test` for marginal gain.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: narrow\n\nDirective: New domain modules add the equivalent integration test alongside the unit test — boot the module via Test.createTestingModule, register AppErrorFilter, hit the routes through supertest. Tests prove the envelope shape, not just service-layer logic.\n\nTested: pnpm format\n\nTested: pnpm check (28 turbo tasks; 0 failures)\n\nTested: pnpm build\n\nTested: pnpm test (28 turbo tasks; 18 test scripts pass — apps/api now contributes 13 test cases)\n\nNot-tested: Auth integration against the Drizzle adapter (memory-only path covers the same Better Auth REST surface; a Drizzle integration test would need a real Postgres or pg-mem)\n\nNot-tested: Concurrent requests (supertest sends serial requests; rate-limit and ALS-context tests are separate concerns)","tree":{"sha":"d229d576bbe407e4604b71cf276e9d2c45849263","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/d229d576bbe407e4604b71cf276e9d2c45849263"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/ed07fa141bb534db073f315a0bbc472f54648ca9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/ed07fa141bb534db073f315a0bbc472f54648ca9","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGVkMDdmYTE0MWJiNTM0ZGIwNzNmMzE1YTBiYmM0NzJmNTQ2NDhjYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/e4d41ecc55730be25a4bc96729bac069938af188","sha":"e4d41ecc55730be25a4bc96729bac069938af188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/e4d41ecc55730be25a4bc96729bac069938af188"}],"sha":"ed07fa141bb534db073f315a0bbc472f54648ca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/ed07fa141bb534db073f315a0bbc472f54648ca9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/e4d41ecc55730be25a4bc96729bac069938af188/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T05:56:24Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T05:56:24Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Bump pnpm/action-setup v4→v6, docker/build-push-action v6→v7, mobile typescript 5.9.2→5.9.3\n\nThree Dependabot follow-ups landed after the previous round; apply them in one batch.\n\n- `.github/actions/setup-pnpm-node/action.yml` + `.github/workflows/release.yml`: `pnpm/action-setup` v4 → v6 (#22). Composite re-exports the bumped action so all workflows that use the composite (CI, sbom) inherit it without further edits.\n- `.github/workflows/release-images.yml`: `docker/build-push-action` v6 → v7 (#21). v7 is a Node 20 → Node 24 runtime bump; existing inputs (`context`, `file`, `tags`, `labels`, `cache-*`, `provenance`, `sbom`) are unchanged.\n- `apps/mobile/package.json`: `typescript` 5.9.2 → 5.9.3 (#23). Patch within the Expo SDK 55 supported line; the catalog (`6.0.3`) and Dependabot-ignore (block major bumps only) were already configured to allow this.\n\nConstraint: pnpm syncpack:check stays green. Mobile''s literal TS pin diverges from the catalog by design; .syncpackrc.json''s `versionGroup` continues to ignore the drift.\n\nConstraint: pnpm/action-setup v6 must still honor the `packageManager` field in root package.json (no `version` input passed). Verified against the v6 release notes.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: narrow\n\nTested: pnpm install (lockfile updated)\n\nTested: pnpm syncpack:check\n\nTested: pnpm format\n\nTested: pnpm check (28 turbo tasks; 0 failures)\n\nNot-tested: GitHub Actions live run with v6 pnpm/action-setup + v7 docker/build-push-action (next push validates)","tree":{"sha":"193bfded36c8f809ea46b580af7fb10bc2da94fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/193bfded36c8f809ea46b580af7fb10bc2da94fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/e4d41ecc55730be25a4bc96729bac069938af188","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co