s://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/95a91feb3a5ddda98d4acf41b9178f123f6d0685/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:27:08Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:27:08Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Make package manifests own workspace dependencies\n\nApps and packages should use internal workspaces like installed libraries, so tsconfig project references were removed and package.json dependencies remain the single executable dependency graph.\n\nConstraint: App count is expected to grow, making manual tsconfig references expensive and error-prone.\n\nRejected: Keep TypeScript references beside package dependencies | duplicates dependency ownership and drifts when packages are added or removed.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: moderate\n\nDirective: Add @repo/* usage through package.json workspace:* dependencies; do not add tsconfig references unless this template policy is intentionally replaced.\n\nTested: pnpm tsconfig:check\n\nTested: pnpm check\n\nTested: pnpm build\n\nNot-tested: Editor-specific TypeScript server behavior across all IDEs","tree":{"sha":"daf9207da7522443b9e321770798e8889ab1cb69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/daf9207da7522443b9e321770798e8889ab1cb69"},