:"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/3c0fe21234e690c444addbafd52d1aecef83d478/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:23:57Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:23:57Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Document production secret injection patterns\n\nThe template now has app-scoped env contracts, so the README needs to explain how production deployments should source real values from secret groups, Vault-style systems, Docker runtime env, Compose, and Kubernetes without leaking server secrets into client apps.\n\nConstraint: Committed env files are examples only; real secrets must live in platform secret stores or ignored runtime files.\n\nRejected: Document one global .env deployment path | that conflicts with app-scoped env isolation and increases secret leak risk.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: narrow\n\nDirective: Keep deployment docs aligned with @repo/env loader boundaries when adding new apps or services.\n\nTested: pnpm format:check\n\nTested: pnpm env:check\n\nTested: pnpm check\n\nNot-tested: Real Vault, Docker, Compose, or Kubernetes deployment","tree":{"sha":"5d561d323453996897f1da3adb4dbf0cfba22948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/5d561d323453996897f1da3adb4dbf0cfba22948"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/3c0fe21234e690c444addbafd52d1aecef83d478","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/3c0fe21234e690c444addbafd52d1aecef83d478","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKDNjMGZlMjEyMzRlNjkwYzQ0NGFkZGJhZmQ1MmQxYWVjZWY4M2Q0Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/fc93466f011f1bd4c54c6e9d87f8957e8388711c","sha":"fc93466f011f1bd4c54c6e9d87f8957e8388711c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/fc93466f011f1bd4c54c6e9d87f8957e8388711c"}],"sha":"3c0fe21234e690c444addbafd52d1aecef83d478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/3c0fe21234e690c444addbafd52d1aecef83d478"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/fc93466f011f1bd4c54c6e9d87f8957e8388711c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:21:01Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:21:01Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Centralize app-scoped environment contracts\n\nApps are expected to grow in number, so env handling now has a dedicated package that validates each app''s allowlisted keys and rejects foreign public prefixes or server secrets before they can leak into the wrong runtime.\n\nConstraint: Client apps must not receive server secrets, and each deployment job should inject only the matching app secret group.\n\nRejected: Keep env schemas in contracts/platform | that leaves env ownership ambiguous and encourages broad process.env parsing.\n\nRejected: One global root env blob for all apps | it scales poorly and makes accidental client secret exposure more likely.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: moderate\n\nDirective: Add new app env through packages/env/src/apps/<app>.ts and env/<environment>/<app>.env.example; do not read process.env across feature code.\n\nTested: pnpm check\n\nTested: pnpm build\n\nTested: foreign env rejection through @repo/env loaders from app workspaces\n\nNot-tested: Real hosted secret-group configuration","tree":{"sha":"107296af8dbf18e53a7d97347b9c80ef4355dbb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/107296af8dbf18e53a7d97347b9c80ef4355dbb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/fc93466f011f1bd4c54c6e9d87f8957e8388711c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/fc93466f011f1bd4c54c6e9d87f8957e8388711c","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGZjOTM0NjZmMDExZjFiZDRjNTRjNmU5ZDg3Zjg5NTdlODM4ODcxMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/dcf835fa9c351b8997928046cb0899db4b5732b5","sha":"dcf835fa9c351b8997928046cb0899db4b5732b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/dcf835fa9c351b8997928046cb0899db4b5732b5"}],"sha":"fc93466f011f1bd4c54c6e9d87f8957e8388711c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/fc93466f011f1bd4c54c6e9d87f8957e8388711c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/dcf835fa9c351b8997928046cb0899db4b5732b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:12:23Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:12:23Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Raise the template quality gate\n\nThe template should fail early on loose typing, lint drift, and inconsistent formatting, so the root gate now combines Biome lint, TypeScript type checks, Biome/Prettier format checks, and design brief validation.\n\nConstraint: TypeScript index-signature safety conflicts with Biome''s useLiteralKeys hint for process.env, so type-safety wins and that style rule is disabled.\n\nRejected: Keep Prettier out entirely | user explicitly requested Prettier as part of the quality baseline.\n\nRejected: Leave console.log in bootstrap and scripts | noConsole should be a real gate, with structured or stdout/stderr output used intentionally.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: moderate\n\nDirective: Do not loosen tsconfig.base.json or Biome error rules without adding a narrower package-level exception and documenting why.\n\nTested: pnpm check\n\nTested: pnpm build\n\nNot-tested: Tauri native Rust packaging, Expo native device runtime","tree":{"sha":"328914c54f9b4dac4621d627e2dd9613dc49e9b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/328914c54f9b4dac4621d627e2dd9613dc49e9b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/dcf835fa9c351b8997928046cb0899db4b5732b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/dcf835fa9c351b8997928046cb0899db4b5732b5","node_id":"C_kwDOSLiwcdoAKGRjZjgzNWZhOWMzNTFiODk5NzkyODA0NmNiMDg5OWRiNGI1NzMyYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo/turbo-template/commit/dec3eb734c6ee78ddb202dd82e2511efab9cb950","sha":"dec3eb734c6ee78ddb202dd82e2511efab9cb950","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/dec3eb734c6ee78ddb202dd82e2511efab9cb950"}],"sha":"dcf835fa9c351b8997928046cb0899db4b5732b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/dcf835fa9c351b8997928046cb0899db4b5732b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/commits/dec3eb734c6ee78ddb202dd82e2511efab9cb950/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:07:36Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:07:36Z","email":"vo0v0000@naver.com","name":"de-novo"},"message":"Establish reusable fullstack template foundation\n\nThis repository starts as a product-ready template rather than an app-specific codebase, so the initial commit centralizes the stack, package boundaries, generated design brief, rename workflow, and verification scripts before FITT-specific work begins.\n\nConstraint: Repository was empty, so this is the first canonical baseline for future projects.\n\nConstraint: Template keeps @repo as the default package scope while project name, slug, and scope can be rewritten by script.\n\nRejected: Copy build output and local caches | generated artifacts make the template noisy and stale.\n\nRejected: Per-app ORM/auth/client ownership | central packages keep API types, auth contracts, DB access, and shared clients reusable for web, API, desktop, and mobile surfaces.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: broad\n\nDirective: Keep app-local code thin; shared contracts, auth, DB, clients, design-system, platform, and infrastructure belong under packages/.\n\nTested: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n\nTested: pnpm check\n\nTested: pnpm design:lint\n\nNot-tested: Tauri native Rust build, Expo native device runtime, live PostgreSQL migration against an external DATABASE_URL","tree":{"sha":"a02d420e3c84999a44e1773e204dc786ace23978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/trees/a02d420e3c84999a44e1773e204dc786ace23978"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/de-novo/turbo-template/git/commits/dec3eb734c6ee78ddb202dd82e2511efab9cb950","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63547292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/de-novo","id":63547292,"login":"de-novo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQ3Mjky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-novo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://