w","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/f7f9e6f6e14819a508e648523beb2b9c1234db2a","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGY3ZjllNmY2ZTE0ODE5YTUwOGU2NDg1MjNiZWIyYjljMTIzNGRiMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/621e5846c77c1bea6ed98f5acf165fa6eeca9a2c","sha":"621e5846c77c1bea6ed98f5acf165fa6eeca9a2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/621e5846c77c1bea6ed98f5acf165fa6eeca9a2c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/29c39fa46b071b368a8cb722e4fbaaf82081aa70","sha":"29c39fa46b071b368a8cb722e4fbaaf82081aa70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/29c39fa46b071b368a8cb722e4fbaaf82081aa70"}],"sha":"f7f9e6f6e14819a508e648523beb2b9c1234db2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/f7f9e6f6e14819a508e648523beb2b9c1234db2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/29c39fa46b071b368a8cb722e4fbaaf82081aa70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T01:59:48Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T02:00:28Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"fix(adr-218): el plano de control deja de contar un corpus que no alcanza\n\nEste endpoint contaba el volumen de la retícula sobre `okf_concepts` del Cold-Tier.\nMedido el 2026-08-19: **0 filas en total, para todos los tenants** —la capa\ndestilada nunca ha producido un concepto—, mientras tenant1 tenía 3 documentos\ncargados. La retícula pintaba sus siete columnas como «vacío», que es exactamente\nlo que D-218.7 existe para impedir: el dibujo dejó de medir y empezó a afirmar.\n\nEl corpus real vive en `kdb.documents` del hot-tier DE CADA TENANT (ADR-210\nD-210.2), y este plano no tiene —ni debe tener— conexión a esos hot-tiers. Añadir\naquí una credencial por tenant para contar sería reintroducir el acoplamiento que\nADR-206 y ADR-210 cerraron. El reparto correcto es taxonomía y geometría desde\naquí por S2S, y volumen local: lo cuenta tenant-admin-panel contra su propia base\n(teseo-bot/tenant-admin-panel#36, mismo día).\n\nOmitir `volumen` y `volumen_error` es seguro en cualquier orden de despliegue: la\nmatriz lee `volumen?.[slug] ?? null`, así que una clave ausente se dibuja «sin\ndato» y nunca 0. Un panel viejo contra este plano nuevo enseña un hueco honesto en\nvez de la cifra falsa que enseña hoy.\n\n`normalizarVolumen` se muda con el corpus que cuenta, y sus cuatro pruebas con\nella: dejarla aquí sin llamantes sería el tipo de código muerto que este programa\nya paga caro. `withTenant` sigue en uso en las seis rutas de /api/kdb.\n\n301 pruebas node en verde + 17 de vitest, `tsc --noEmit` con los 2 errores\npreexistentes de `lib/services/membership.test.ts` y ninguno nuevo, `next lint`\nsin avisos, `next build` correcto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e953139ba638ba839a6389706b57c812c3f4923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/7e953139ba638ba839a6389706b57c812c3f4923"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/29c39fa46b071b368a8cb722e4fbaaf82081aa70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/29c39fa46b071b368a8cb722e4fbaaf82081aa70","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDI5YzM5ZmE0NmIwNzFiMzY4YThjYjcyMmU0