eb-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/621e5846c77c1bea6ed98f5acf165fa6eeca9a2c","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDYyMWU1ODQ2Yzc3YzFiZWE2ZWQ5OGY1YWNmMTY1ZmE2ZWVjYTlhMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/fe5a3a9010f121673a48050800d3e9c23ed0a1b2","sha":"fe5a3a9010f121673a48050800d3e9c23ed0a1b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/fe5a3a9010f121673a48050800d3e9c23ed0a1b2"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/b71b1858d08f11b0479f158262949ce2d19e04a7","sha":"b71b1858d08f11b0479f158262949ce2d19e04a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/b71b1858d08f11b0479f158262949ce2d19e04a7"}],"sha":"621e5846c77c1bea6ed98f5acf165fa6eeca9a2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/621e5846c77c1bea6ed98f5acf165fa6eeca9a2c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/b71b1858d08f11b0479f158262949ce2d19e04a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T06:03:44Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T06:03:44Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"ci: serializar los deploys del plano de control con `concurrency`\n\nEste workflow no declaraba `concurrency`, así que dos merges seguidos a `main`\ndisparaban dos runs que competían por el mismo servicio de Cloud Run: la revisión que\nacaba sirviendo es la del run que TERMINA último, no la del commit más nuevo.\n\nPasó en `context-kdb-orchestrator` el 2026-08-20, medido contra Cloud Run: merges a las\n23:00:58 (`2ae3a2e`) y 23:01:07 (`2649677`) —nueve segundos— y tres revisiones en cinco\nminutos. Quedó sirviendo la correcta sólo porque la del código viejo estuvo lista 11 s\nantes que la intermedia: orden de llegada, no diseño. Con el orden invertido, producción\nse habría quedado con el código anterior y los dos runs en verde.\n\nENCOLA (`cancel-in-progress: false`): cortar un deploy a media promoción puede dejar la\nrevisión a medias, y esperar sólo cuesta minutos. Encolar no sacrifica el commit nuevo —\nGitHub conserva un único run pendiente por grupo y el más reciente desplaza al que\nesperaba, así que el último commit sigue ganando, ahora por construcción.\n\nEl grupo va LITERAL, no `${{ env.SERVICE_NAME }}`: el contexto `env` no está disponible en\n`concurrency` —ni a nivel de workflow (sólo `github`, `inputs`, `vars`) ni de job— y una\nreferencia a `env` ahí no falla, se expande a cadena VACÍA y mete todos los workflows del\nrepo en el mismo grupo. El proyecto va en el nombre por la misma razón: hoy este repo\ndespliega un solo servicio, pero `tenant-admin-panel` y `context-kdb-compiler` ya\ndespliegan el MISMO nombre de servicio a dos proyectos desde un solo repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4aa854ec5db2e717f194af833a7fd39a803d7e37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/4aa854ec5db2e717f194af833a7fd39a803d7e37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/b71b1858d08f11b0479f158262949ce2d19e04a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/b71b1858d08f11b0479f158262949ce2d19e04a7","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGI3MWIxODU4ZDA4ZjExYjA0NzlmMTU4MjYyOTQ5Y2UyZDE5ZTA0YT