XNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/fe5a3a9010f121673a48050800d3e9c23ed0a1b2","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGZlNWEzYTkwMTBmMTIxNjczYTQ4MDUwODAwZDNlOWMyM2VkMGExYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/c38e3570fd3bcb47ce9fea8cd9597a0596abb397","sha":"c38e3570fd3bcb47ce9fea8cd9597a0596abb397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/c38e3570fd3bcb47ce9fea8cd9597a0596abb397"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/0885a0e548f913690355f19b5655dc496cc9336f","sha":"0885a0e548f913690355f19b5655dc496cc9336f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/0885a0e548f913690355f19b5655dc496cc9336f"}],"sha":"fe5a3a9010f121673a48050800d3e9c23ed0a1b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/fe5a3a9010f121673a48050800d3e9c23ed0a1b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/0885a0e548f913690355f19b5655dc496cc9336f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T07:10:26Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T07:10:26Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(adr-220): el catálogo de proyectos, y el eje que sí acota (3 de 3)\n\nFase 2 de ADR-220, último tercio y EL INTERRUPTOR. Hasta ahora la columna\n(compiler#23) y el filtro (orchestrator#95) estaban mergeados e inertes: sin\nproyectos que servir, `usaProyectos` era false en todas partes y las consultas\nquedaban idénticas. Esto es lo que los enciende.\n\n`016_tenant_projects.sql` — catálogo por tenant, hermano de `tenant_brands`, más\n`tenant_channels.project_id`. Esa columna es la costura de D-220.3: el proyecto\nentra por la identidad de la CONVERSACIÓN y nunca por el schema de una tool, así\nque una instrucción colada en un mensaje o en un documento no puede moverlo.\n\n⛔ Tabla propia y no `campaigns` (D-220.4): `campaign_resolver.ts` la AUTO-CREA por\ncanal con el nombre «Inbound Orgánico - whatsapp». Un catálogo que el runtime puede\ninventar no es un catálogo — el selector enseñaría campañas fantasma.\n\n`construirEjeProyecto` se diferencia de la marca en tres cosas, y las tres importan:\n\n  · basta UN proyecto para que haya eje. Con una sola marca no hay decisión que\n    tomar; con un solo cliente sí — su material no es la metodología común.\n  · `es_default: false` (D-220.2): el vacío sigue siendo «base del tenant» y sigue\n    siendo el mismo predicado, pero deja de ser el valor inicial. El panel no\n    preselecciona nada y bloquea la carga hasta elegir. Con marcas, equivocarse\n    cuesta relevancia; con proyectos, confidencialidad entre clientes que compiten.\n  · la copia nombra a quién alcanza, no cómo se llama la columna.\n\n⚠️ UN TENANT CON LOS DOS EJES NO SE SIRVE A MEDIAS. La superficie dibuja UN paso de\nalcance, así que elegir uno en silencio haría desaparecer el otro selector —y con él\nla posibilidad de acotar por ese eje— sin que nadie se entere. D-220.1 dice\nexplícitamente que ese caso llegará; lo que no puede es llegar callado. Se sirve\ncomo `alcance_error`, que el panel ya pinta en tono de aviso.\n\nLa lectura de `tenant_projects` va guardada por `to_regclass`: la 016 no la aplica\nningún CD, y sin la guarda este endpoint —del que depende TODA la pantalla de\nconocimiento— daría 500 en cualquier entorno sin migrar.\n\n299 pruebas en verde (6 nuevas), `tsc` sin errores nuevos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33b7de30b1c28f2150c314ba12bdaa989ff2f17b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/33b7de30b1c28f2150c314ba12bdaa989ff2f17b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/0885a0e548f913690355f19b5655dc496cc9336f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/0885a0e548f913690355f19b5655dc496cc9336f","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDA4ODVhMGU1NDhmOTEzNjkwMzU1ZjE5YjU2NTVkYzQ5NmNjOTMzNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/c38e3570fd3bcb47ce9fea8cd9597a0596abb397","sha":"c38e3570fd3bcb47ce9fea8cd9597a0596abb397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/c38e3570fd3bcb47ce9fea8cd9597a0596abb397"}],"sha":"0885a0e548f913690355f19b5655dc496cc9336f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/0885a0e548f913690355f19b5655dc496cc9336f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":