7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/ede9a1f7df53eb0c7e3f4dea50be730664b37427"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/23526b97f918a82f8f9504862f8b5a0c4f25ffd5","sha":"23526b97f918a82f8f9504862f8b5a0c4f25ffd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/23526b97f918a82f8f9504862f8b5a0c4f25ffd5"}],"sha":"5113ea38ddd6390e7197044d47d4fa07b896ef60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/5113ea38ddd6390e7197044d47d4fa07b896ef60"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/23526b97f918a82f8f9504862f8b5a0c4f25ffd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T04:19:14Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T04:19:14Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"fix(tenants): el formulario hablaba contra cinco columnas que no existen\n\nGuardar un tenant nunca funcionó. Tras destrabar la validación (#21) y la doble\nconversión de la whitelist (#22), la ejecución llegó por fin al SQL — y ahí estaba\nel fallo de verdad.\n\n`SELECT ... telegram_bot_token, telegram_whitelisted_group_ids, suspension_status,\nsuspension_reason, suspension_message FROM tenants`\n\nNinguna de esas cinco columnas existe en el plano de control. Las columnas reales son:\n`id, name, status, created_at, orchestrator_url, api_key_vault_id, domain, updated_at,\nidp_project_id, idp_tenant_id`.\n\n## Por qué faltan\n\nLas añaden `migrations/001_tenant_settings_and_behavior.sql` y\n`migrations/002_branding_and_suspension.sql` — el directorio que **NO corre nadie**.\nEl runner sólo aplica `migrations-gcp/`, con lista explícita. Es exactamente la\ntrampa de las dos carpetas de migraciones, otra vez.\n\n## El fallo era doble, y la mitad era silenciosa\n\n- El **UPDATE** reventaba con 42703 y salía como toast: visible.\n- El **SELECT** reventaba igual, pero su `catch` lo convertía en `null`, y el\n  formulario se pintaba VACÍO para un tenant que sí tenía nombre y estado. Parecía\n  «faltan datos por capturar» cuando era «la consulta no corre». Es la séptima vez\n  de ese patrón en este programa: un `catch` que convierte un error de esquema en\n  «no hay datos».\n\n## Qué cambia\n\nLas dos consultas usan sólo columnas que existen. Y los dos campos de Telegram salen\ndel formulario: no se reponen con una migración **a propósito**, porque el modelo real\nya existe y es mejor — `tenant_channels` guarda una fila por canal, con marca\n(ADR-215) y activo/inactivo, y es de donde el orquestador saca el token de verdad.\nDar de alta un tenant es identidad; configurar sus canales es otra cosa.\n\n## Lo que NO arregla, y hay que saberlo\n\nLa pestaña **Kill Switch** escribe `suspension_status/reason/message`, que tampoco\nexisten: su guardado seguirá fallando. Se deja intacta porque quitarla es decisión de\nproducto, no de este arreglo. Medido de paso: **nadie aplica la suspensión** en\nningún repo — es otra función que sólo existe en su propio formulario.\n\nVerificado: `tsc` sin errores nuevos, 293/293 tests, `next build` en verde.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a238e3abcc983915052b43376dde293ae061c26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/4a238e3abcc983915052b43376dde293ae061c26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/23526b97f918a82f8f9504862f8b5a0c4f25ffd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/23526b97f918a82f8f9504862f8b5a0c4f25ffd5","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDIzNTI2Yjk3ZjkxOGE4MmY4Zjk1MDQ4NjJmOGI1YTBjNGYyNWZmZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/ede9a1f7df53eb0c7e3f4dea50be730664b37427","sha":"ede9a1f7df53eb0c7e3f4dea50be730664b37427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant