site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/ede9a1f7df53eb0c7e3f4dea50be730664b37427","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGVkZTlhMWY3ZGY1M2ViMGM3ZTNmNGRlYTUwYmU3MzA2NjRiMzc0Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/cf0346d0836b0789d6dd26bbb39ecdc2a7294b9b","sha":"cf0346d0836b0789d6dd26bbb39ecdc2a7294b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/cf0346d0836b0789d6dd26bbb39ecdc2a7294b9b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/6cbcaae6387b45e23c5200c3974c85059d1b0a0d","sha":"6cbcaae6387b45e23c5200c3974c85059d1b0a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/6cbcaae6387b45e23c5200c3974c85059d1b0a0d"}],"sha":"ede9a1f7df53eb0c7e3f4dea50be730664b37427","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/ede9a1f7df53eb0c7e3f4dea50be730664b37427"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/6cbcaae6387b45e23c5200c3974c85059d1b0a0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T04:09:23Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T04:09:23Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"fix(tenants): la whitelist de Telegram se convertía dos veces y reventaba el guardado\n\n«Failed to update operation settings: telegramWhitelistedGroupIds.split is not a\nfunction». El componente hacía `.split('','')` y mandaba un ARRAY a la server action,\nque volvía a hacerle `.split('','')` encima.\n\nEl bug es anterior, pero estaba tapado: hasta que el formulario dejó de exigir\ndominio, orquestador y bot (PR #21), la validación nunca pasaba y la ejecución no\nllegaba a la acción. Destrabar la validación destapó el siguiente fallo de la fila.\n\n## Una sola conversión, en un solo sitio\n\n`lib/tenants/telegram-whitelist.ts`. El componente manda el texto TAL CUAL, que es\nlo que su propio tipo dice (`z.string().optional()`); era él quien violaba su\ncontrato.\n\n## Y tolera las dos formas, a propósito\n\n`normalizarWhitelist` acepta texto y array. El componente es cliente y su bundle se\ncachea en el navegador: durante la ventana de despliegue habrá pestañas abiertas\nmandando todavía el array. Tolerarlo evita un error incomprensible a quien no haya\nrecargado. No es laxitud: es la forma real del despliegue, y acabamos de verla en\nvivo con este mismo formulario.\n\nTests: 6 casos en `__tests__/lib/tenants/telegram-whitelist.test.ts` —incluida la\nidempotencia y el array del cliente viejo—, dentro del glob que `test:node` ya\nrecoge desde el PR #21. Suite completa 293/293, `tsc` sin errores nuevos,\n`next build` en verde.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99fc32cce379bf6d1061848ebacccac375118100","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/99fc32cce379bf6d1061848ebacccac375118100"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/6cbcaae6387b45e23c5200c3974c85059d1b0a0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/6cbcaae6387b45e23c5200c3974c85059d1b0a0d","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDZjYmNhYWU2Mzg3YjQ1ZTIzYzUyMDBjMzk3NGM4NTA1OWQxYjBhMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/cf0346d0836b0789d6dd26bbb39ecdc2a7294b9b","sha":"cf0346d0836b0789d6dd26bbb39ecdc2a7294b9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/cf0346d0836b0789d6dd26bbb39ecdc2a7294b9b"}],"sha":"6cbcaae6387b45e23c5200c3974c85059d1b0a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/6