","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-19T01:00:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/33bd3261dc28a49c5838ccbed6334d85d0cf0e54","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDMzYmQzMjYxZGMyOGE0OWM1ODM4Y2NiZWQ2MzM0ZDg1ZDBjZjBlNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/2e02b5dc2983bf44454783c88a4a8d3ee9677288","sha":"2e02b5dc2983bf44454783c88a4a8d3ee9677288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/2e02b5dc2983bf44454783c88a4a8d3ee9677288"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/de36ac1443e3b5e659030e2d6a198c0cbd7730e1","sha":"de36ac1443e3b5e659030e2d6a198c0cbd7730e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/de36ac1443e3b5e659030e2d6a198c0cbd7730e1"}],"sha":"33bd3261dc28a49c5838ccbed6334d85d0cf0e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/33bd3261dc28a49c5838ccbed6334d85d0cf0e54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/de36ac1443e3b5e659030e2d6a198c0cbd7730e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:59:50Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:59:50Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(adr-218): la retícula HOCFLIT sale de hocflit_blocks, y es la primera vez que alguien lee esa tabla\n\nD-218.2 — `hocflit_blocks` es la fuente única de la taxonomía y de la geometría.\nLa 012 se aplicó el 2026-08-05 con sus 40 filas, y hasta hoy no la leía nadie:\nsólo aparecía en la lista explícita del runner de migraciones.\n\nNuevo endpoint S2S `GET /api/internal/hocflit-reticula`. Va por la costura que ya\nexistía (`/api/internal/user-modules`, `/api/internal/tenant/aliados`) en vez de dar\nal panel del tenant una credencial contra el plano de control, que reintroduciría\nel acoplamiento que ADR-206 cerró.\n\nDos orígenes con destinos de fallo distintos, a propósito:\n- taxonomía y geometría desde `hocflit_blocks` (plano de control) — si falla, 500:\n  sin retícula no hay página.\n- volumen por sistema desde `okf_concepts` (Cold-Tier, RLS por tenant) — si falla,\n  `volumen: null` y 200: la retícula se dibuja sin cifras.\n\n`volumen: null` NUNCA degrada a ceros. Un 0 dibujado afirma «este sistema está\nvacío», que es justo la medición que D-218.7 quiere que el diagrama haga; escribir\nun 0 donde hubo un error convierte el instrumento en una afirmación falsa.\n\nEn código no queda ni un rótulo ni una descripción: lo único que se declara aquí es\nel orden de lectura (techo → transversal → columnas → piso), y el orden de las cinco\ncolumnas se deriva del acrónimo ''HOCFLIT'' en vez de listarse a mano.\n\n⚠️ D-218.5: la respuesta lleva `geometria_es_interpretacion_propia: true` para que la\ncondición de rotulado no dependa de que alguien recuerde el ADR. En las 30 páginas\ndel extracto del autor, «piso» y «techo» aparecen 0 veces.\n\nTests: 9 casos en __tests__/lib/kdb/reticula.test.ts, dentro del glob que test:node\nya recoge. Suite completa 275/275.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9abe02c10715aac05d68e11271f2f1730f63e47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/a9abe02c10715aac05d68e11271f2f1730f63e47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/de36ac1443e3b5e659030e2d6a198c0cbd7730e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw",