eo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/d29cacd877922452a94c2ba989b20e7d1919430f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:02:49Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:02:49Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"fix(invitaciones): el correo nombraba a quien invita con su uid\n\nEl cuerpo interpolaba `invitedBy`, que es el uid de Identity Platform del admin que\ninvita. A quien recibe la invitación un uid no le dice nada: leía «Has sido invitado\npor bJ2k…». Viene de la migración GCP-Native (003acac5), cuando el identificador dejó\nde ser un correo.\n\n`invitedBy` sigue siendo el uid — es lo que guardan `tenant_invitations.invited_by` y\nla auditoría, y ahí es lo correcto. Lo que cambia es cómo se NOMBRA en el correo:\nentra `invitedByLabel` con el correo del admin. Si no hay correo, la frase no nombra a\nnadie en vez de caer al uid.\n\nDe paso se escapa lo que se interpola en el HTML: el rol viene de lista blanca, pero el\nnombre de quien invita sale del IdP y no se da por seguro.\n\nQueda pendiente el mismo problema en la página de auditoría, que pinta `actorId` y\n`targetUser` en crudo — necesita resolver uid → correo y va aparte.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5274b05cb02249e464a02ec9a9bce07590ab281d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/5274b05cb02249e464a02ec9a9bce07590ab281d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/d29cacd877922452a94c2ba989b20e7d1919430f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/d29cacd877922452a94c2ba989b20e7d1919430f","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGQyOWNhY2Q4Nzc5MjI0NTJhOTRjMmJhOTg5YjIwZTdkMTkxOTQzMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/dd8d07da8d43e56953ec2c2a9df3377382c499db","sha":"dd8d07da8d43e56953ec2c2a9df3377382c499db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/dd8d07da8d43e56953ec2c2a9df3377382c499db"}],"sha":"d29cacd877922452a94c2ba989b20e7d1919430f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/d29cacd877922452a94c2ba989b20e7d1919430f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/dd8d07da8d43e56953ec2c2a9df3377382c499db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:02:35Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T20:02:35Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"fix(ui): la cabecera del menú de usuario dejaba la página en blanco\n\n`Menu.GroupLabel` de Base UI exige un `Menu.Group` por encima: sin él lanza el error\n#31 durante el render y, como no hay error boundary, se lleva por delante el árbol\nentero. La página no fallaba al cargar — fallaba al pulsar el avatar del pie de la\nbarra lateral, que está en todas las pantallas.\n\nLo introdujo el sistema de diseño (8bc65f92), que sustituyó el `<div>` de la cabecera\ndel menú por `<DropdownMenuLabel>` fuera de todo grupo. En Radix `DropdownMenu.Label`\nfunciona suelto; en Base UI no. La migración se trajo el idiom de Radix.\n\nSe separan los dos casos para que el de cabecera no pueda volver a reventar:\n`DropdownMenuLabel` es un `<div>` sin contexto y `DropdownMenuGroupLabel` envuelve el\nprimitivo para el caso real de grupo etiquetado.\n\nEn users-table-columns el grupo envolvía sólo a la etiqueta, sin ítems: no aportaba\nasociación accesible ninguna, así que se quita en vez de crecerlo.\n\nVerificado renderizando el componente suelto: antes lanza «MenuGroupRootContext is\nmissing», después emite el `<div>`. Idéntico al arreglo del panel del tenant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"273fc1e19d8fe2b5acfc733395dc827b162f5c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/273fc1e19d8fe2b5acfc733395dc827b162f5c05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/dd8d07da8d43e56953ec2c2a9df3377382c499db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/dd8d07da8d43e56953ec2c2a9df3377382c499db","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGRkOGQwN2RhOGQ0M2U1Njk1M2VjMmMyYTlkZjMzNzczODJjNDk5ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/