","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/a673bc6f996bdd3dfc675d986ae5ed3533a44066","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGE2NzNiYzZmOTk2YmRkM2RmYzY3NWQ5ODZhZTVlZDM1MzNhNDQwNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/85c92860f5baa44538770e4e1d86f58d13f47928","sha":"85c92860f5baa44538770e4e1d86f58d13f47928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/85c92860f5baa44538770e4e1d86f58d13f47928"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/be237790d050124dc4562405bfe52bf5b036895f","sha":"be237790d050124dc4562405bfe52bf5b036895f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/be237790d050124dc4562405bfe52bf5b036895f"}],"sha":"a673bc6f996bdd3dfc675d986ae5ed3533a44066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/a673bc6f996bdd3dfc675d986ae5ed3533a44066"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/be237790d050124dc4562405bfe52bf5b036895f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T17:00:48Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T17:00:48Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(ui): logotipo oficial de micontexto, favicon e icono de iOS\n\nEntran los archivos de marca y el componente pasa a servirlos en vez de la\ncomposición de respaldo. Verificado en pantalla, claro y oscuro.\n\nTres cosas que había que ajustar para que cargaran:\n\n- **Los nombres.** Los archivos llegaron como `micontexto_marca.svg` y\n  `micontexto_obscuro.svg` (guion bajo, «obscuro» con b); el componente buscaba\n  `-marca` y `-oscuro`. Se adapta el componente a los nombres reales, que son\n  los que se van a volver a exportar desde la fuente de la marca, en vez de\n  renombrar los archivos.\n\n- **El naranja.** `docs/plan-teseo-branding.md` decía `#FF9A00`; los SVG traen\n  `#ff9900`. Manda el archivo: el respaldo compuesto y el punto tienen que\n  coincidir con la marca, no con el documento.\n\n- **La ubicación del favicon.** `apple-icon.png` estaba en `public/`, donde no\n  hace nada: Next.js reconoce `icon.svg` y `apple-icon.png` por convención sólo\n  dentro de `app/`. Movido, y `icon.svg` creado a partir del cuadro de la marca\n  — a 16×16 el logotipo completo es una mancha ilegible.\n\nSe retira `app/favicon.ico`: era el genérico que trae la plantilla de Next\n(mismo md5 en los tres paneles) y competía con `icon.svg` en la etiqueta `<link>`.\n\nEl modo oscuro funciona con los dos archivos entregados. Queda anotado en\n`public/README-logo.md` que con el texto en `currentColor` bastaría uno solo.\n\n266 pruebas en verde, build de producción correcto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8600a154202dd3e5e1edc13ff15d85ac99cd7443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/8600a154202dd3e5e1edc13ff15d85ac99cd7443"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/be237790d050124dc4562405bfe52bf5b036895f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/be237790d050124dc4562405bfe52bf5b036895f","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGJlMjM3NzkwZDA1MDEyNGRjNDU2MjQwNWJmZTUyYmY1YjAzNjg5NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/aed01cd703cb8dfeb4daed8a941768ad5f73a3dd","sha":"aed01cd703cb8dfeb4daed8a941768ad5f73a3dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/aed01cd703cb8dfeb4daed8a941768ad5f73a3dd"}],"sha":"be237790d050124dc4562405bfe52bf5b036895f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/be237790d050124dc4562405bfe52bf5b036895f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/aed01cd703cb8dfeb4daed8a941768ad5f73a3dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T16:40:05Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T16:40:05Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(ui): logotipo de micontexto en el plano de control\n\nSustituye el monograma provisional por la marca real: cuadro naranja con «mi»,\nla palabra «contexto» y el punto naranja. En la cabecera del sidebar y en la\npantalla de acceso, que hasta ahora no decía de quién era el producto.\n\n**El archivo oficial todavía no está en el repositorio**, así que el componente\nlo compone con la tipografía de la aplicación. La estructura, el color\n(`#FF9A00`), los tamaños y el comportamiento en claro/oscuro sí son los\ndefinitivos; lo único aproximado son los trazos de la letra. En cuanto se deje\nel SVG en `public/micontexto.svg` lo toma solo, sin tocar ningún sitio de uso —\n`public/README-logo.md` documenta las rutas.\n\nLa detección del archivo se hace cargándolo, no con `onError` sobre un `<img>`\nya renderizado: ese error ocurre antes de la hidratación, React no lo recibe y\nlo que queda en pantalla es el icono de imagen rota. Comprobado.\n\nDos decisiones: el naranja del logotipo es **fijo, no `--primary`** —el plano de\ncontrol es una aplicación de micontexto, no un panel con marca blanca, y su\nlogotipo no debe moverse cuando un tenant cambia su color—, y «contexto» hereda\nel color del texto para que no desaparezca en modo oscuro.\n\n**Y un hueco de la sesión anterior.** El rediseño del shell tocó `AppSidebar`,\nque sólo usa `/finops`; casi todo el plano de control vive en el grupo de rutas\n`(control-panel)` y usa `ControlPanelSidebar`, que quedó sin tocar. Ahora tiene\nla misma densidad y, sobre todo, **estado activo**: antes ninguna entrada se\nmarcaba y no había forma de saber en qué sección estabas salvo por el título.\nRótulos en español: «Platform Admin» → nada, «Control Panel» → «Resumen»,\n«Users» → «Usuarios», «Tenants» → «Cuentas».\n\n266 pruebas en verde, build de producción correcto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9708d7a9e3e0eeda2ab47c7736e537ab999d0d4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/9708d7a9e3e0eeda2ab47c7736e537ab999d0d4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/aed01cd703cb8dfeb4daed8a941768ad5f73a3dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/aed01cd703cb8dfeb4daed8a941768ad5f73a3dd","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGFlZDAxY2Q3MDNjYjhkZmViNGRhZWQ4YTk0MTc2OGFkNWY3M2EzZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/7de58ad0c065c1ee196897cd69bd3d495f677054","sha":"7de58ad0c065c1ee196897cd69bd3d495f677054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/7de58ad0c065c1ee196897cd69bd3d495f677054"}],"sha":"aed01cd703cb8dfeb4daed8a941768ad5f73a3dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/aed01cd703cb8dfeb4daed8a941768ad5f73a3dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/7de58ad0c065c1ee196897cd69bd3d495f677054/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T16:18:00Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T16:18:00Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"fix(ui): los modificadores de opacidad sobre tokens pintaban transparente\n\nMismo defecto que en tenant-admin-panel, medido en el navegador: con\n`primary: \"var(--primary)\"` a secas, `bg-primary/10` genera\n`rgb(var(--primary) / 0.1)`; la variable guarda un `oklch(...)` completo, la\ndeclaración es inválida y el navegador la descarta. Aquí eran **174 clases**\npintando transparente sin un solo error en consola.\n\nLos tokens se resuelven ahora con `color-mix(in oklab, …)` cuando hay\nmodificador. La paleta sigue en oklch y el branding por tenant sigue\nfuncionando.\n\n266 pruebas en verde, build de producción correcto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bb49ed1f5511267a32fa40105b3bbbce8ff85d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/4bb49ed1f5511267a32fa40105b3bbbce8ff85d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/7de58ad0c065c1ee196897cd69bd3d495f677054","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","follower