seo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/8bc65f927de79a02f4dc52d6312aaeacfa14d442/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T05:41:43Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T05:41:43Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(ui): mismo sistema de diseño que el panel del tenant\n\nAplica al plano de control la paleta, la tipografía y el shell que se acaban de\nasentar en tenant-admin-panel, para que un cliente que vea las dos aplicaciones\nvea el mismo producto.\n\n- Tokens de `globals.css` y `tailwind.config.ts` alineados. Con `sidebar` y\n  `chart-*` ya registrados como colores, las clases `bg-sidebar` y\n  `text-sidebar-foreground` que el primitivo de shadcn ya usaba dejan de ser\n  letra muerta.\n- 211 colores literales en 26 archivos mapeados a tokens semánticos.\n- Los tres `--primary` azules hardcodeados de `/api/tenant/config` pasan a null:\n  sin fila en `tenant_configs` manda el sistema de diseño, no un color inventado\n  por la API.\n- Sidebar a 216px con riel de 2px en el activo; barra superior a 48px.\n- Geist Sans y Geist Mono locales en vez de Inter desde Google.\n- Menú en español sin jerga: «Global Admin / Users» → «Administración /\n  Usuarios». El título por defecto deja de ser «Mission Control».\n- `test:node` es una lista explícita de rutas: registrado `lib/theme/**` para que\n  las pruebas nuevas del tema corran de verdad. 263 en verde.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13a9e8c746ca6657ff94bdc3832ee49cae52a66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/13a9e8c746ca6657ff94bdc3832ee49cae52a66b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/8bc65f927de79a02f4dc52d6312aaeacfa14d442","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/8bc65f927de79a02f4dc52d6312aaeacfa14d442","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDhiYzY1ZjkyN2RlNzlhMDJmNGRjNTJkNjMxMmFhZWFjZmExNGQ0NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/85c92860f5baa44538770e4e1d86f58d13f47928","sha":"85c92860f5baa44538770e4e1d86f58d13f47928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/85c9286