/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/e6e76469ff25a315c0f9ad9cc960ccd0daf9296b","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGU2ZTc2NDY5ZmYyNWEzMTVjMGY5YWQ5Y2M5NjBjY2QwZGFmOTI5NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/5f0572051210a289501476d2f0006164f5c9efd9","sha":"5f0572051210a289501476d2f0006164f5c9efd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/5f0572051210a289501476d2f0006164f5c9efd9"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/3c811389a3f49247a85aecd164a2a6a3f7ed4f15","sha":"3c811389a3f49247a85aecd164a2a6a3f7ed4f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/3c811389a3f49247a85aecd164a2a6a3f7ed4f15"}],"sha":"e6e76469ff25a315c0f9ad9cc960ccd0daf9296b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/e6e76469ff25a315c0f9ad9cc960ccd0daf9296b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/3c811389a3f49247a85aecd164a2a6a3f7ed4f15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T06:31:18Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T06:31:18Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(adr-215): la marca como dato en el plano de control (WU-1.1)\n\nFleetco y Cargalo son dos MARCAS dentro de tenant1, no dos tenants (ADR-215).\nEsta migracion crea el registro canonico: `tenant_brands` + `tenant_channels.brand_id`.\n\n`tenant_configs` NO se toca: queda como el default del tenant. Cuando un canal no\nresuelve marca, la voz y el branding caen ahi (cascada de WU-3.1). Eso es lo que\npermite desplegar el codigo nuevo sin ventana — anadir el dato activa el camino\nnuevo, quitarlo revierte.\n\nTres decisiones de DDL que no son de estilo:\n\n- `brand_id` NULLABLE a proposito: permite aplicar antes de sembrar, sin romper\n  filas existentes ni exigir ventana. La obligatoriedad la impone el codigo\n  ([INV-215.3]: un canal sin marca resoluble FALLA, no cae a un default).\n- ON DELETE RESTRICT, no CASCADE: borrar una marca con canales vivos debe fallar\n  ruidoso. Un CASCADE apagaria canales en silencio.\n- UNIQUE (tenant_id, slug): dos tenants pueden tener marcas homonimas; uno no\n  puede tener la misma dos veces.\n\n⚠️ Registrada en la lista explicita de `apply-gcp-migrations.ts`. Sin ese paso la\nmigracion no se aplica NUNCA — este repo tiene dos directorios de migraciones y\nsolo corre `migrations-gcp/`.\n\nVerificado contra Postgres real, no a ojo. Base limpia, cadena 001..013: 13/13\naplicadas. Re-corrida idempotente, 0 fallidas. Con 2 marcas x 3 canales sembrados,\nel SQL de resolucion de WU-2.1 devuelve las 6 filas correctas. Y los invariantes\nlos enforcea la BASE, no el codigo:\n\n- [INV-215.1] otra marca reclamando un identificador ya usado -> ERROR 23505\n  (tenant_channels_type_identifier_key). Esto convierte «canal -> marca» en una\n  funcion total por construccion, y es lo que hace que la marca NO tenga que\n  entrar en el thread_id.\n- borrar marca con canales vivos -> ERROR 23503 (RESTRICT).\n- la misma marca dos veces -> ERROR 23505 (tenant_brands_tenant_slug_key).\n- canal sin marca sigue insertable (nullable a proposito).\n\ntsc: 2 errores, los 2 preexistentes. Tests: 238/238, cero saltados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2959d8a6139ebb19ad0bd5cf7a9eb134bbbb20e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/2959d8a6139ebb19ad0bd5cf7a9eb134bbbb20e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/3c811389a3f49247a85aecd164a2a6a3f7ed4f15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/3c811389a3f49247a85aecd164a2a6a3f7ed4f15","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDNjODExMzg5YTNmNDkyNDdhODVhZWNkMTY0YTJhNmEzZjdlZDRmMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/5f0572051210a2895