"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/b4413161f2a0cae906f736b4955f40e79d80a743/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T05:40:15Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T05:40:15Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"chore(deps): retirar Supabase del panel de control\n\nEra el ULTIMO repo del programa con Supabase instalado: tres paquetes en\npackage.json (`@supabase/auth-helpers-nextjs`, `@supabase/ssr`,\n`@supabase/supabase-js`) mas uno en scripts/package.json. Supabase se retiro con\nADR-206 y el plano de control vive en Cloud SQL desde el cutover de comerseg.\n\nSe retira el componente conexo entero, como se hizo en el PR #68 del orquestador,\npara no dejar un arbol de tipos roto:\n\n- `packages/tenant-os/` — un unico archivo, un middleware de auth con\n  `createServerClient` que leia NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL/ANON_KEY. Huerfano\n  verificado: no hay workspaces, no hay path en tsconfig, nadie lo importa, y el\n  `middleware.ts` vivo de la raiz no toca Supabase.\n- `check_prod.mjs`, `clean_tenants.mjs`, `scripts/onboard-tenant.ts`,\n  `scripts/inject_mock_lead.ts` — cuatro scripts sueltos contra la API de\n  Supabase. Ninguno esta declarado en `scripts` de package.json, ni en CI, ni en\n  el Dockerfile; solo los mencionan ADRs historicos, que se conservan.\n- `supabase/.temp/` y `supabase/.branches/` — estado local del CLI de Supabase\n  (project-ref, pooler-url, linked-project.json) apuntando a un proyecto muerto.\n\nNO se toca la historia: `supabase/migrations_backup/` (47 archivos), las\n`migrations/` legado 001-017 que nunca corren, y los ADRs/RFCs se quedan. Son\nregistro, no residuo.\n\nVerificacion: `npm test` 238/238 en verde, cero saltados en la suite de node (los\n4 saltos de vitest son preexistentes, en membership.test.ts). `tsc --noEmit`\ndevuelve 2 errores — exactamente los 2 preexistentes de ese mismo archivo, ya\nmedidos el 2026-08-03. Lockfile regenerado: -121 lineas, cero referencias a\n@supabase.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b1fbcba8ea00ded65ebc20cf2f44f59a2ccc339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/1b1fbcba8ea00ded65ebc20cf2f44f59a2ccc339"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/b4413161f2a0cae906f736b4955f40e79d80a743","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/b4413161f2a0cae906f736b4955f40e79d80a743","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGI0NDEzMTYxZjJhMGNhZTkwNmY3MzZiNDk1NWY0MGU3OWQ4MGE3NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-adm