lo que sugerian los fragmentos\nlegibles: I3 innova DENTRO de una vertical, I4 cruza sistemas.\n\nSe edita la 012 en vez de anadir una 013 porque el PR no esta mergeado y la\nmigracion nunca se aplico a ninguna base: no hay fila que parchear.\n\nRe-verificado contra Postgres desechable: 40 filas, NINGUNA sin descripcion,\n8 grupos x 5 niveles sin huecos, re-aplicacion idempotente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42590a7d04b771c37536c76c5fa33078da227804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/42590a7d04b771c37536c76c5fa33078da227804"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/cbd61cddc72f75092a51c26ee7e0316c5c367d19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/cbd61cddc72f75092a51c26ee7e0316c5c367d19","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGNiZDYxY2RkYzcyZjc1MDkyYTUxYzI2ZWU3ZTAzMTZjNWMzNjdkMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/c6c0b1cbc054e8fc41430cd8974800bc4e2d450c","sha":"c6c0b1cbc054e8fc41430cd8974800bc4e2d450c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/c6c0b1cbc054e8fc41430cd8974800bc4e2d450c"}],"sha":"cbd61cddc72f75092a51c26ee7e0316c5c367d19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/cbd61cddc72f75092a51c26ee7e0316c5c367d19"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/c6c0b1cbc054e8fc41430cd8974800bc4e2d450c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:47:54Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:47:54Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(hocflit): sembrar hocflit_blocks — la taxonomia como dato en el plano de control (D-H2)\n\nLos 40 rotulos del Modelo HOCFLIT (35 bloques + E1-E5 de Direccion Ejecutiva)\ncomo tabla del plano de control, de donde se derivaran prompts de agentes,\nkdb_agent_acls, tarjetas del panel y catalogo comercial. Descripciones tomadas\ndel Anexo B del RFC (docs 8432211).\n\nLa migracion va en migrations-gcp/ (el directorio que corre de verdad contra\nCONTROL_DB_URL) y se registra en apply-gcp-migrations.ts: sin ese registro el\narchivo nunca se aplicaria. migrations/ es el legado Supabase.\n\nDos decisiones que la tabla deja escritas en la base:\n- level es SOFISTICACION 1..5, eje distinto de altitude. Va como COMMENT en la\n  columna porque es el riesgo nombrado en el RFC §7 y ahi lo ve quien haga JOIN.\n- system_slug NULL en E: no es un 8.º slug, se modela sobre la superficie\n  direccion. I3 se siembra con description NULL — el parrafo llego ilegible en\n  la fuente y no se inventa; se completa con el autor en su propia migracion.\n\nVerificado contra Postgres desechable: 40 filas, 8 grupos x 5 niveles sin\nhuecos, re-aplicacion idempotente (INSERT 0 0), unica description NULL = I3,\nlos 7 slugs identicos a HOCFLIT_SYSTEMS de contracts, y las 4 restricciones\nprobadas no-vacuas (placement basura, level 9, slug inexistente y celda\nduplicada: las cuatro rechazadas).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d16137cead26badd059ce7099f8ae4ff6e9386ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/d16137cead26badd059ce7099f8ae4ff6e9386ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/c6c0b1cbc054e8fc41430cd8974800bc4e2d450c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gra