b23fc476b79a4c24d3eb0a913"}],"sha":"a3cbc224f831a51b2ad329a9170688a72083a399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/a3cbc224f831a51b2ad329a9170688a72083a399"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/34681ae04ec6a38b23fc476b79a4c24d3eb0a913/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:40:10Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:40:10Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(aliados): detalle de aliado editable + gestión de membresías\n\n/admin/aliados era solo lista y alta: no había forma de editar un aliado ni,\nsobre todo, de darle miembros. Esa segunda parte bloqueaba el programa entero\n— `requirePartnerMember` exige fila real en `partner_members` (el claim\nacelera, la BD manda), así que una cuenta de aliado autenticaba bien y caía en\n/unauthorized, sin más remedio que SQL directo.\n\n- Página /admin/aliados/[id]: ficha editable (legal_name, contact_email,\n  vertical, status con su ayuda de ciclo de vida) cableada al PATCH que ya\n  existía sin UI desde PA4-W1, más slug y kms_key_id en solo lectura.\n- API de membresías: GET/POST /api/admin/partners/[id]/members y\n  PATCH/DELETE .../members/[userId]. El rol es explícito (curator publica y\n  firma; member solo edita), sin default silencioso.\n- lib/partners/aliados-idp.ts: puente al pool de identidad de los ALIADOS, que\n  vive en otro proyecto (micontexto-aliados, tenant GCIP Aliados-*). adminAuth()\n  no sirve porque resolvería uids del proyecto equivocado. Resuelve por correo,\n  crea la cuenta si se pide y devuelve el enlace para fijar contraseña.\n\nDegrada en vez de romper: si faltan ALIADOS_IDP_PROJECT_ID/TENANT_ID, la UI\npide el uid a mano y el POST responde 503 con la explicación.\n\nNo se toca la autoría de paquetes: eso vive en el Lab del portal y su firma es\nla garantía de origen. Aquí solo supervisión.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2d68d13c25c32b3670c66281a7f23625762e536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/d2d68d13c25c32b3670c66281a7f23625762e536"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/34681ae04ec6a38b23fc476b79a4c24d3eb0a913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gith