 Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T23:27:54Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(aliados): UI de alta de aliados en Knowledge Ops\n\nAñade la pantalla /admin/aliados (C.1–C.2 del manual operativo): lista de\npartners y diálogo de alta que consume el backend ya existente\n(GET/POST /api/admin/partners, guard requirePlatformAdmin). Validación de\ncliente espeja CreatePartnerBodySchema (slug/razón social/vertical/correo);\nmaneja 422 (details) y 409 (slug duplicado). Enlace \"Aliados\" en el submenú\nGlobal Admin, distinto del catálogo de solo lectura.\n\nkms_key_id queda pendiente hasta la ruta /internal/partner-provision-key\ndel compiler (TODO PA2-W2-followup); la UI lo muestra como \"pendiente\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f63091f908adf5cfde0f73e8d9e863b003ada00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/0f63091f908adf5cfde0f73e8d9e863b003ada00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/00fa0bcb789da27358dd967f5fd75ba0474acdda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starr