seo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T13:41:31Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"ci(deploy): realinear CD a micontexto-control, retirar Supabase (ADR-206)\n\ncloud-run.yml apuntaba al proyecto muerto teseocontextkdb con secretos de Supabase.\nReescrito contra la verdad del servicio Cloud Run vivo en micontexto-control:\n- Proyecto micontexto-control (1025015138700), AR panel-repo, runtime SA panel-runtime,\n  2 instancias Cloud SQL (control-plane + micontexto-coldtier).\n- Secretos reales: DATABASE_URL<-CONTROL_DATABASE_URL, COLD_TIER_URL<-COLD_TIER_URL_ORCH,\n  M2M_API_KEY; env APP_URL/KDB_COMPILER_URL/COMPILER_INTERNAL_URL/MAILER_DRY_RUN.\n- Auth del panel = Identity Platform: NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_CONFIG como build-arg (var de repo).\n- Runbook de provisión (WIF pool+provider + SA github-deployer + var firebase) en\n  docs/gcp-migracion/CI-CD-SETUP.md — pasos de IAM a correr una vez con la cuenta con acceso.\n- Borrados scripts/deploy-*.sh legacy (teseobot-487515 + Supabase + anon key hardcodeada)\n  y un .github/.github/workflows/deploy-frontend.yml basura anidado con refs a Supabase.\n\nNota: el deploy NO correrá hasta provisionar WIF + SA + var firebase (ver runbook).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c9b2c87a6ee541ae8ce7ff500ae10c971d32d27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/3c9b2c87a6ee541ae8ce7ff500ae10c971d32d27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/174efc90c8fc4ae75b61ba56d85048d366e3b8f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/te