-admin-panel/commits/75e6447eb1fe052c726b326c387f9317f7e012b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T05:00:21Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T05:00:21Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"build(test): suite ejecutable de nuevo — node:test + vitest separados y en verde\n\nLa suite del Lab/aliados (24 archivos node:test, 238 tests) no tenía runner\nconfigurado y vitest la recogía con \"No test suite found\". Ahora:\n- test:node — tsx --test para la suite node:test (238/238).\n- test:vitest — vitest con include explícito de sus 3 archivos (jsdom +\n  @vitejs/plugin-react@5 + @testing-library/react instalados; v6 choca peers).\n- test:integration — campaign-events (requiere servidor vivo en :3006; era\n  Supabase, candidato a migrar/retirar).\n- membership.test.ts: el guard \"URL local\" ahora también sondea que la BD\n  responda — sin BD hace skip en lugar de ECONNREFUSED.\n- npm test = test:node && test:vitest (todo verde sin servicios externos).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8556daa7e39cb44d9cf10f97764aec837d5f860","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/c8556daa7e39cb44d9cf10f97764aec837d5f860"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/75e6447eb1fe052c726b326c387f9317f7e012b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_