repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/7302e01e788e3309a4f246cfa09e3b030e118182/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T03:28:34Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T03:28:34Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(aliados): KL3-W1 editor guiado con plantillas + vista de paquete\n\nAñade el editor P-KL3 (3 paneles: guía+plantilla, editor/preview, placeholder de\nvalidación KL4) con plantillas por los 7 ConceptType (lib/partners/templates.ts,\npreguntas guía en español) y la vista de paquete con su lista de drafts\npendientes. Proxies nuevos hacia el compiler: GET .../packages/[id]/drafts, GET\n.../drafts/get, PATCH .../drafts/update — partner_id siempre sale de la sesión\n(RP-KL7), nunca del cliente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f9442636df7f1c7091f69af81e748fff7ec066f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/5f9442636df7f1c7091f69af81e748fff7ec066f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/7302e01e788e3309a4f246cfa09e3b030e118182","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://gi