riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/d5b4e4ac203b60f32b06dfa9aac8151ee813ef53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:00:16Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:00:16Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(aliados): KL2-W1/W2 biblioteca de fuentes del Lab (APIs + pantalla + destilar)\n\n- GET/POST /api/partners/me/sources: lista fuentes del partner de sesión;\n  POST admite JSON {kind:''url''} o multipart (kind=''doc'', proxy del binario\n  a context-kdb-compiler /internal/partner-source-upload). Duplicado\n  (UNIQUE partner_id, source_ref) → 409 con la fila existente.\n- POST /api/partners/me/sources/{id}/distill: valida pertenencia de fuente\n  y paquete al partner de sesión, llama /internal/partner-ingest con\n  source_gcs_object (KL2-W2 en el compiler evita reenviar el binario),\n  actualiza ingest_status (distilling/distilled/failed).\n- lib/partners/compiler-client.ts: cliente M2M hacia el compiler. No\n  existía patrón previo en el repo para llamar a sus rutas /internal/* —\n  se introduce KDB_COMPILER_URL (nuevo) reusando M2M_API_KEY (ya usado\n  por el panel para sus propias rutas M2M entrantes).\n- Pantalla app/(partners)/lab/fuentes/page.tsx (P-KL2): tabla de fuentes,\n  subir documento, registrar URL, destilar a borradores por paquete.\n- lib/partners/sources.ts + tests: schemas de validación (URL http(s),\n  metadata de doc, body de distill).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9d24b4053cadbc2a10c4630dcf3a1de4b482cab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/e9d24b4053cadbc2a10c4630dcf3a1de4b482cab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/g