com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/ed464b473fe84da6ecebadf81bf26b19e79b7c69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T20:48:56Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T20:48:56Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(aliados): KL1-W2 onboarding del aliado + API mínima de paquetes\n\n- Endurece guard requirePartnerMember: aliado offboarded rechazado 403; suspended sí entra\n- Incluye onboarded_at en SELECT del guard para exposición en resultado\n- Agrega 2 tests unitarios al guard (offboarded → 403; suspended → ok)\n- Crea API GET/POST /api/partners/me/packages con validación Zod [INV-1.1]\n  - POST requiere partner.status === ''verified'' (403 si no)\n  - Validación: slug regex ^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{2,59}$, title 3..120, systems HOCFLIT\n  - UNIQUE violation → 409\n- Crea wizard de onboarding P-KL0 en app/(partners)/lab/onboarding/ (3 pasos)\n  - Paso 1: perfil (read-only), Paso 2: método visual, Paso 3: crear primer paquete\n  - Completa onboarding vía POST /api/partners/me/onboarding-complete\n- Actualiza layout /lab para redirigir a onboarding si onboarded_at IS NULL\n  - Layout /lab/onboarding excluye del check para evitar loop infinito\n- Tests unitarios de validación Zod para CREATE_PACKAGE_BODY\n- Verifica tsc --noEmit: 0 errores nuevos (error preexistente en membership.test.ts)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fbe262823826cbd97aede802f8efd3618c9904b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/1fbe262823826cbd97aede802f8efd3618c9904b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/ed464b473fe84da6ecebadf8