micontexto-control:control-plane\n(seed-ui-demo OK, wu05-verify 8/8).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38cc5e0fa193bd9b07bc5710ac527536707d13f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/38cc5e0fa193bd9b07bc5710ac527536707d13f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/a6063f4425acaaf839e4e7660706f2c8870dba57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/a6063f4425acaaf839e4e7660706f2c8870dba57","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKGE2MDYzZjQ0MjVhY2FhZjgzOWU0ZTc2NjA3MDZmMmM4ODcwZGJhNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/003acac58e981facaba2fe1b9e629988a6a03199","sha":"003acac58e981facaba2fe1b9e629988a6a03199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/003acac58e981facaba2fe1b9e629988a6a03199"}],"sha":"a6063f4425acaaf839e4e7660706f2c8870dba57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/a6063f4425acaaf839e4e7660706f2c8870dba57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commits/003acac58e981facaba2fe1b9e629988a6a03199/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T05:33:35Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T05:33:35Z","email":"teseo@teseo.lat","name":"Teseo Agent"},"message":"feat(gcp): migración GCP-Native del panel — H1 auth + G2 data-access\n\nH1 (Identity Platform, sin Supabase auth):\n- G1-W1 adapter lib/gcp-auth/{admin,session} + app/api/auth/session\n- G1-W2 middleware Edge (presencia __session) + login Firebase + reset/update-password\n- G1-W3 guards con verifySession + custom claim platform_admin + mark-platform-admin\n- G1-W4 mailer Gmail DWD (gmail.send) + invitaciones firebase-admin con compensación\n\nH2/G2 (data-access sobre Cloud SQL control-plane):\n- G2-W1 .from()→pool, auth→Identity Platform; wrappers utils/supabase/* y\n  lib/supabase/admin.ts eliminados; get-tenant-context, rbac, tenant-resolver migrados\n- G2-W2 endpoint M2M app/api/internal/user-modules\n- G2-W3 verify-scripts (wu05/10/12/list) + seed-ui-demo + set-local-password a la BD nueva\n\nDeps nuevas: firebase-admin, firebase, googleapis. tsc --noEmit limpio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b69e2eade0a7ad02fedd342b93ecaa474530e74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/trees/0b69e2eade0a7ad02fedd342b93ecaa474530e74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/git/commits/003acac58e981facaba2fe1b9e629988a6a03199","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262443783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot","id":262443783,"login":"teseo-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOD6STBw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/teseo-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/teseo-bot/multitenant-admin-panel/commit/003acac58e981facaba2fe1b9e629988a6a03199","node_id":"C_kwDOSLpmW9oAKDAwM2FjYWM1OGU5ODFmYWNhYmEyZmUxYjllNjI5OTg4YTZhMDMxOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.co