wapSwarm/commits/dc9b22dbad2f5d76c4d02a125d153659fe0204de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T01:51:05Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T01:51:05Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"message":"docs: rewrite FEEDBACK.md and expand README endpoint/env coverage\n\nFEEDBACK.md:\n- Rewrite as a clean first-time submission (remove all status callouts,\n  struck-through items, and retroactive update blockquotes)\n- Update date to 3 May 2026; add UniswapSwarm project context to overview\n- Request 1: frame TWAP gap from Risk/Strategy Agent perspective\n- Request 2: frame pool-analytics gap from Researcher Agent perspective;\n  fold uniswap-driver future-enhancement note into problem description\n- Request 3: acknowledge shipped LP Provisioning API naturally in problem\n  text; retain two open asks (version liquidity discovery, version selection)\n- Request 4: consolidate routing docs and GET /orders open-order pattern as\n  resolved context; single open ask is unified /tx/status endpoint\n- Summary table: consolidated to 11 rows, cleaner grouping\n\nREADME.md:\n- Add history/sessions endpoint sub-table\n- Add wallet endpoints table (wallet-watch/stream, managed-wallet ledger/fund)\n- Add discovery endpoints table (ENS agents, agent-card, A2A jsonrpc/rest)\n- Add DYNAMODB_WALLETS_TABLE, WALLET_ENCRYPTION_KEY, ZG_INFERENCE_MODEL env vars\n- Add ENS Registry env sub-section","tree":{"sha":"39d8a08d416bc0eb92f0cc41ecf02bd50a8092cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/trees/39d8a08d416bc0eb92f0cc41ecf02bd50a8092cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/commits/dc9b22dbad2f5d76c4d02a125d153659fe0204de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu