ajBhattarai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/commits/39fe80c4dd591e80d87663ce3d5673f9b9fb25f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T16:52:32Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T16:52:32Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"message":"refactor: remove ZG_PRIVATE_KEY — enforce managed wallet isolation\n\nAll pipeline operations now use per-user managed wallets exclusively.\nThe shared operator ZG_PRIVATE_KEY has been removed so funds can never\nbe accidentally shared across users.\n\nChanges:\n- packages/shared/src/config.ts: removed ZG_PRIVATE_KEY from Zod schema\n- packages/compute/src/ZGCompute.ts: constructor falls back to\n  process.env.ZG_PRIVATE_KEY (ignored in practice — always overridden\n  by managed wallet privateKey passed via ensureManagedSession)\n- packages/memory/src/ZGStorage.ts: same fallback pattern\n- apps/orchestrator/src/orchestrator.ts: managed wallet mode only\n- apps/orchestrator/src/a2aAgents.ts: enforces managed wallet path\n- agents/agent-strategy/src/StrategyAgent.ts: related strategy updates\n- apps/web/components/data/SwarmDataCards.tsx: UI updates\n- apps/web/components/wallet/ManagedWalletCard.tsx: wallet card updates\n- packages/shared/src/managedWallet.ts: managed wallet utilities\n- scripts/fund-ledger.ts: reads FUND_LEDGER_PRIVATE_KEY from env\n  directly; removed getConfig() dependency on ZG_PRIVATE_KEY\n- .env.example: replaced ZG_PRIVATE_KEY with commented\n  FUND_LEDGER_PRIVATE_KEY note (script-only, never in .env)\n- turbo.json: added .next/** to build outputs (silences Turbopack warning)\n\nBuild: 11/11 packages successful","tree":{"s