s","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NirajBhattarai","id":39485271,"login":"NirajBhattarai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDg1Mjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/commits/d4349d3b7e58d1ee7fd99bd22c7b0a421f75f97c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T15:41:01Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T15:41:01Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"message":"feat(ens): add ENS agent registry, setup scripts, and delegate approval\n\n- Add ensRegistry.ts: resolveAgentRegistry() reads all 6 agent ENS\n  subname records (addr, text[name], text[url]) from Sepolia on first\n  call and caches in-process; publishAgentUrlsToEns() self-registers\n  the deployment''s public URL at startup (idempotent)\n- Add GET /api/ens/agents endpoint exposing full fleet to dashboards\n- Add scripts/setup-ens.ts: creates subnames under uniswapswarm.eth,\n  sets addr + text[name] + text[url] for all 6 agents (wrapped and\n  unwrapped NameWrapper flows supported)\n- Add scripts/approve-ens-delegate.ts: approves a hot-wallet delegate\n  on the Public Resolver so CI/Railway can update records without the\n  owner key (one-time setup)\n- Add scripts/call-agent.ts: resolves an agent''s A2A endpoint URL from\n  ENS text[url] and sends a JSON-RPC message, streaming the response\n- Update AGENT_ENS_NAMES + ENS_CONTRACTS_BY_CHAIN in shared/constants\n- Wire publishAgentUrlsToEns + resolveAgentRegistry into orchestrator\n  startup (index.ts); add ensName field to AgentDescriptor (a2aAgents)\n- Update .env.example + apps/web/.env.example with all ENS variables\n  (ENS_RPC_URL, ENS_OWNER_PRIVATE_KEY, ENS_RECORDS_PRIVATE_KEY,\n  ENS_DELEGATE_ADDRESS, ENS_AGENT_BASE_URL, per-agent addr overrides)\n- Update README: new ENS Agent Registry section with on-chain structure\n  table, lifecycle sequence diagram, code locations table, env vars,\n  and setup commands; refresh architecture diagram with ENS layer","tree":{"sha":"62720aef73d627fe766bd7a7704b6fd6ed6b259e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/trees/62720aef73d627fe766bd7a7704b6fd6ed6b259e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/commits/d4349d3b7e58d1ee7fd99bd22c7b0a421f75f97c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39485271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NirajBhattarai","id":39485271,"login":"NirajBhattarai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDg1Mjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc