attarai/UniswapSwarm/commits/150e0633b87c5b5b5a8a4ce5bfc9e03f77f88cbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T17:20:44Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T17:20:44Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"message":"fix: replace $250M liquidityUSD sentinel with market-cap-aware capping\n\n- Move populateLiquidityUSD() call to after CoinGecko market data is\n  fetched so each token''s estimate can be sanity-capped against its real\n  market cap (2% ceiling), not just the hard $250M constant\n- Fix BigInt precision: replace Number(BigInt(L)) * float(sqrt) chain\n  with pure BigInt division (L * sqrtX96 / (2^96 * 10^decimals)) to\n  avoid IEEE-754 loss on large concentrated-liquidity pool values\n- Export populateLiquidityUSD from services/index.ts so ResearchAgent\n  can call it with the marketData map\n- Remove populateLiquidityUSD + sort from fetchOnChainPools; both now\n  happen in ResearchAgent.run() after market data is available\n- Add defiLlamaHistory.ts (untracked new file) to git tracking","tree":{"sha":"6c224bd858207ffb490cdc0003ca567e65425607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/trees/6c224bd858207ffb490cdc0003ca567e65425607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/commits/150e0633b87c5b5b5a8a4ce5bfc9e03f77f88cbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39485271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co