1+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T16:27:55Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"message":"docs(readme): document A2A cockpit, stablecoin policy, new env vars\n\n- Expand intro to mention the CopilotKit + AG-UI / A2A cockpit and the\n  stablecoin↔stablecoin ban.\n- Update monorepo tree with apps/web (a2a/, data/, hitl/, audit ctx)\n  and the new orchestrator A2A files.\n- Add Gemini API key to prerequisites; document new\n  CopilotKit / A2A env vars (GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY,\n  COPILOTKIT_MODEL, NEXT_PUBLIC_*, *_PORT, *_AGENT_URL).\n- Rewrite the cockpit section to describe animated handoff cards,\n  0G Storage audit chips, sidebar data cards, JSON-payload pill, and\n  the two HITL flows (gather_swap_intent / request_trade_approval).\n- New \"Safety Policies\" section explaining the 3-layer stablecoin\n  veto (Researcher / Strategy / Critic) and pointers to STABLECOIN_*\n  in @swarm/shared.\n- List apps/web cockpit dependencies and add pnpm format / pnpm dev\n  to the development commands.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"f715f3490ca5cf23febee5ea59f13aca2fd30c31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/trees/f715f3490ca5cf23febee5ea59f13aca2fd30c31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/commits/2a28016c5bd81b36e7eca03a6ae64322784ccad0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39485271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com