ps://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/commits/67499b7c7d343499d00fef7e710a7bb6f351286b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T16:21:40Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T16:21:40Z","email":"39485271+NirajBhattarai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Niraj Bhattarai"},"message":"feat: A2A CopilotKit web UI + ban stablecoin↔stablecoin swaps\n\n- Add Next.js + CopilotKit web app under apps/web with rich A2A handoff\n  visualisations (animated MessageToA2A / MessageFromA2A cards, sidebar\n  data cards for plan / risk / strategy / execution / 0G storage audit).\n- Stand up six standalone A2A agent servers (researcher, planner, risk,\n  strategy, critic, executor) in apps/orchestrator/src/a2aAgents.ts and\n  bridge them through the orchestrator LLM via CopilotKit''s\n  send_message_to_a2a_agent tool.\n- Surface per-agent 0G Storage writes (rootHash, key, size) inline in\n  chat bubbles and in a dedicated audit-trail sidebar, wired through a\n  new SwarmAuditContext to avoid stale closures during streaming.\n- Ban stablecoin↔stablecoin swaps end-to-end:\n  - Add STABLECOIN_SYMBOLS / STABLECOIN_ADDRESSES + isStablecoin()\n    helpers to @swarm/shared.\n  - Researcher prompt + post-LLM filter drop stablecoin candidates.\n  - Strategy filters stablecoins from the candidate pool, prompts the\n    LLM accordingly, and force-overrides any stable-tokenOut output\n    with the synthetic USDC→WETH fallback.\n  - Critic gains a hard veto for stable→stable proposals.\n- Tighten orchestrator system prompt: Researcher always runs first,\n  gather_swap_intent only fires for bare greetings, and task strings\n  must be short natural-language directives (never raw JSON).\n- Ignore tmp/ scratch directory.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"77762601581947f35058ef3cb5753bcd1871f720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/trees/77762601581947f35058ef3cb5753bcd1871f720"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/commits/67499b7c7d343499d00fef7e710a7bb6f351286b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39485271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NirajBhattarai","id":39485271,"login":"NirajBhattarai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDg1Mjcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/commit/67499b7c7d343499d00fef7e710a7bb6f351286b","node_id":"C_kwDOSLtHFdoAKDY3NDk5YjdjN2QzNDM0OTlkMDBmZWY3ZTcxMGE3YmI2ZjM1MTI4NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/commit/61d31200a38f68f85bae6272a1b3b3343978c35a","sha":"61d31200a38f68f85bae6272a1b3b3343978c35a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/commits/61d31200a38f68f85bae6272a1b3b3343978c3