epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/commits/9695dfa1c6f56754925bb7e237ad7efc134aef47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T05:03:10Z","email":"nirajbhattarai19@gmail.com","name":"NirajBhattarai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T05:03:10Z","email":"nirajbhattarai19@gmail.com","name":"NirajBhattarai"},"message":"refactor(researcher): split constants, types, and prompts into separate files\n\n- Extract all TypeScript interfaces into src/types.ts\n  (TokenDef, PoolSnapshot, NarrativeSignal, UniswapAPIQuoteResponse, etc.)\n- Extract ABIs, token registry, QUERY_PAIRS, CoinGecko ID map, and\n  narrative keyword tables into src/constants.ts\n- Extract LLM SYSTEM_PROMPT into src/prompts.ts\n- ResearchAgent.ts now contains only the class implementation\n\nBug fixes included in this changeset:\n- Fix protocol enum: UNISWAPX → UNISWAPX_V2 (UNISWAPX_V3 rejected by API)\n- Fix address bug: pre-compute tokenAddress/poolAddress so LLM copies\n  the correct ERC-20 address instead of the pool contract address\n- Fix multi-protocol support: V2/V3/V4/UNISWAPX_V2 protocols enabled\n- Guard CoinGecko null fields with ?? 0 to prevent toFixed crashes\n- Update PlannerAgent prompt: remove V3-only language, add multi-protocol context\n- Update dataSource field: uniswap-v3-onchain → uniswap-multi-protocol","tree":{"sha":"d332788fb018571576c8a9264e1c6d8e0dcafa6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/trees/d332788fb018571576c8a9264e1c6d8e0dcafa6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/UniswapSwarm/git/commits/9695dfa1c6f56754925bb7e237ad7efc134aef47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon