c-only policy shows exactly the form''s\ncandidateDataPolicyText; an unknown mode, jobs that disagree, no policy or\nan unreadable list keep the most restrictive notice. The API mock now keeps\nthe real policy version constants.\n\nRed until the banner reads the policy: the two policy-text tests fail on\nbehaviour; the four fallback tests fail only on the new banner test id,\nsince today''s fixed banner is already the restrictive text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): the job list banner reads the same candidate data policy as the form (#1199)\n\nThe banner shows candidateDataPolicyText, the form''s own text, when every\njob carries the same recognised policy (resolveCandidateDataPolicy, the\nform''s filter). No policy, an unknown mode or version, jobs that disagree,\nno jobs or an unreadable list keep today''s restrictive notice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78b78c6f4228c491490234eba8a1b7b77bcd190d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/78b78c6f4228c491490234eba8a1b7b77bcd190d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/f5bebf6b213ab18b073536e19450adadf134a29f","verification":{"payload":"tree 78b78c6f4228c491490234eba8a1b7b77bcd190d\nparent 4889a9f158df838d10a6f83cd1db8d0114a81522\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790951493 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790951493 +0300\n\nfix(ats): the job list banner reads the same candidate data policy as the form (#1199) (#1209)\n\n* test(ats): the job list banner reads the same candidate data policy as the form (#1199)\n\nOwner triage (#1199, 2026-09-25): the job list banner says \"do not use real\npersonal data\" even where the form''s candidateDataPolicy is real-allowed.\nNew tests: a real-allowed or synthetic-only policy shows exactly the form''s\ncandidateDataPolicyText; an unknown mode, jobs that disagree, no policy or\nan unreadable list keep the most restrictive notice. The API mock now keeps\nthe real policy version constants.\n\nRed until the banner reads the policy: the two policy-text tests fail on\nbehaviour; the four fallback tests fail only on the new banner test id,\nsince today''s fixed banner is already the restrictive text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): the job list banner reads the same candidate data policy as the form (#1199)\n\nThe banner shows candidateDataPolicyText, the form''s own text, when every\njob carries the same recognised policy (resolveCandidateDataPolicy, the\nform''s filter). No policy, an unknown mode or version, jobs that disagree,\nno jobs or an unreadable list keep today''s restrictive notice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv8BFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIf0QAKX4ryamvc00mUBfLDmQtNQJ\nb5qU0gIRiaucRlJ0mNP1SFcooNc7qh+JxbPXRTP+hdd2mT2vwPIaWjFKB/zgMXfd\n9OJQ3bTD5zqEZRx7cntLSC7SlR2Dh2ue3RR+VhyF5rwSy76SOoh3KPiK4aJ1W6Zp\nyJD2Kq2BlSI9NNzcCX6BHh6gE2wmgmfiD7bIl4jSghEUeMrlt5jPB3UHarQqWqo9\n9fuephlM8QN42hPC1l9YD0MlBl7S37lDsA2HXpDR1IDy5xuSWcUejVttUxKR4pR5\nBIovBXqUfOQiFKaeqY8f71VrF2eJRQ0baDbQn2C1irts073et6llBAi2kwS9rzTf\nTRyP2n+cvutb0IimWkFdKS4Ee30iH3/fiF6qen7gwAHAgOUyvEkEqAEZ2UlD2COz\nMI6AdfZ1RBIi539hM68Af70BoNQ78T4rdnScc8Vg652e3qj+HDfEy9gfKWczbeet\neXTWWSdObwf/Ui1U3faZ7FWoUW+5pN4oQHqhUNQ6ikGzVtjDwa4Oe3nGrs0eRqrg\nKVsESqtZ+/dNb3ZazN8MdaC2JS186RkbLXx10jWuNelEZg0K/DQKGhoBLqykJtfV\nZoBJqp2Lkqj2/7o3x9gDLZRJ6GPTRtojkcQZW/oXiq5zGNOYTa365u109i4E5si8\nZ6VycsLpyGDBHaX8aOHB\n=8WUQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T14:31:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url