ogin":"zeynep-serban","node_id":"U_kgDODo2qrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/4889a9f158df838d10a6f83cd1db8d0114a81522/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:31:25Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:31:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ats): keep interview completion closed until the interview has started (ats#278) (#1208)\n\n* test(ats): keep interview completion closed until the interview has started (ats#278)\n\nOwner decision (ats#278, 2026-09-25): the server now refuses completion\nbefore the planned start (409 INTERVIEW_NOT_STARTED, ats#283). The panel\nmust match it: for an interview a day ahead \"Görüşmeyi tamamla\" is\ndisabled and described by a short note, while \"Yeniden planla\" and\n\"Görüşmeyi iptal et\" stay enabled. A started interview keeps completion\nopen with no note. Red until the panel reads the start time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): keep interview completion closed until the interview has started (ats#278)\n\n\"Görüşmeyi tamamla\" is disabled while the planned start is in the future\nand is described by a short note that points to \"Yeniden planla\"; the\nreschedule and cancel actions stay available. The server enforces the same\nrule (409 INTERVIEW_NOT_STARTED, ats#283), and its reason is still shown\nif the clock moves between render and click.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15279ecec2d0e689b99784ef5b43f601536519cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/15279ecec2d0e689b99784ef5b43f601536519cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/4889a9f158df838d10a6f83cd1db8d0114a81522","verification":{"payload":"tree 15279ecec2d0e689b99784ef5b43f601536519cb\nparent 5e40e082da4bee753aa340e684524c60c642b787\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790951485 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790951485 +0300\n\nfix(ats): keep interview completion closed until the interview has started (ats#278) (#1208)\n\n* test(ats): keep interview completion closed until the interview has started (ats#278)\n\nOwner decision (ats#278, 2026-09-25): the server now refuses completion\nbefore the planned start (409 INTERVIEW_NOT_STARTED, ats#283). The panel\nmust match it: for an interview a day ahead \"Görüşmeyi tamamla\" is\ndisabled and described by a short note, while \"Yeniden planla\" and\n\"Görüşmeyi iptal et\" stay enabled. A started interview keeps completion\nopen with no note. Red until the panel reads the start time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): keep interview completion closed until the interview has started (ats#278)\n\n\"Görüşmeyi tamamla\" is disabled while the planned start is in the future\nand is described by a short note that points to \"Yeniden planla\"; the\nreschedule and cancel actions stay available. The server enforces the same\nrule (409 INTERVIEW_NOT_STARTED, ats#283), and its reason is still shown\nif the clock moves between render and click.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 