platform-web/commits/b9fd690f575dbd4834754b996336c8d979b88522/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:12:49Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:12:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(design-system): the drawer reflows at 400% zoom (#992 D) (#1195)\n\n* test(design-system): the drawer must reflow at 400% zoom (#992)\n\nTests only, in the CSSOM canary that CI runs in real Chromium. At 320x256\n(400% zoom) the fixed header took most of the short screen and the long\ntitle was truncated (WCAG 1.4.10). A second case locks the desktop layout\n(fixed header, body scrolls) so the change stays limited to short screens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(design-system): the drawer reflows at 400% zoom (#992)\n\nOn short screens (max-height 32rem) the whole panel scrolls and the body\ndrops its own scroll, so the header moves with the content and the close\nbutton stays reachable at the top. The title wraps instead of truncating.\nDesktop layout is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d604208ff9a29547a4d0659b6efd11a5ad157389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/d604208ff9a29547a4d0659b6efd11a5ad157389"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/b9fd690f575dbd4834754b996336c8d979b88522","verification":{"payload":"tree d604208ff9a29547a4d0659b6efd11a5ad157389\nparent 6b53a3b96b62247ea147dbe2ddb48c56185f6846\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790525569 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790525569 +0300\n\nfix(design-system): the drawer reflows at 400% zoom (#992 D) (#1195)\n\n* test(design-system): the drawer must reflow at 400% zoom (#992)\n\nTests only, in the CSSOM canary that CI runs in real Chromium. At 320x256\n(400% zoom) the fixed header took most of the short screen and the long\ntitle was truncated (WCAG 1.4.10). A second case locks the desktop layout\n(fixed header, body scrolls) so the change stays limited to short screens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(design-system): the drawer reflows at 400% zoom (#992)\n\nOn short screens (max-height 32rem) the whole panel scrolls and the body\ndrops its own scroll, so the header moves with the content and the close\nbutton stays reachable at the top. The title wraps instead of truncating.\nDesktop layout is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquUCBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjLMQAG6nXoP4lHjffhWLfpZ+bi2E\nKvVg1Z49D4sHfffSVBxWuSDCLN2fflLLvu1DZqQ4cM37usgUVaWTy632GgIOXNtj\n7mRPyNpvzopqdWeE7VszJQoYWFzVsLTlgHPmfb0LWt224r8GeofbgXdjiwFDSOEx\nF6PolXn9LtvpLPNSrgGBd9MerpV2kk1Ei5Phg04Dro8HjOUqzBJ1peVZ4FxG1qiM\nxonY6K48cN2jz9t2U4s9q3tyyIa7pvS+PMuV/7QYRBgFX2EdLxF7oUzQ0wWGVxhr\nJnrAYFPd+xOWMXnDdblVJ8FWqrxB9hQaRagy3+J1rJyCnd8PKFCQkxLSGClnYcaG\nyJTMfVaKWRbVyS0SWvWqoKkZL1AIhBqtqdCad7eRSA8PYsHeVpUd0dbRHjfD6qt0\nWDQj+1fb/Upo0Bti0oZ1+DsPAXuUxaaDtGi3kay5ueRxIZKCctca/ByIprUlg20W\n51y/Rw1jsaTyIpqOJjM+eVe/M1FyAlTzRWMiVyD1Pb32Cl24Tkzyht7zJPODJcf2\nh1feTP1IbImj8ZOYEZNLP3L9g3mvfFp6nLp2fV2wJ94yJblnNjEousARYfXGRIQJ\n8EyyuI0wdWtvan7mg8LwyFOMIgjvuYGx9V2nqr9Adf0T5Q1MHs4RaLiG6TzwaHWG\nr1wv2Emr5NDA6RDvleEi\n=OQz9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T16:12:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"http