ttps://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/6b53a3b96b62247ea147dbe2ddb48c56185f6846/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:12:40Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:12:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ats): show \"Adresten\" when a resume proposal came from the address (ats#213 G) (#1202)\n\n* test(ats): say \"Adresten\" only when provenance.source says so (ats#213 G)\n\nOwner decision (2026-09-25, ats#274 review): the candidate sees \"Adresten\"\nonly for provenance.source = ADDRESS_LAST_LINE; a proposal without the\nfield keeps its current line. Red until the form reads the field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(ats): show \"Adresten\" when a resume proposal came from the address (ats#213 G)\n\nResumeProposalDto.provenance gains the optional closed source\n(''ADDRESS_LAST_LINE''). The proposal card reads the label from a fixed\nmap, so only that value prints \"Adresten\"; an unknown value or a missing\nfield leaves the line exactly as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66b1c13d7782ec845e23166f19d76c9561408c18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/66b1c13d7782ec845e23166f19d76c9561408c18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/6b53a3b96b62247ea147dbe2ddb48c56185f6846","verification":{"payload":"tree 66b1c13d7782ec845e23166f19d76c9561408c18\nparent 51f7b4124302ab7bc66eae752fcba6a6f751a85b\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790525560 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790525560 +0300\n\nfeat(ats): show \"Adresten\" when a resume proposal came from the address (ats#213 G) (#1202)\n\n* test(ats): say \"Adresten\" only when provenance.source says so (ats#213 G)\n\nOwner decision (2026-09-25, ats#274 review): the candidate sees \"Adresten\"\nonly for provenance.source = ADDRESS_LAST_LINE; a proposal without the\nfield keeps its current line. Red until the form reads the field.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(ats): show \"Adresten\" when a resume proposal came from the address (ats#213 G)\n\nResumeProposalDto.provenance gains the optional closed source\n(''ADDRESS_LAST_LINE''). The proposal card reads the label from a fixed\nmap, so only that value prints \"Adresten\"; an unknown value or a missing\nfield leaves the line exactly as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquUB4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAPMQAHHYTsOZxgG10drnUag+3UUV\nns1Hg/jJQSjmz5mStQAC/u3UUpm8H8tDY2Dd+mFQDFOllluDAu42wTtKBIMm14bx\n9JAyHkPTPo3pE+fQ3Rye2ZCdIAVpCftuGK20ve10OVxZEVfTlSqEnAG1ll1Ek5MA\n0/7e2sOfy42/Z++xQjCJainAy+Kf5aQNPS5fJh8HnkP1uqnRDPEhdhBxUH5EtUMy\n/HCot+FTKdc8yIRBdd4OnI+YCIFZ7E7SC1pgny6G45D/GgWBmD5gyOKyL5si9aqB\nqU913FLG8E6ajcLtbvqjJ8uzwqGQ2v0STQcnX6kf/1rb7g4sUjHIli370jJMOT2+\nbkaB3YPxRcOA1W+7AyHWFKy98SkQvcoP1RyQkfxkvF8NOg52eOxYc6jzWPLhio4p\nvk9qodxGWENw5162yvBsEjQnoDNI2137IWj1XZCsi37YyPN7Yiy/vS/FkwP7DwOw\nDzgdw9XILEg4nh/IdMAd0v6up1zCBy16ilZSrjHFZQEC12gHAY51wzp+QoEsNony\nK+RzC95BrFX5YAIq3NIAizrQOERAzQkBBs4VPQ2EhNRGsGpqvmXO1VOYszq0du4p\n3ucFvAKtYEd9QzKxetaXfiX4lykGJJpvNJ+zI40xB1PFOUJUTrA5r8v5+aD84k98\nlt6dHDG4gw76