ithub.com/users/zeynep-serban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zeynep-serban","id":244165292,"login":"zeynep-serban","node_id":"U_kgDODo2qrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/51f7b4124302ab7bc66eae752fcba6a6f751a85b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:12:31Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:12:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ats): a late detail answer no longer replaces the application the recruiter moved to (#1185 P2) (#1194)\n\n* test(ats): a late detail answer must not replace the application the recruiter moved to\n\nTests only. #1185 review note (P2): loadDetail was not bound to its\npublicRef; when A answered after B, A replaced B on screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): a late detail answer no longer replaces the application the recruiter moved to\n\nEach detail load takes a sequence number; only the latest request may\nwrite the detail, the load error or the end of loading. Same idea as the\ncandidate portal view epoch (#965).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"744ee22f6b9f70eaf3636a73e415a671292e87b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/744ee22f6b9f70eaf3636a73e415a671292e87b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/51f7b4124302ab7bc66eae752fcba6a6f751a85b","verification":{"payload":"tree 744ee22f6b9f70eaf3636a73e415a671292e87b2\nparent 109a75467fe6c2596ccf2a200e54e0e6ae28ae47\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790525551 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790525551 +0300\n\nfix(ats): a late detail answer no longer replaces the application the recruiter moved to (#1185 P2) (#1194)\n\n* test(ats): a late detail answer must not replace the application the recruiter moved to\n\nTests only. #1185 review note (P2): loadDetail was not bound to its\npublicRef; when A answered after B, A replaced B on screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): a late detail answer no longer replaces the application the recruiter moved to\n\nEach detail load takes a sequence number; only the latest request may\nwrite the detail, the load error or the end of loading. Same idea as the\ncandidate portal view epoch (#965).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquUBvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAicAQAFdK+VZzJvwEOLySpLXIOVqR\ngcCqFKqh8NcfHmff0qXznX4zjpIPFMPncMkZEa6yyNAdonQ1pV4enMUbBGPELij4\nsdhc6xxf1ezoQgKLfEfQuOwrtIBWfdsC9Ml1MotSfZkDqCmkatfeg9H+bOB4JivL\np2RRKB3yv7cPYGPN28IWl68TKj46T4ViLo26yMI4iUdbYw1YJgHbLiT3Pp5K0BOS\nmZ11OHXoEKui+yk7TpIU526tHpsb+taw9VAHRZmD/WcMuol4bl+uh63Q5eVEW4cO\nxpHQrtZKe5pfH446y1w389516/Ir8nUyVK92zXCwbQ5ND2ifxplYFExZxl9jKOd0\nb9aL+RDonHeKhqEnN+aIzq9ERHMVML9C/vsUKkpkAHzNdgSmphjr7OuKnPSEydOS\nYZ83ArHsxJo1RAR/wmFqm8FAfA9j52g5v8BuIN7eeOT2siLWNa+NwHZtqu+2yg1z\nvXH444eozFGa/h5CQrqIX+BqF5iy7qsQMRjp49bP7ws+K7ECYSfGozb1ZXkuWPjr\n0pjtOp38Yp25Cf7YAxFQjPFISy5IfGWaYo9F2ugd58+8uAwHqfz0NJzegJeG49e