github.com/users/zeynep-serban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zeynep-serban","id":244165292,"login":"zeynep-serban","node_id":"U_kgDODo2qrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/109a75467fe6c2596ccf2a200e54e0e6ae28ae47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:09:55Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:09:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ats): review follow-ups for #1185, #1190 and #1191 (#1193)\n\n* test(ats): review follow-ups for #1185, #1190 and #1191\n\nTests only (plus a doc note on the #1189 guard). Owner review notes:\n- #1190: a start date with a time must not crash the candidate portal\n  (new Date(NaN) -> RangeError in Intl.DateTimeFormat).\n- #1191: when the interviews cannot be loaded the offer panel must say the\n  status is unknown, not that the interview is incomplete.\n- #1185: a focus request whose target is missing must be dropped, not\n  fired on a later render (after \"Detayi yeniden yukle\" focus jumped to\n  the stale outcome instead of the heading).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): review follow-ups for #1185, #1190 and #1191\n\n- #1190: formatCalendarDate only formats YYYY-MM-DD without a time; any\n  other value falls back to the timed formatter instead of throwing.\n- #1191: the interview panel reports a failed load as null; the review\n  panel keeps loaded/unknown apart and the offer panel says the interview\n  status could not be read (button stays closed).\n- #1185: a focus request whose target is missing is dropped, and requests\n  reset when the application changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(ats): an unparseable date must not take the candidate portal down (#1193 review)\n\nformatCalendarDate falls back to formatDate for non-calendar values, but\nformatDate throws the same RangeError for new Date(\"abc\") or \"\". Red until\nformatDate guards invalid dates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): an unparseable date shows \"—\" instead of taking the portal down (#1193 review)\n\nformatDate returns \"—\" when new Date(value) is invalid, so every date on the\ncandidate portal (not only the offer start date) survives a bad value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef0c98f762fce0f094acd27b8db61da5a3576fce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/ef0c98f762fce0f094acd27b8db61da5a3576fce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/109a75467fe6c2596ccf2a200e54e0e6ae28ae47","verification":{"payload":"tree ef0c98f762fce0f094acd27b8db61da5a3576fce\nparent 9b3fbad12bb000c13c5359a184c645fabd4db95e\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790525395 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790525395 +0300\n\nfix(ats): review follow-ups for #1185, #1190 and #1191 (#1193)\n\n* test(ats): review follow-ups for #1185, #1190 and #1191\n\nTests only (plus a doc note on the #1189 guard). Owner review notes:\n- #1190: a start date with a time must not crash the candidate portal\n  (new Date(NaN) -> RangeError in Intl.DateTimeFormat).\n- #1191: when the interviews cannot be loaded the offer panel must say the\n  status is unknown, not that the interview is incomplete.\n- #1185: a focus request whose target is missing must be dropped, not\n  fired on a later render (after \"Detayi yeniden yukle\" focus jumped to\n  the stale outcome instead of the heading).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): review follow-ups for #1185, #1190 and #1191\n\n- #1190: formatCalendarDate only formats YYYY-MM-DD without a time; any\n  other value falls back to the timed formatter instead of throwing.\n- #1191: the interview panel reports a failed load as null; the review\n  panel keeps loaded/unknown apart and the offer panel says the interview\n  status could not be read (button stays closed).\n- #1185: a focus request whose target is missing is dropped, and requests\n  reset when the application changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(ats): an unparseable date must not take the candidate portal down (#1193 review)\n\nformatCalendarDate falls back to formatDate for non-calendar values, but\nformatDate throws the same RangeError for new Date(\"abc\") or \"\". Red until\nformatDate guards invalid dates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): an unparseable date shows \"—\" instead of taking the portal down (#1193 review)\n\nformatDate returns \"—\" when new Date(value) is invalid, so every date on the\ncandidate portal (not only the offer start date) survives a bad value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquT/TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2X8QAFpLPVTe9XQJ8/Y2FGj8YBJb\n2l6VwUJJlo7TtpQzXZoVeOKMF4KlVEgAIgs1fhDE0u1Wyy0fSHyKpeiUYfH68h5Q\nJ2O3V9/IEaeEfwGA7A7dS8NLpbSnwH