erban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zeynep-serban","id":244165292,"login":"zeynep-serban","node_id":"U_kgDODo2qrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/e432718aeb895129a76050c24ff0a40d585b125b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:40:24Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:40:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ats): open the offer draft only after a completed interview (#963) (#1191)\n\n* test(ats): the offer draft stays closed until an interview is completed (#963)\n\nTests plus an unused optional prop (scaffold). The server rejects an offer\nwithout a COMPLETED interview (409 INTERVIEW_NOT_COMPLETED); the panel still\noffered the draft button because it only looked at the application status.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): open the offer draft only after a completed interview (#963)\n\nThe interview panel reports each loaded list together with its application\nref; the review panel keeps \"has a completed interview\" per ref and passes it\nto the offer panel, which shows a note instead of the draft button until then.\nSame rule as the server (COMPLETED interview exists).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dfaeaee8161dc271431ed2e99613d53403ce016","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/7dfaeaee8161dc271431ed2e99613d53403ce016"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/e432718aeb895129a76050c24ff0a40d585b125b","verification":{"payload":"tree 7dfaeaee8161dc271431ed2e99613d53403ce016\nparent 4945c424f9ca4edd4fff113a0c23882eb3da1ad1\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790152824 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790152824 +0300\n\nfix(ats): open the offer draft only after a completed interview (#963) (#1191)\n\n* test(ats): the offer draft stays closed until an interview is completed (#963)\n\nTests plus an unused optional prop (scaffold). The server rejects an offer\nwithout a COMPLETED interview (409 INTERVIEW_NOT_COMPLETED); the panel still\noffered the draft button because it only looked at the application status.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): open the offer draft only after a completed interview (#963)\n\nThe interview panel reports each loaded list together with its application\nref; the review panel keeps \"has a completed interview\" per ref and passes it\nto the offer panel, which shows a note instead of the draft button until then.\nSame rule as the server (COMPLETED interview exists).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs5B4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAd+IQAG+cubhrZXp1CUksXFtWd55+\nP76QASVi0OqOTmkDQp3k4ViEWorjA2xvk/RnekBGkTaHqHQF6nOBPoeBZzM5/r8y\nfczQNGAa9bpW+UN6Id8448OL4oBbb/+ATvjdgN3UyXzhQrnbqVcR/PAjO0jS1XWl\nWT5sCWNaC