7dcf3331f0ef44e09e6d7"}],"sha":"e7640339295ecce6cf0d1fb0260ca34dbbdec57e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/e7640339295ecce6cf0d1fb0260ca34dbbdec57e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244165292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zeynep-serban","id":244165292,"login":"zeynep-serban","node_id":"U_kgDODo2qrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/f6169a3569e010f6f637dcf3331f0ef44e09e6d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:01:02Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:01:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ats): keep focus and show the outcome next to recruiter actions (#992 B) (#1185)\n\n* test(ats): recruiter actions must keep focus and show the outcome next to them\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#992 (slice 992-B). Tests only: after a status\nchange the panel is replaced by a loading line, the pressed button leaves\nthe DOM and focus drops to body; the outcome renders below the interview\nand offer sections; the rejection panel does not take or return focus.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): keep focus and show the outcome next to recruiter actions\n\nAfter a status change the review panel reloaded through the same loading\nbranch as the first load, replacing the whole panel with a status line:\nthe pressed button left the DOM and focus fell to body. The full loading\nline now shows only on the first load; switching applications clears the\nprevious detail so a stale record never stays on screen. The outcome\nrenders right below the actions and receives focus after a status\nchange; the rejection panel takes focus on open and returns it on cancel.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#992 (slice 992-B).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(ats): let the drawer settle its own initial focus before acting\n\nCI failed the two outcome-focus tests while local and DEV runs passed:\nthe received focus was the drawer close button. Drawer (useFocusTrap)\nmoves focus to its first focusable element 50 ms after opening; when\nthe mocked action finished inside that window, the delayed drawer focus\noverwrote the outcome focus. A person cannot act and get a result within\n50 ms of opening, so the tests now wait for the drawer initial focus\nbefore the action instead of racing it.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#992 (slice 992-B).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1adfee9e88df55ffa2e9a3de98e597e023298c2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/1adfee9e88df55ffa2e9a3de98e597e023298c2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/f6169a3569e010f6f637dcf3331f0ef44e09e6d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 1adfee9e88df55ffa2e9a3de98e597e023298c2b\nparent ecf0099d3f800fbadcfcee2e9ab4d87856021398\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790150462 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790150462 +0300\n\nfix(ats): keep focus and show the outcome next to recruiter actions (#992 B) (#1185)\n\n* test(ats): recruiter actions must keep focus and show the outcome next to them\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#992 (slice 992-B). Tests only: after a status\nchange the panel is replaced by a loading line, the pressed button leaves\nthe DOM and focus drops to body; the outcome renders below the interview\nand offer sections; the rejection panel does not take or return focus.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): keep focus and show the outcome next to recruiter actions\n\nAfter a status change the review panel reloaded through the same loading\nbranch as the first load, replacing the whole panel with a status line:\nthe pressed button left the DOM and focus fell to body. The full loading\nline now shows only on the first load; switching applications clears the\nprevious detail so a stale record never stays on screen. The outcome\nrenders right below the actions and receives focus after a status\nchange; the rejection panel takes focus on open and returns it on cancel.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#992 (slice 992-B).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(ats): let the drawer settle its own initial focus before acting\n\nCI failed the two outcome-focus tests while local and DEV runs passed:\nthe received focus was the drawer close button. Drawer (useFocusTrap)\nmoves focus to its first focusable element 50 ms after opening; when\nthe mocked action finished inside that window, the delayed drawer focus\noverwrote the outcome focus. A person cannot act and get a result within\n50 ms of opening, so the tests now wait for the drawer initial focus\nbefore the action instead of racing it.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#992 (slice 992-B).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs4c+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAId0QADxvv7q+nzq4MGHxu+Tf9lFY\nf+EiBlXkNRUzwWT4IcmbwIxPw5WdXgoq2SOPLtK6Nm1vY0Bwzg3rLuHbcpWi/oJ+\ndDwZNsKB60Xkne0Vqh6m/khuK+ZDTVVCtZHKxYv9QkOCH2B1MPrrLtLNKEBvh1Ng\nIPgy4lz1R3uWo2N8BPpBmXtL6eZ93g3bAJHpzWRPGbfSDDSE/F4H9kDHMO93sYt8\nWjhobmqSK8uLO1UqQZ2IxcuhC+T6LD/pM4sJS1JbxPr6FfJ8lF2NQ5mwc4bpuBXQ\nVnl9GSS27fCC5g6VXgS1kcbLW5bEMZSflwLnWWGKzOQPHMQA3WdhaQyPSD9F3TNO\nSNR1FSxKrFD8YKpFstpcp6WW7LjznHpUVYgm4qUFAx8G3HmbxqJUA9aa/y3MiKpR\n6RGRpjlI6MNXMZRP6RZ2BocR/z3u+unLflpa1uRWuo3aae6iXG3FeX0frTDUTGTK\nTc7g9DTLknPY7YQmr+jDUtg1BfSbESCy43y9rUQOsfMTOfaAYq6UaGcPbOCIHw61\nqOywmF8oEqOgEhtren7kijMbslcZkWSohX6mPblzlN/ugrKzqmw4YtVok0zsnAC0\ng0d/EFohShTV07dx6rFBFUolR+9lTzll+7brHSby1xfj/51pT8Jfkd19rXJ2PKqe\nKoVxPl9dHg6s7vdhM9HT\n=4GRZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T08:01:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/f6169a3569e010f6f637dcf3331f0ef44e09e6d7","node_id":"C_kwDOSLwOTNoAKGY2MTY5YTM1NjllMDEwZjZmNjM3ZGNmMzMzMWYwZWY0NGUwOWU2ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/ecf0099d3f800fbadcfcee2e9ab4d87856021398","sha":"ecf0099d3f800fbadcfcee2e9ab4d87856021398","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/ecf0099d3f800fbadcfcee2e9ab4d87856021398"}],"sha":"f6169a3569e010f6f637dcf3331f0ef44e09e6d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/f6169a3569e010f6f637dcf3331f0ef44e09e6d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244165292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zeynep-serban","id":244165292,"login":"zeynep-serban","node_id":"U_kgDODo2qrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeynep-serban","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/ecf0099d3f800fbadcfcee2e9ab4d87856021398/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:56:34Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr","name":"zeynep-serban"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:56:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(shell): keep the internal shell off the candidate surface, give staff a way back (#1047 A) (#1188)\n\n* test(shell): the candidate surface must not carry the internal shell\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#1047. Tests only (plus the thin strip they\nrender and a named export for the layout): reached from inside the shell,\nthe candidate surface still shows the internal sidebar, search header and\nbreadcrumb, and signed-in staff get no way back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): keep the internal shell off the candidate surface\n\nShellLayout wraps AppRouter, so a staff member reaching a public\ncandidate route from inside the shell saw the internal sidebar, the\nsearch header and the breadcrumb on a surface that belongs to the\ncandidate; a full page load, by contrast, renders the candidate bundle\nwith no shell at all and no way back. On public candidate paths the\nsidebar, search header, breadcrumb and mobile bar are no longer\nrendered, and signed-in staff get a thin strip back to the internal page\nthey came from. Without a session the strip is absent from the DOM.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#1047 (slice 1047-A).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ec2bda620089dad1ed387df9597baeee1091cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/2ec2bda620089dad1ed387df9597baeee1091cb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/ecf0099d3f800fbadcfcee2e9ab4d87856021398","verification":{"payload":"tree 2ec2bda620089dad1ed387df9597baeee1091cb3\nparent cc6ed8746962e0fd112990863bc6a99a9ca95aee\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1790150194 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790150194 +0300\n\nfix(shell): keep the internal shell off the candidate surface, give staff a way back (#1047 A) (#1188)\n\n* test(shell): the candidate surface must not carry the internal shell\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#1047. Tests only (plus the thin strip they\nrender and a named export for the layout): reached from inside the shell,\nthe candidate surface still shows the internal sidebar, search header and\nbreadcrumb, and signed-in staff get no way back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(shell): keep the internal shell off the candidate surface\n\nShellLayout wraps AppRouter, so a staff member reaching a public\ncandidate route from inside the shell saw the internal sidebar, the\nsearch header and the breadcrumb on a surface that belongs to the\ncandidate; a full page load, by contrast, renders the candidate bundle\nwith no shell at all and no way back. On public candidate paths the\nsidebar, search header, breadcrumb and mobile bar are no longer\nrendered, and signed-in staff get a thin strip back to the internal page\nthey came from. Without a session the strip is absent from the DOM.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#1047 (slice 1047-A).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs4YyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOxQQACiNA7wTZ6X4SXcYKMi5461r\nS7dpY7fo7Eb0F1Sl9g+HSnblcLgJDEMm0VyWK8y7bja39tcCbPjcTTi7afJx1kFC\nSFunwPXsDMKF2PNYlbiDUADWdRpRD7e0VZkx+XUvr+NRX7EfTDAYeiVHE/Qa7fYr\nCBZBKsl0LcKhP8qZ+LlCbJ14ERUXOUU8lJAzRLk9Jxr4fBXk+9/pIGFS4HxzwLVJ\n/JhN24GRkjoLisq74UaWDG/V/lfeUxdNiAXXfJhyxRVCcC4hANimgGKdvPioRfEa\nQF2T2+wLbARysoFPFexvdjmhR0QbCxMHgtjtHwM9L/5s3Z5I0sk98E9ErIKdWpqL\n2BIosarL7AYughXoncPPpfTiIi/eCbgzRz0vR6y1gf6SrZXnN0pu1i+rKwDSiyQ+\nRmunlhvzysNKKc/usBefYg2CgaceY6hvX+NAYlDTbbEEomvNLyu9LM6uvg5crago\nvOzyQcqw1pG86naBHwvBxgg+ecw7Lb9+ax6zGfI6cuJ/xHbV4a3l/h2D/h5c5b3a\nGRWGPQdPb5ISkY9Ug0S/JVGOxH6sA5lN1LUo+MjqLVsoR6BHH23QVCE6VbWBT/OY\nc2pdwflZKtIN6z0MhRC6LJ8lvNRMUaH5gCNQV72TaLpxrNHJrnRd8l0NGcVbycU2\nWYbYgGXWsUctvb/9V03w\n=9K2V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\