u/platform-web#965 (slice 965-A). Test only: fails until the\nportal stops reading STATUS_COPY[x].label without a fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): show a neutral status instead of crashing on an unknown value\n\nThe candidate portal read STATUS_COPY[x].label unguarded in four places;\na status the web bundle does not know yet crashed the whole portal.\nUnknown status/nextAction now render neutral candidate copy; the raw\nserver code is never shown.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#965 (slice 965-A).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç <zeynep.akkilic@acik.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b5fa0ece881026cd875d04dad7b4fe59f48a062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/1b5fa0ece881026cd875d04dad7b4fe59f48a062"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/21da64d878c5e259ace5dc8c5c13cb558e55efb0","verification":{"payload":"tree 1b5fa0ece881026cd875d04dad7b4fe59f48a062\nparent c39b9df025c3b3391fd54c243cb1d2660e59bace\nauthor zeynep-serban <zeynep.akkilic@serban.com.tr> 1789452896 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789452896 +0300\n\nfix(ats): candidate portal survives an unknown application status (#965 A) (#1179)\n\n* test(ats): candidate portal must survive an unknown application status\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#965 (slice 965-A). Test only: fails until the\nportal stops reading STATUS_COPY[x].label without a fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ats): show a neutral status instead of crashing on an unknown value\n\nThe candidate portal read STATUS_COPY[x].label unguarded in four places;\na status the web bundle does not know yet crashed the whole portal.\nUnknown status/nextAction now render neutral candidate copy; the raw\nserver code is never shown.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-web#965 (slice 965-A).\n\