/api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/b013af1eb030864799dc50c8c1907a19b056551c","node_id":"C_kwDOSLwOTNoAKGIwMTNhZjFlYjAzMDg2NDc5OWRjNTBjOGMxOTA3YTE5YjA1NjU1MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/311c240e0fdf581fa9f0c4f7310bb8cd70667091","sha":"311c240e0fdf581fa9f0c4f7310bb8cd70667091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/311c240e0fdf581fa9f0c4f7310bb8cd70667091"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/937973893b5fde2bad6d5b637623bcb341cca043","sha":"937973893b5fde2bad6d5b637623bcb341cca043","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/937973893b5fde2bad6d5b637623bcb341cca043"}],"sha":"b013af1eb030864799dc50c8c1907a19b056551c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/b013af1eb030864799dc50c8c1907a19b056551c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/937973893b5fde2bad6d5b637623bcb341cca043/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T23:02:46Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@acik.com","name":"Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T23:02:46Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@acik.com","name":"Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç"},"message":"fix(#992): cakisma sonrasi aday mesaji ve IK ret onayi sifirlanir\n\nA1 — application-api.ts withdrawCandidateApplication: bu uc noktada 409''un\ntek anlami \"durum bu arada degisti\" (ats withdrawCandidate yalniz\nILLEGAL_TRANSITION icin 409 doner, reason alani yok). Aday artik ham kod\nyerine sunu goruyor: \"Basvurunuzun durumu bu arada degistigi icin geri\ncekme islemi yapilamadi. Guncel durumu bu sayfada gorebilirsiniz.\" Sayfa\nardindan guncel durumu zaten yeniden yukluyor (refresh); sahte basari yok.\nSunucuya dokunulmadi.\n\nA2 — RecruiterApplicationReviewPanel.tsx changeStatus: hata yolunda ret onay\npaneli ve onay kutusu sifirlaniyor (basari yolundaki gibi). Sifirlayan efekt\nyalniz publicRef degisince calistigi icin, yeniden yuklemeden sonra eski\nsurume verilmis onay degismis kayit uzerinde kullanilabiliyordu. Artik IK\nguncel kaydi gordukten sonra yeniden onaylamak zorunda. Tum hata turlerinde\nsifirlaniyor: istek basarisiz olup kayit yeniden yuklendiginde onay, gorunen\nkayit icin yeniden alinmali.\n\nKANIT\n- Once kirmizi: onceki commit 71dc71a, CI run 34723479204 — yalniz\n  Unit (jsdom) kirmizi, \"Failed Tests 2\" = tam bu iki test.\n- Sonra yesil: yerel ve DEV klonunda application-api.test,\n  RecruiterWorkspacePage.test, CandidatePortalPage.test: 97/97.\n- tsc: mfe-shell toplam hata sayisi tabanla ayni (527); degisen urun\n  dosyalarinda yeni hata yok.\n\nKapsam disi: #992 madde 4 (direct-route/off-origin canli paket) ve 5\n(reflow %200-400 / ekran okuyucu) — issue''da kapsam soruldu.\n\nRefs: Halildeu/platform-web#992\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b86b882696106f7decbfb3d7d4d8850618463af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/8b86b882696106f7decbfb3d7d4d8850618463af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/937973893b5fde2bad6d5b637623bcb341cca043","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/937973893b5fde2bad6d5b637623bcb341cca043","node_id":"C_kwDOSLwOTNoAKDkzNzk3Mzg5M2I1ZmRlMmJhZDZkNWI2Mzc2MjNiY2IzNDFjY2EwNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/71dc71abbbbd83f2c0c0abd45458c874145e3c54","sha":"71dc71abbbbd83f2c0c0abd45458c874145e3c54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/71dc71abbbbd83f2c0c0abd45458c874145e3c54"}],"sha":"937973893b5fde2bad6d5b637623bcb341cca043","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/937973893b5fde2bad6d5b637623bcb341cca043"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/71dc71abbbbd83f2c0c0abd45458c874145e3c54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:42:31Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@acik.com","name":"Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:42:31Z","email":"zeynep.akkilic@acik.com","name":"Zeynep Nisa Akkılıç"},"message":"test(#992): cakisma sonrasi aday mesaji ve IK ret onayi (KIRMIZI)\n\n#992 Dilim A''nin ilk adimi: once mevcut main''de BASARISIZ testler. Bu commit\nYALNIZ testleri ekler; urun kodu degismedi.\n\nA1 (application-api.test.ts): geri cekme 409 govdesi ats\nApplicationApiController.withdrawCandidate''in birebir sekli\n({error:''ILLEGAL_TRANSITION'', currentStatus, currentVersion}, reason yok).\nsafeJson mesaji `reason ?? error` ile kurdugu icin aday ham\nILLEGAL_TRANSITION goruyor.\n\nA2 (RecruiterWorkspacePage.test.tsx): ret istegi 409 alir, kayit yeni\nsurumle (hala erken asama, INTERVIEW_PENDING) yeniden yuklenir. Ret onayi\nsifirlanmadigi icin panel eski onayla acik kaliyor. Bu dosyadaki\ndescribeAtsError taklidi yalniz 403''u esledigi icin hata metni bilerek\nassert edilmiyor; testin iddiasi onayin tasinmamasi.\n\nOlcum (duzeltme yok): yerel ve DEV klonunda ayni sonuc: 97 testten 2''si\nkirmizi, kirmizi olanlar tam bu iki test:\n  A1: expected ''ILLEGAL_TRANSITION'' not to contain ''ILLEGAL_TRANSITION''\n  A2: Unable to find role=\"button\" and name \"Ret kararini hazirla\"\n      (panel eski onayla acik kaldigi icin)\n\nRefs: Halildeu/platform-web#992\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a94ed8ccf195b0d0d4203cd134c09511d4eefa57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/a94ed8ccf195b0d0d4203cd134c09511d4eefa57"},"url":"https:/