D by contract (platform-web#1155) (#1167)\n\nAfter #1162 the manager''s grid-variants call carries the session token; the\nservice now answers 403 ''Gerekli yetki yok: VARIANTS_READ'' because the Faz 35\nleast-privilege contract gives ETIK_SPEAK_MANAGER exactly MODULE:ETHIC:MANAGE.\nThe manager journey never used presets, so the cell no longer asks for them:\nEntityGridTemplate gains variants=''on''|''off'' (default on; off mounts no\nVariantIntegration, so no request can be made) and CaseListWorkspace passes\noff. Granting the permission is a separate product decision (gitops#3665).\nCodex 01a08f1f decision: A.\n\nTests: default mounts the variant integration; variants=off mounts none.\ndesign-system EntityGridTemplate suite 26 pass, manager 38, mfe-ethic 110,\nmanager tsc clean.","tree":{"sha":"2dc6e662968f7affc88d179003dbfb89348a1c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/2dc6e662968f7affc88d179003dbfb89348a1c65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/24e40f6dc5875e4a70ef793d032e270b0638efb8","verification":{"payload":"tree 2dc6e662968f7affc88d179003dbfb89348a1c65\nparent 47ebe5bc2ba49dd08317adb7df3b5b6b0a48325a\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1789112525 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789112525 +0300\n\nfix(mfe-ethic): case grid runs without the variant integration — role has no VARIANTS_READ by contract (platform-web#1155) (#1167)\n\nAfter #1162 the manager''s grid-variants call carries the session token; the\nservice now answers 403 ''Gerekli yetki yok: VARIANTS_READ'' because the Faz 35\nleast-privilege contract gives ETIK_SPEAK_MANAGER exactly MODULE:ETHIC:MANAGE.\nThe manager journey never used presets, so the cell no longer asks for them:\nEntityGridTemplate gains variants=''on''|''off'' (default on; off mounts no\nVariantIntegration, so no request can be made) and CaseListWorkspace passes\noff. Granting the permission is a separate product decision (gitops#3665).\nCodex 01a08f1f decision: A.\n\nTests: default mounts the variant integration; variants=off mounts none.\ndesign-system EntityGridTemplate suite 26 pass, manager 38, mfe-ethic 110,\nmanager tsc clean.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo7DNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyG0QAE4bS47/XeY5wJCGANP2PH+F\n6GvSNDz9OhBoCyH7We4LktdLyHIl3jdbXkAtFpVETgPycVvWA+ybPLdhySP+fsKK\n6ardZ75MuRS3Ag4EqQ39JHbMfxt0qBnCcTQkqXQbYa9mFoBdfEID6vth9Fso3LzX\nvp6QnycMsf7ImLxYELhxtNrrFJ1XdrsQq7TP/qe2xoXdk1SjrYxOVHE6jLSPtiwX\nbysprMUh39rWp7wrJFeFswBieNychfgHAQ22Zcj1pd4qqIWxIAovGouWtoL0EH3O\nK78aspvFgI92AD8bu1R6RkDr479CF2HZF4ViJH+TNeFHBFY7aisrlmqjeOBsMxiH\nqnCBC/4/ulf+F0JPL8RugZ9bpwQeyksXsobJ7lZoRmoag0Y4HfeQnsy6PJSbiBQF\nNpPa5DZ1VOoqntuPlU5NZPJulILeQf5jKXxn3EKFNZO2IG1cNIccDCFlSfltKo52\nE1uE09YNhfoUTvvsHaGYBC0JbWpxNp+7f2UF/88yxzcLd+JQMma9wVk9wOBnipR3\nM50lD3QG56brYFBkSE4zgRitqu5aulHVQ7gZ+v6gbrXLnq0On6D/z09me7xkOwc1\nWeXAGyG7CiEwdtHlohj6sA0PSdejMsNeZmLO+yXBLVwzRpEWKxzZ+cNbvWgRmTbK\nC4DqTfrdFXePtOeNboZb\n=rKfK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-11T07:42:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/us