tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/2ee2a8aea390da617df21fe23b2a6c2e3215872e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T07:02:36Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T07:02:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(design-system): VariantIntegration stops touching state after unmount or a superseded gridId (#1165)\n\n* fix(design-system): VariantIntegration stops touching state after unmount or a superseded gridId\n\nWeb Test Gate 2026-09-11 (run 34571036236, PR #1162): ''Unhandled Rejection —\nReferenceError: window is not defined'' from VariantIntegration.tsx: the variants\nfetch settled after the test file''s jsdom was torn down and\nfinally { setLoading(false) } ran on an unmounted tree. State is now touched only\nwhile mounted and while the answer belongs to the current gridId; a superseded\ngridId''s answer is dropped.\n\nTests (both fail on the previous code, pass now): late resolve after unmount\nwith the window gone produces no unhandled rejection; a stale grid-a answer is\nnot shown after the component moved to grid-b.\n\n* test(design-system): always detach the unhandledRejection probe; narrow the guard comment to the effect-triggered fetch (Codex 01a08f43)","tree":{"sha":"dce7608bb3653b93f39d6242d2472c8752e8e4e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/dce7608bb3653b93f39d6242d2472c8752e8e4e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/2ee2a8aea390da617df21fe23b2a6c2e3215872e","verification":{"payload":"tree dce7608bb3653b93f39d6242d2472c8752e8e4e2\nparent 5c327d996998e5355ec76fd52cd195f9713873f5\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1789110156 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789110156 +0300\n\nfix(design-system): VariantIntegration stops touching state after unmount or a superseded gridId (#1165)\n\n* fix(design-system): VariantIntegration stops touching state after unmount or a superseded gridId\n\nWeb Test Gate 2026-09-11 (run 34571036236, PR #1162): ''Unhandled Rejection —\nReferenceError: window is not defined'' from VariantIntegration.tsx: the variants\nfetch settled after the test file''s jsdom was torn down and\nfinally { setLoading(false) } ran on an unmounted tree. State is now touched only\nwhile mounted and while the answer belongs to the current gridId; a superseded\ngridId''s answer is dropped.\n\nTests (both fail on the previous code, pass now): late resolve after unmount\nwith the window gone produces no unhandled rejection; a stale grid-a answer is\nnot shown after the component moved to grid-b.\n\n* test(design-system): always detach the unhandledRejection probe; narrow the guard comment to the effect-triggered fetch (Codex 01a08f43)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo6eMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4AMQABWCpPElvY8RTwkZzPeCs4+L\nqB2ja1Q0Spi4DQH2ms093vH3ZwvKg3QHhpyRyBh9TkfWr9AMCMRIhAGudqiMstXc\nYeauVcAZ4h9kRfkJLVTLKaqXUQORoPuVlHWfmHgcy7CN4lYXhQAxqxq0WyLJ7/pG\nEuabypTWqkUTzKzS4VTakM5XNI6OMQpW0VD6jpvRX+y/X6K9vZW6+dwNuoROu4Wk\n/G0OGO53ezZGV3KJ6CgiQ7ujWiw5RcP1NvbyStSMpdlPb74C73+r0odG1ZVMbVqI\nfG4IXhCbck5uD3lNUfHuOsqSoDoYQGjouyiJEvyr9nkfRK8nfofeuURB+uWitCCj\nmlGRf1DGF84uoxOAXLBN30SGMxeZHjrZ6+jdirBD4jrfw/sRRgl/+b7/x0Rf9tLe\nPvEMJJk7A/KMOf5iJMS0EsPNgiikgQKWXzMIg/HwLLhgJLPdJunB7zjLJljVVyaP\nPj/bxKu006T1h65qp7DWxtNnMEHX/rJ7BURX+rki0tnBi9WUiGRYJkaWAH5kEMfi\nePgYYPvZUFG6EmByBEb/tJXFR8+lw8MKMP7VhTuCox5uEyWBP4xkcLg6HEePk06S\nokH/xRZ5aMTfKPxw