url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/5a2b6d1352234f1c9e7801d3c695d6603c1098e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:02:03Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T10:02:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mfe-meeting): CitationTrail links citations anchored on DRAFT segments (#1138)\n\nmeeting-api (#1135/#1136) resolves citations by canonical offsets and binds\nthem to the segment the quoted sentence starts in — on testai that segment is\nDRAFT, because transcript-service never flips segment status on finalization.\nCitationTrail still dropped every citation whose segment was not `final`, so a\ndecision with a resolved citation (live b8ca6dbf: decisions 1/2/2 citations in\nthe React props) rendered \"Kaynak doğrulanmadı\" anyway.\n\nAnchor on any non-REDACTED segment; the citation itself already proved its\nquote against the snapshot. Test: the existing final-segment link case is\nmirrored with a DRAFT segment.","tree":{"sha":"68ac5d2d462238ce6176e1c5c48611f8af21e528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/68ac5d2d462238ce6176e1c5c48611f