deu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/c64ac45ddb2005c5258e8aa1677ade74c04c0c88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:44:56Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:44:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mfe-meeting): ground the extractive summary sentence by sentence (#1137)\n\nThe summary meeting-ai delivers is a join of selected transcript sentences and\nsummary_citations carries one claim per selected sentence; no citation ever\nequals the whole summary. citationsForClaim compared the full summary text\nagainst each claim, so the summary never resolved and the \"Kaynaklı çıktılar\"\ngate stayed pending even when every decision was grounded (live b8ca6dbf after\n#1136: 3/3 decisions resolved, summary 0/2, gate pending).\n\ncitationsForSummary accepts a summary citation when its claim is a sentence of\nthe summary (normalized substring) and resolves it by canonical offsets like\nany other citation. Tests: a two-sentence summary grounds through both\ncitations and passes the gate; a citation whose claim is not in the summary is\nignored. 99 passed; tsc + eslint clean.","tree":{"sha":"0eae4f7de8ae297226e540a810a8d647b05cef4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/0eae4f7de8ae297226e540a810a8d647b05cef4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/c64ac45ddb2005c5258e8aa1677ade74c04c0c88","ve