ldeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/a86be52dc69020a31eedda5762a424b5d109172a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:10:31Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:10:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mfe-meeting): DRAFT segments are citation sources — the canonical snapshot is built from ASR text (#1136)\n\nLive check after 5adfb4c7 (testai, meeting b8ca6dbf): every citation still\nresolved to nothing because /admin/transcripts returns all 96 segments as\nDRAFT. transcript-service never flips a segment''s editorial status on\nfinalization; FinalizedTranscriptSnapshotCodec takes textFinal for FINALIZED\nrows and textDraft for DRAFT rows, so the snapshot meeting-ai analysed is the\nDRAFT text. Requiring `status === ''final''` therefore excluded the exact text\nthe offsets point at.\n\ncanonicalSegmentSpans now takes every non-REDACTED segment in order (the same\ntext mapTranscript already renders: textFinal || textDraft); the slice check\nagainst source_text still rejects a segment edited after the snapshot. Tests:\nDRAFT fixture rows now carry textDraft like the live API; the \"draft is never\ngrounded\" case becomes \"REDACTED or mismatched is never grounded\" plus a\npositive DRAFT case asserting the Kaynaklı çıktılar gate passes. 97 passed.","tree":{"sha":"9242984fb67a5f30cb74d8180de1984b482a5cf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/9242984fb67a5f30cb74d8180de1984b482a5cf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/a86be52dc69020a31eedda5762a424b5d109172a","verification":{"payload":"tree 9242984fb67a5f30cb74d8180de1984b482a5cf9\nparent e9dec1929573e9a6dac23192bca8bf589367e67d\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1788426631 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788426631 +0300\n\nfix(mfe-meeting): DRAFT segments are citation sources — the canonical snapshot is built from ASR text (#1136)\n\nLive check after 5adfb4c7 (testai, meeting b8ca6dbf): every citation still\nresolved to nothing because /admin/transcripts returns all 96 segments as\nDRAFT. transcript-service never flips a segment''s editorial status on\nfinalization; FinalizedTranscriptSnapshotCodec takes textFinal for FINALIZED\nrows and textDraft for DRAFT rows, so the snapshot meeting-ai analysed is the\nDRAFT text. Requiring `status === ''final''` therefore excluded the exact text\nthe offsets point at.\n\ncanonicalSegmentSpans now takes every non-REDACTED segment in order (the same\ntext mapTranscript already renders: textFinal || textDraft); the slice check\nagainst source_text still rejects a segment edited after the snapshot. Tests:\nDRAFT fixture rows now carry textDraft like the live API; the \"draft is never\ngrounded\" case becomes \"REDACTED or mismatched is never grounded\" plus a\npositive DRAFT case asserting the Kaynaklı çıktılar gate passes. 97 passed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmTmHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAa50QAI0LS5E/j/yNZA5zLs0ZZTby\ne+xMlb0jUC2CKxEgNPayYzkF0ooBPvxlSAeAtBwXoCMkuLQc4Fgkk4IJrJtnXayW\nyGHSK9vfpWyuBKTkg5JMZMIhF0QKWKKz0XJ7raLipEI1qsTYxp/7v0WoF0RBUPYK\nsQnQY6Jz3A1IXdo4Vg8FxWG3Co/hG6c5dg5BxFEhSJIuLIHLHveS/9/jtqIATef5\n/ML+JU9uO+9rdYfaZAaRIQfMdMeLf0t41JggQJE0watWXnMNBp7n4BWrXpSavI/Z\n1YbmukbaUITBc+n7Ra3Z5i923Lqw54YrECAwykx0a4XzIBCFc9YoKBJPAnjQEnvf\nNg/mvuaS4xt1y6gIVaVgSBx2