_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/e9dec1929573e9a6dac23192bca8bf589367e67d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T08:30:03Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T08:30:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mfe-meeting): resolve intelligence citations by canonical transcript offsets, not segment index (#1135)\n\nmeeting-ai cites the analysed canonical transcript (final segments joined with\n\"\\n\") by character offset; `source_index` is its own sentence number. The panel\ntreated `source_index` as a transcript segment index, required the segment text\nto equal the quoted sentence and read `source_char_*` relative to `source_text`.\nOnce meeting-ai started gluing unpunctuated STT lines into one sentence\n(platform-ai#334/#335) no citation could resolve: every decision on\ntestai carried \"Kaynak doğrulanmadı\" and the \"Kaynaklı çıktılar\" gate stayed\npending although all five runs were verified (gitops#3526, 2026-09-03).\n\nresolveCitation now rebuilds the canonical text from the ordered final\nsegments, checks that the slice at `source_char_start..end` reproduces the\nquoted sentence, and binds the citation to the segment the sentence starts in\n(start-time check kept). `normalizedText` also drops a stray space before\npunctuation so a sentence built from a lone \".\" line still matches its slice.\n\nTests: fixtures now carry canonical offsets; new cases cover a sentence\nspanning several STT lines and offsets that do not reproduce the quote.\n96 passed; tsc + eslint clean.","tree":{"sha":"cf1ff45d4c52bbd4cc0f1cbcf3a3ecc0f9f1ab6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/cf1ff45d4c52bbd4cc0f1cbcf3a3ecc0f9f1ab6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/e9dec1929573e9a6dac23192bca8bf589367e67d","verification":{"payload":"tree cf1ff45d4c52bbd4cc0f1cbcf3a3ecc0f9f1ab6e\nparent f2589f5a6895f0cc3b5024b4967b2f8c4144c0c7\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1788424203 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788424203 +0300\n\nfix(mfe-meeting): resolve intelligence citations by canonical transcript offsets, not segment index (#1135)\n\nmeeting-ai cites the analysed canonical transcript (final segments joined with\n\"\\n\") by character offset; `source_index` is its own sentence number. The panel\ntreated `source_index` as a transcript segment index, required the segment text\nto equal the quoted sentence and read `source_char_*` relative to `source_text`.\nOnce meeting-ai started gluing unpunctuated STT lines into one sentence\n(platform-ai#334/#335) no citation could resolve: every decision on\ntestai carried \"Kaynak doğrulanmadı\" and the \"Kaynaklı çıktılar\" gate stayed\npending although all five runs were verified (gitops#3526, 2026-09-03).\n\nresolveCitation now rebuilds the canonical text from the ordered final\nsegments, checks that the slice at `source_char_start..end` reproduces the\nquoted sentence, and binds the citation to the segment the sentence starts in\n(start-time check kept). `normalizedText` also drops a stray space before\npunctuation so a sentence built from a lone \".\" line still matches its slice.\n\nTests: fixtures now carry canonical offsets; new cases cover a sentence\nspanning several STT lines and offsets that do not reproduce the quote.\n96 passed; tsc + eslint clean.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmTALCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2+MQAH9Kf0HJOrLLozkqI9uVlsuF\n+Brw+Z9r63ORu2sFmgSbjzR53m7/LLREySDOOnHEgkgodaEqMjqbPtr4Y2R1njYL\nmVCL8N1u8HTSysQW0fTRmOcclMxJ/U0RinTi5NHGoN6kYpdm3L/REyF8gXXXgxqJ\nECyOTuZap4G/6ATjSwLXvZ0DYXKAYLQ8zQX8ASKZzBgPEZ+w5a3qDNYA/T+d5Md0\nv/1We3dW9GOkSnDqT3lPKo2leUclfph4wTeK7EEOVJaXyTDLwz2x3hoU9VY7w8pC\nIykuVdYi5ixZsQSTaVahGrhw7p7qSlTRfB7OD/8Gph+otBrh7xfE8joq5w/NZnCm\nmJ/SVscqxXgjYsReIKZ1uKQlqs2tSyPUcmKbSufE1pZ2HxMf+R7ggcTz6iRDD+ex\nlCunY2A2PM5FWA2hg0p20MhsQdnbllnd9dw/+hBoBNzoKTPU6N3eKFH65dvVwZJW\nQqMkyEcbH3EG6iu4iq7GSzPV8zRBH672r9fuPIVK04nb04S9zQvfWfjGKXY9WmOO\nYQf0aWQmYFu9dITnp1bgOVs+hRi0cCuTA+GvvNq6+HZoa7q7CtUW7QYa/iM3kq05\n10thpd72SJ9Kknyo/0a6wmPW5HOniHhqPWEYcyLngcnDgzBPq32LehfQQfagdYi/\njrAFbhkLX2rduLEa6bVX\n=c0+C\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T08:30:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u