eu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:45:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(budget-workspace): plan vs actual by account code in the PYP breakdown (gitops#3496 slice C) (#1132)\n\nThe PYP section now answers the whole question in one place: after the\ndrill-down loads, the current plan (new /plans/current discovery read)\njoins the scanned ledger rows on the MEASURED key — the accounting\naccount code (the plan''s item id matches no item master: 0/15 in 2026;\ncodes are 3-level and present on 100% of ledger rows). Comparison table:\ncode, planned (EXPENSE lines), actual (ALL debit rows on that code —\nlabeled or not, because the plan is code-keyed), variance colored by\noverrun. Missing plan degrades honestly to a pointer at the import step.\n\n39/39 module tests (comparison unit rules: income excluded, unlabeled\ndebit rows counted, variance math; component: plan-present table,\nplan-missing notice), tsc/eslint clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1dc7e307f72fb25c6b58366c76151d277be0660","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/b1dc7e307f72fb25c6b58366c76151d277be0660"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/f2589f5a6895f0cc3b5024b4967b2f8c4144c0c7","verification":{"payload":"tree b1dc7e307f72fb25c6b58366c76151d277be0660\nparent e9d2b7368186aaafbbb8d429623c853c1acc77a8\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1788093914 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788093914 +0300\n\nfeat(budget-workspace): plan vs actual by account code in the PYP breakdown (gitops#3496 slice C) (#1132)\n\nThe PYP section now answers the whole question in one place: after the\ndrill-down loads, the current plan (new /plans/current discovery read)\njoins the scanned ledger rows on the MEASURED key — the accounting\naccount code (the plan''s item id matches no item master: 0/15 in 2026;\ncodes are 3-level and present on 100% of ledger rows). Comparison table:\ncode, planned (EXPENSE lines), actual (ALL debit rows on that code —\nlabeled or not, because the plan is code-keyed), variance colored by\noverrun. Missing plan degrades honestly to a pointer at the import step.\n\n39/39 module tests (comparison unit rules: income excluded, unlabeled\ndebit rows counted, variance math; component: plan-present table,\nplan-missing notice), tsc/eslint clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlCXaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATisQADSd4Fl9uLJQpdqboREZ9uc8\nZbYccEfkazEoQhgWWop7Z6I26HNyOtSRAywbrhkieScJ84wP/7c/V+6V0Cw4WUNm\nGlDJRLQ2PzANkKPn9TrYgSDs/CHrJmNH7QdkaR6Q+WBKtznFrXv4Mgs65SXPqO7n\nm8QPQC/9u85tZBRdZQfpkltqi5p5UVKAjZYKpQUge9YYIBX+sgGGOSWjhVRIRQ3X\noLvP1OmzUMVAmBJZkT/gcpMi6VzU1YF9Z+dBkArSefWKAi11iM51ZtCiJ1eXCFvS\nkqf+wDcEvRbhRgmhBDwXbJZdCRxRYb8AdR5juH7bjLuJnFMSCvSy++odNJ/HF33c\n1SmNlH9FwFi7eZ/CrrHrrRRhpS3H9GwvWSPgqiMm3LvZO7/2j5RdvXpP+fK97prx\nmMAS1iE7/Almicv+dZ6RYEQ10n08igF9aeg3kTCWu/guTDLyYJC0AWU+8jiakaz0\ntL5jZE8T7qydBq9qnegCZ4F+ttrBMOMXyiqIQisD2X1ACLt5gKRTQb6sN/fyjGhP\nmhBUpnPWjzcmD2LxUUzvQ9V1OFEVud1fp/YSpDJ9xTHETSaJDXIvPZaDiLqE63qo\nxhgKs3qqwhQOLXeG7NWsYcSN89McQ0q4evbaOYqtQmzs2tgCgbzpaLkDBF5oMbEm\nivrBFAVwdsrPiddgiB1o\n=30SN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T12:45:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/r