comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:50:15Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:50:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(budget-workspace): in-product PYP breakdown — ledger-spine drill-down (gitops#3496 Dilim D1) (#1131)\n\nThe PYP breakdown now lives where it belongs: inside Budget Workspace,\nin the product''s own design language, fed live by the pyp-actuals\nprovider (the external artifact preview was interim evidence only).\n\nNew PypBreakdownSection: fiscal-year picker -> pages the provider by\ncursor (cap 5x2000 with an honest truncation notice + scanned date\nrange) -> general-to-detail drill: PYP center (share bar) -> budget item\n-> individual source records (date, source kind, document no, ledger\nentry id, order lineage, account code, amount). Aggregation is\nledger-honest: only the debit side sums (the credit leg of the same\ndocument would zero the total), mixed-dimension documents are counted\nseparately and never guessed, undimensioned rows (bank/transfer/cari)\nare reported as such.\n\nEvidence: 35/35 module tests (aggregation rules unit-tested: debit-only,\nmixed/undimensioned separation, ordering; component: cursor paging,\nthree-level drill, fail-closed authz error), tsc clean for the new file,\neslint clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e58af01fe28a578d139604560be969dc2e89953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/0e58af01fe28a578d139604560be969dc2e89953"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/e9d2b7368186aaafbbb8d429623c853c1acc77a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e58af01fe28a578d139604560be969dc2e89953\nparent cb27d8435f194df82ee3c49be3292bc7e8ca79b4\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1788079815 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788079815 +0300\n\nfeat(budget-workspace): in-product PYP breakdown — ledger-spine drill-down (gitops#3496 Dilim D1) (#1131)\n\nThe PYP breakdown now lives where it belongs: inside Budget Workspace,\nin the product''s own design language, fed live by the pyp-actuals\nprovider (the external artifact preview was interim evidence only).\n\nNew PypBreakdownSection: fiscal-year picker -> pages the provider by\ncursor (cap 5x2000 with an honest truncation notice + scanned date\nrange) -> general-to-detail drill: PYP center (share bar) -> budget item\n-> individual source records (date, source kind, document no, ledger\nentry id, order lineage, account code, amount). Aggregation is\nledger-honest: only the debit side sums (the credit leg of the same\ndocument would zero the total), mixed-dimension documents are counted\nseparately and never guessed, undimensioned rows (bank/transfer/cari)\nare reported as such.\n\nEvidence: 35/35 module tests (aggregation rules unit-tested: debit-only,\nmixed/undimensioned separation, ordering; component: cursor paging,\nthree-level drill, fail-closed authz error), tsc clean for the new file,\neslint clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqk+7HCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA18kQAC2x5en7G6qwL5Xvf/Y3rOgQ\nm/PqT6+nEG5S1TW5B/kHvbZitA44zoePBx6/oYweJZCnoDQdWyWkBcLPhHOakcbl\n1y84Ndk8DNCLZXP+Tr/zpqb1cJ9SvrnOFx0OdDvdSACjWLw/DWlILx06tVu96ARA\ngnxm6p4ot0Y74M2hSHA+KLv3SMs9n+BjuSWWygQijJ0GBCSB6rqm3G7Nyy4bf43o\nUnPyqNhO+OgiDQkx+FJT3Ml4wDr7bgxkgXYwFZlSNXZZqgVROMemY6ke29ZVKtmo\nM4eF/cIgQPKkaV0co3k/gTNvENKywRITbo7gglDEF7/PBVFcp3g36EIyYi/lJiZH\ncScgefrztVWeh6fOUJzA1g4XK5pLJpuohL8TIHvOiUonbgCnCsunTnziAn+Izk4e\n8ZeS7WxNZ+mT5Ev0DOsjFFM5PuS/ZlwClsswDP03vv+5QzTX9eF9Ca0dR3hujtq/\n+uYj0NX05tgcl9LBUN9nG1J6kUWWo0lzHDns9NyJyCzaQzO8SM6Fi31j4VcH8fMM\nZwzSQl8vC6+KLFxbDZvRVR5aII5as+B4Hl7nWQi04gWHUl9zelON93fIOAItgfqP\n0IAhtsu1gnktvzrBdtiT249eePKGhh9LKvUB2SchbsmJAHsmd1GMS8bXhIdBU+Pc\nJ+qcppOhGR7/Ml51JYax\n=QWHy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified