ae39b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/6f9ee66d8d3b7a8f4c1f4cc971b4a17edc854bd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T22:14:10Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T22:14:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(etik-speak): nginx tabani 1.27-alpine -> stable-alpine (nginx 1.30.4) — ES-306 (#2665) (#1112)\n\nCalisan imajlarin SBOM+grype taramasi 1.27-alpine tabaninda 13 Critical +\n56 High buldu: openssl CVE-2025-15467, libxml2 CVE-2025-49794/49796 basta\nolmak uzere hepsinin yamali surumu mevcut.\n\nAday tabanlar ayni tarayiciyla karsilastirildi (varsayim degil olcum):\n  1.27-alpine      Critical 13  High 56   (mevcut)\n  1.29-alpine      Critical 10  High 34\n  stable-alpine    Critical  0  High  2   <- secildi\n\nKalan iki High libtiff''te ve fix''i YOK; libtiff bu imajda yalniz taban paketi\nolarak duruyor, statik dosya sunan nginx onu cagirmiyor ve urunun goruntu\nayristirmasi zaten kendi JVM''imizde oluyor. Yorumda yazildi.\n\nIki imaj da SADECE digest ile sabitlendi. Manager''da onceki hal\netiket@digest idi; ikisini birlikte yazmak, etiket hareket ettiginde\nikisinin ayni seyi gosterdigi yanilsamasini birakiyor.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#2665\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4629cc78936146941ee891879c20d34ae02642b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/4629cc78936146941ee891879c20d34ae02642b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/6f9ee66d8d3b7a8f4c1f4cc971b4a17edc854bd1","verification":{"payload":"tree 4629cc78936146941ee891879c20d34ae02642b1\nparent 6ee5b470808e2c16867da686cecdd63dcfc17908\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785622450 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785622450 +0300\n\nfix(etik-speak): nginx tabani 1.27-alpine -> stable-alpine (nginx 1.30.4) — ES-306 (#2665) (#1112)\n\nCalisan imajlarin SBOM+grype taramasi 1.27-alpine tabaninda 13 Critical +\n56 High buldu: openssl CVE-2025-15467, libxml2 CVE-2025-49794/49796 basta\nolmak uzere hepsinin yamali surumu mevcut.\n\nAday tabanlar ayni tarayiciyla karsilastirildi (varsayim degil olcum):\n  1.27-alpine      Critical 13  High 56   (mevcut)\n  1.29-alpine      Critical 10  High 34\n  stable-alpine    Critical  0  High  2   <- secildi\n\nKalan iki High libtiff''te ve fix''i YOK; libtiff bu imajda yalniz taban paketi\nolarak duruyor, statik dosya sunan nginx onu cagirmiyor ve urunun goruntu\nayristirmasi zaten kendi JVM''imizde oluyor. Yorumda yazildi.\n\nIki imaj da SADECE digest ile sabitlendi. Manager''da onceki hal\netiket@digest idi; ikisini birlikte yazmak, etiket hareket ettiginde\nikisinin ayni seyi gosterdigi yanilsamasini birakiyor.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#2665\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbm+zCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj0QQAIC39Wv96yBFKqAs218U6yei\ne4x+w