r_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/72213c91d8462b1e5b1c1ffce51452cd10ac81ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T15:32:28Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T15:32:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mfe-ethic): alindi teyidi taslak kutusu — sunucu sablonu + eksik bolum uyarisi (#3271) (#1106)\n\n\"Alindi teyidi hazirla\" dugmesi artik SUNUCU taslagini ceker: kiracinin\nsablonu, vakanin kategori varyanti, yer tutucular dolu, kimlik surumlu.\nGonderim POST /acknowledgement ile gider — sablon kimligi deftere biner,\nbuton etiketi de degisir (\"Alindi teyidini gonder\").\n\n- Eksik zorunlu bolum uyarisi DUZENLERKEN gorunur (sunucu sozlugunun\n  aynasi, Turkce locale harf-duyarsiz): \"Yine de gonderebilirsiniz; eksik\n  denetim kaydina islenir\" — engel degil, gorunurluk.\n- Yerel taslak uretici durust fallback olarak kalir: sunucu taslagi\n  alinamazsa yerel metin + acik uyari, gonderim siradan yanit olarak gider\n  (sablon kimligi iddia edilmez).\n- Sablon kimligi vaka degisiminde/gonderim sonrasi/oturum temizliginde\n  sifirlanir — siradan yanit asla teyit kiligina girmez.\n\nvitest 63/63 (yeni: tam taslak eksiksiz, budanmis taslakta budananlar\nadlandirilir, dotted-i locale esitligi).\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#3271\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c7dc53fcb45785d632a06f732fbcd5419efa33b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/3c7dc53fcb45785d632a06f732fbcd5419efa33b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/72213c91d8462b1e5b1c1ffce51452cd10ac81ec","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c7dc53fcb45785d632a06f732fbcd5419efa33b\nparent d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785598348 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785598348 +0300\n\nfeat(mfe-ethic): alindi teyidi taslak kutusu — sunucu sablonu + eksik bolum uyarisi (#3271) (#1106)\n\n\"Alindi teyidi hazirla\" dugmesi artik SUNUCU taslagini ceker: kiracinin\nsablonu, vakanin kategori varyanti, yer tutucular dolu, kimlik surumlu.\nGonderim POST /acknowledgement ile gider — sablon kimligi deftere biner,\nbuton etiketi de degisir (\"Alindi teyidini gonder\").\n\n- Eksik zorunlu bolum uyarisi DUZENLERKEN gorunur (sunucu sozlugunun\n  aynasi, Turkce locale harf-duyarsiz): \"Yine de gonderebilirsiniz; eksik\n  denetim kaydina islenir\" — engel degil, gorunurluk.\n- Yerel taslak uretici durust fallback olarak kalir: sunucu taslagi\n  alinamazsa yerel metin + acik uyari, gonderim siradan yanit olarak gider\n  (sablon kimligi iddia edilmez).\n- Sablon kimligi vaka degisiminde/gonderim sonrasi/oturum temizliginde\n  sifirlanir — siradan yanit asla teyit kiligina girmez.\n\nvitest 63/63 (yeni: tam taslak eksiksiz, budanmis taslakta budananlar\nadlandirilir, dotted-i locale esitligi).\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#3271\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbhGMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7B0QAGB9vtxd7NRTpo/oO4zxvjxB\nrSlnijCWyvDeV86GsTWrw/fNkMkLIP1WyQj8cgezjxH2ph3globHCroQjZAFZh2Q\niU0eIh59Tttyhfne9urdMvruP1pbpQLMAbnpcjVHBmwrH10TYjyhc6o93aNBFkWl\npb3p8Tn77O23h7XPHBzXkquRYu52A+6nBoZ/ZZwA4QYuBgn7YUdrtjU1D5LPL/eo\n+q5lpE8ooKE97nqjpWIXkgf+l02zZ9MxtHag/rmvQEVfvMdL0UWNRdtGQKDN0g7p\ny18H6GZqqsg5uOudbImRj5Dxogv9SGV0C2aYsJjN6egFBV/evsykmU36zaFW0sov\nX07L2XWFq/lSZD//rePw5moxnXo6RfSJR3nqFY2xzv1gExUNAOo+D836V0IoroDc\n+HIhjKXHc6sQgMpcUzUIzg1YSn2uW9LDMoCaIS5v+sNuxIa0KNYwu1rx6R4HhlW2\nkvS2USPLrZVpb9LHZFvw1JV27hyq6nbHStcaCJUj/MWBSxyyMY15yZfMa3ZMILV1\nAP9fmr7M+Y7qecaLjJSlstmK/YHlFVRSojEGo3uuZtFWm9a68xgYd7P9PbQtLjLg\nolvbFvV18zGIN+fWuhePcBUKGoWIc+IsYCV+y/gVT0vysZRGMgREK9T6xqXg74ed\n4xd+nmAkfxJ9/9+vTdcq\n=1PuE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T15:32:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/72213c91d8462b1e5b1c1ffce51452cd10ac81ec","node_id":"C_kwDOSLwOTNoAKDcyMjEzYzkxZDg0NjJiMWU1YjFjMWZmY2U1MTQ1MmNkMTBhYzgxZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab","sha":"d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab"}],"sha":"72213c91d8462b1e5b1c1ffce51452cd10ac81ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/72213c91d8462b1e5b1c1ffce51452cd10ac81ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:45:08Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T14:45:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mfe-users): show the login name as a grid column, and make sorting work (#1105)\n\nAdds a `Kullanıcı Adı` / `Username` column to the users grid. Since\ngitops#3245 renamed the operator accounts to plain handles, `email` no\nlonger doubles as the login identity, and the grid had no way to say\nwhich login a row belongs to. It sits above `email` on purpose: the\nlogin name is the one an operator reaches for when something has to be\ndone to the account.\n\nUnreconciled rows render blank rather than falling back to the e-mail\naddress. Showing the address in place of an unknown login name would\nresurrect exactly the conflation gitops#3245 undid; blank honestly\nmeans \"not a Keycloak-linked account\".\n\nWhile wiring its sort, found that sorting has been silently inert for\nfour columns already. The grid names columns for what they show\n(`fullName`, `lastLoginAt`) while user-service names them after JPA\nfields (`name`, `lastLogin`) and validates `sort` against an allow-list\n— an unrecognised field is dropped without a word, and rows still come\nback, merely in the default order. So the column looked sortable and\ndid nothing. The colId → field map existed but was reachable only from\nthe advanced-filter path.\n\nHoisted that map to module scope and applied it on both paths, plus the\nexport query, via a new optional `sortFieldMap` on\n`buildEntityGridQueryParams` (absent → previous behaviour, so other\ngrids are untouched). `fullName`, `lastLoginAt`, `status` and\n`sessionTimeoutMinutes` now actually sort.\n\nSort knows one column the advanced filter deliberately does not:\n`status` sorts on the boolean `enabled`, but filtering it goes through\nthe dedicated `status` parameter, which speaks ACTIVE/INACTIVE — routing\na status filter to `enabled` would send a string where the backend\ntypes a boolean and earn a 400.\n\nRefs: gitops#3291, gitops#3245\nTests: 109 mfe-users pass; 4 new on the query builder\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d3f547dd01d2585808855791a3b532f8cd731fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/5d3f547dd01d2585808855791a3b532f8cd731fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d3f547dd01d2585808855791a3b532f8cd731fe\nparent 8bcccc994c055d6cfb6870d9146d568db1919138\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785595508 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785595508 +0300\n\nfeat(mfe-users): show the login name as a grid column, and make sorting work (#1105)\n\nAdds a `Kullanıcı Adı` / `Username` column to the users grid. Since\ngitops#3245 renamed the operator accounts to plain handles, `email` no\nlonger doubles as the login identity, and the grid had no way to say\nwhich login a row belongs to. It sits above `email` on purpose: the\nlogin name is the one an operator reaches for when something has to be\ndone to the account.\n\nUnreconciled rows render blank rather than falling back to the e-mail\naddress. Showing the address in place of an unknown login name would\nresurrect exactly the conflation gitops#3245 undid; blank honestly\nmeans \"not a Keycloak-linked account\".\n\nWhile wiring its sort, found that sorting has been silently inert for\nfour columns already. The grid names columns for what they show\n(`fullName`, `lastLoginAt`) while user-service names them after JPA\nfields (`name`, `lastLogin`) and validates `sort` against an allow-list\n— an unrecognised field is dropped without a word, and rows still come\nback, merely in the default order. So the column looked sortable and\ndid nothing. The colId → field map existed but was reachable only from\nthe advanced-filter path.\n\nHoisted that map to module scope and applied it on both paths, plus the\nexport query, via a new optional `sortFieldMap` on\n`buildEntityGridQueryParams` (absent → previous behaviour, so other\ngrids are untouched). `fullName`, `lastLoginAt`, `status` and\n`sessionTimeoutMinutes` now actually sort.\n\nSort knows one column the advanced filter deliberately does not:\n`status` sorts on the boolean `enabled`, but filtering it goes through\nthe dedicated `status` parameter, which speaks ACTIVE/INACTIVE — routing\na status filter to `enabled` would send a string where the backend\ntypes a boolean and earn a 400.\n\nRefs: gitops#3291, gitops#3245\nTests: 109 mfe-users pass; 4 new on the query builder\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbgZ0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAh5YQAKuEBDGu5vAED7jawzcJqkNu\nOgXcA1rzRWoiyZ20h1d0DJiscl7KPbMHD/FgnZ0tAiy5OufeqlxlYbgdblt8de2d\n//uRiGLtwWkW6gxteRa4LsBngMKMITGSllqqFahIStOlgmZC3s4n3j+A8wEn4ZxL\nqFEB2TrBbX1Lmv38e+akZ1vXKt0JxK3nflnB+N7/w1CzYzZihPNuwjNj1NGBFPh2\nOfxq6vt89vKvO81+u6ywHexvYCGMos7BLmQVPSAFV1lrSc+pZOleceILo6KWk2my\nezU0ha3brDxewNnJIGs1/eI0nr7sSBBfCuwUZSsJ0lp2bwAX2YnbAruNqdgs+/KQ\nkuIrgcU1DnlEvlaLOGOScDsPpVUzqquHc9vk2M1161XiybxIx1XvK4XCMQAKxZ2R\ngAkS54CxbLEPCJVLSRktF/wU+ls/TwWrAtOjNBtlUWDCpfF9kPQb37qZApbsFcvn\nPHLrtZ5yJJ/5/B+oVgF18CBJ/516N9nyFhuMS/Kl8uaXLZMZMf6cPhV/0knW1Mf+\nJrEAUxx3Vi0npKBsWalQ2UpncfC2F70UjtxzsPgaYwW5CUVYeoDO50NKrihT3xRF\nXa5xVeKjHDEVuzUZpbUQjOO3r+tRY0ESc0kA0oWZH36EpP2bYu8AvPwiOrfz3DJQ\n1ZwzsBEz9PuJs8gEoFii\n=wLIC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T14:45:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSLwOTNoAKGQ1NGE4NzM4OTdlYmUwNzdhZWQ5MTQwNmI5MzQxOTI0ZGI3NmQ2YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu/platform-web/commit/8bcccc994c055d6cfb6870d9146d568db1919138","sha":"8bcccc994c055d6cfb6870d9146d568db1919138","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/8bcccc994c055d6cfb6870d9146d568db1919138"}],"sha":"d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/d54a873897ebe077aed91406b9341924db76d6ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186576227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Halildeu","id":186576227,"login":"Halildeu","node_id":"U_kgDOCx7tYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Halildeu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/commits/8bcccc994c055d6cfb6870d9146d568db1919138/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:14:00Z","email":"halildeu@gmail.com","name":"halildeu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:14:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mfe-ethic): vaka listesi is kuyruguna donustu — aciliyet sirasi + geri sayim (#1104)\n\nListe updatedAt ile siraliydi: yasal teyit sınırına 1 gun kalan vaka, en son\ndokunulan kaydin altinda oturuyordu. Ekranin isi \"sirada ne var\" — recency\ndegil aciliyet:\n\n- sortForQueue: suresi gecmis teyit > yaklasan teyit (en yakin once) >\n  sahipsiz > gerisi (guncellik). Bilinmeyen teyit durumu aciliyet CIGLIGI\n  atamaz — servisten once deploy edilen frontend kanitlayamadigi aciliyeti\n  soyleyemez.\n- acknowledgementCountdown: ihlalden ONCE gorunur aciliyet (\"Teyit: 3 gun\n  kaldi\" / \"Teyit icin son gun\"). Kirmizi yalniz kirilmis soz icin; her seyin\n  bagirdigi kuyruk hicbir seyi siralamaz — sakin cip / uyari tonu / kirmizi\n  uc ayri kayit.\n- Suresi gecmis vakada geri sayim cipi YOK: kirmizi etiket zaten var, ayni\n  seyi iki kez soylemek gurultu.\n\nTestler dondurulmus saatle (CI ne zaman kosarsa kossun ayni gun aritmetigi):\nkuyruk sirasi 4 bant + bilinmeyen-durum + geri sayim metinleri. vitest 61/61.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#3271\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d59ddd9c7acff07ab257680cb3dec474d68b8c72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/trees/d59ddd9c7acff07ab257680cb3dec474d68b8c72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Halildeu/platform-web/git/commits/8bcccc994c055d6cfb6870d9146d568db1919138","verification":{"payload":"tree d59ddd9c7acff07ab257680cb3dec474d68b8c72\nparent 22ecb02d6db0f6e3dcb33e39d3797093450c8fe8\nauthor halildeu <halildeu@gmail.com> 1785590040 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785590040 +0300\n\nfeat(mfe-ethic): vaka listesi is kuyruguna donustu — aciliyet sirasi + geri sayim (#1104)\n\nListe updatedAt ile siraliydi: yasal teyit sınırına 1 gun kalan vaka, en son\ndokunulan kaydin altinda oturuyordu. Ekranin isi \"sirada ne var\" — recency\ndegil aciliyet:\n\n- sortForQueue: suresi gecmis teyit > yaklasan teyit (en yakin once) >\n  sahipsiz > gerisi (guncellik). Bilinmeyen teyit durumu aciliyet CIGLIGI\n  atamaz — servisten once deploy edilen frontend kanitlayamadigi aciliyeti\n  soyleyemez.\n- acknowledgementCountdown: ihlalden ONCE gorunur aciliyet (\"Teyit: 3 gun\n  kaldi\" / \"Teyit icin son gun\"). Kirmizi yalniz kirilmis soz icin; her seyin\n  bagirdigi kuyruk hicbir seyi siralamaz — sakin cip / uyari tonu / kirmizi\n  uc ayri kayit.\n- Suresi gecmis vakada geri sayim cipi YOK: kirmizi etiket zaten var, ayni\n  seyi iki kez soylemek gurultu.\n\nTestler dondurulmus saatle (CI ne zaman kosarsa kossun ayni gun aritmetigi):\nkuyruk sirasi 4 bant + bilinmeyen-durum + geri sayim metinleri. vitest 61/61.\n\nRefs Halildeu/platform-k8s-gitops#3271\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbfEYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAG1wQACf+2aIyjIiFASOHepeJTP