"","html_url":"https://github.com/FernandoContreras234","id":182819607,"login":"FernandoContreras234","node_id":"U_kgDOCuWbFw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FContrerasPardo/CIC-MedicalRecords/commits/349059fcfe20e4bd07db77bfa2a6e218dd170a77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:32:01Z","email":"Fernando.Contreras@hyland.com","name":"Fernando Contreras"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:32:01Z","email":"Fernando.Contreras@hyland.com","name":"Fernando Contreras"},"message":"Redesign analysis task widget (triage panel, grouped findings, contract viewer)\n\nReworks the medical-records analysis task widget for a clearer, less cluttered review experience:\n\n- Unify the summary cards + risk console into one triage panel: SVG risk ring, severity distribution bar (click to filter), \"start here\" insight, and stats as cards.\n- Cluster findings by type (xN, collapsible); show item code and billed amount as tags; add scope (service/account) and service-code filters; drop the redundant \"findings by scope\" table.\n- Group recommended actions by priority (collapsed by default).\n- Agent cards show each agent''s summary instead of the first finding and drop the redundant meta tags.\n- \"Review Contract\" opens the agreement document in a native full-screen viewer modal (hxp-document-viewer), mirroring the agent-rules widget.\n- Restyle the findings filter bar: tone-colored risk chips, segmented scope, styled selects, lighter panel.\n- Place \"Missing required documents\" beside recommended actions.\n- i18n: new keys across all 7 locales (en.json is the source of truth).\n- Add CLAUDE.md (verification workflow) and .claude/launch.json.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9018dc258ff8e3db5ea8d325a260ad4c086d2d84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FContrerasPardo/CIC-MedicalRecords/git/trees/9018dc258ff8e3db5ea8d325a260ad4c086d2d84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FContrerasPardo/CIC-MedicalRecords/git/commits/349059fcfe20e4bd07db77bfa2a6e218dd170a77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182819607?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FernandoContreras234","id":182819607,"login":"FernandoContreras234","node_id":"U_kgDOCuWbFw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FernandoContreras234","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FContrerasPardo/CIC-MedicalRecords/commit/349059fcfe20e4bd07db77bfa2a6e218dd170a77","node_id":"C_kwDOSL8vZtoAKDM0OTA1OWZjZmUyMGU0YmQwN2RiNzdiZmEyYTZlMjE4ZGQxNzBhNzc","parents":[{"htm