nt ingestion pipeline\n\nProduction-ready ingestion architecture for legal AI:\n- 4 GPU Python workers: PDF, text, vision (Gemma3), embedder\n- 3 Python microservices: LangExtract, MCP validator, Qdrant auto-tagger\n- Node.js API orchestrator with RabbitMQ job queuing\n- Docker Compose: PostgreSQL+pgvector, Redis, RabbitMQ, MinIO, Qdrant\n- SvelteKit frontend for drag-drop upload + real-time status\n- Supports 1GB+ files, OCR fallback, hybrid vector search\n\nReference architecture for GPU-accelerated document processing pipelines.","tree":{"sha":"d1893b0c7f35310272fc47e683aec0f63dd61ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/semaj90/phase66_ingestion/git/trees/d1893b0c7f35310272fc47e683aec0f63dd61ced"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/semaj90/phase66_ingestion/git/commits/d7f92075c37f07c021cce6632487a3aa8b4f07eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16179279?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/semaj90","id":16179279,"login":"semaj90","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc5Mjc5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/semaj90","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/semaj90/phase66_ingestion/commit/d7f92075c37f07c021cce6632487a3aa8b4f07eb","node_id":"C_kwDOSMAUdNoAKG