main/commits/03e8940687cea2459f76e05e1786ed003542365a"}],"sha":"08738d9cbee0c55e3a80237d0730f2979d7da726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaurasia750/haut-spare-ui-main/commits/08738d9cbee0c55e3a80237d0730f2979d7da726"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaurasia750/haut-spare-ui-main/commits/03e8940687cea2459f76e05e1786ed003542365a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T13:58:17Z","email":"chaurasia750@live.com","name":"abhishek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T13:58:17Z","email":"chaurasia750@live.com","name":"abhishek"},"message":"refactor: enforce constitution rules - extract all inline templates/styles into separate files\n\n✅ RULE 9 - Component Structure Compliance:\n- Extracted 12 components to use separate .html and .scss files\n- All components updated to use templateUrl and styleUrls\n- Shell components: app, home, plus 5 layout components\n- Shared UI: button, input, table, modal, select, card, loading-spinner\n\n✅ RULE 8 - Naming Conventions:\n- All files follow kebab-case naming convention\n- No PascalCase or camelCase file names detected\n\n✅ RULE 7 - Library Barrel Exports:\n- All 9 libraries have proper index.ts barrel exports\n- Public API clearly defined for each library\n\n✅ RULE 4 - Application Boundaries:\n- No cross-remote imports detected (admin ↔ member isolation)\n- Applications properly isolated\n\n✅ RULE 14 - Dependency Rules:\n- Library dependencies properly managed\n- No circular dependencies detected\n\nBuild Status: ✅ PASSED - Shell dev server running successfully\n\nGolden Rule Applied: ''NO CODE SHALL BREAK ARCHITECTURE''\nAll changes maintain strict module boundaries and architectural integrity.","tree":{"sha":"b2beb60df9d7096c12c6dbd72bdf0ff64c99417c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaurasia750/haut-spare-ui-main/git/trees/b2beb60df9d7096c12c6dbd72bdf0ff64c99417c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaurasia750/haut-spare-ui-main/git/commits/03e8940687cea2459f76e05e