\ndate, so after month rollover the widget showed the prior completed\nmonth. Now filters all rows by year+month from the `from` field and\nsums `totalCost ?? cost` and `consumption`, matching both jsonDaily and\njsonMonthly data formats.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f008c0c7705a43d30ffff284d3b1758d63d1517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/git/trees/6f008c0c7705a43d30ffff284d3b1758d63d1517"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/git/commits/a15fc4a72dbdee73eff8d3f9688cd460cf9e9256","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/commit/a15fc4a72dbdee73eff8d3f9688cd460cf9e9256","node_id":"C_kwDOSMOAjNoAKGExNWZjNGE3MmRiZGVlNzNlZmY4ZDNmOTY4OGNkNDYwY2Y5ZTkyNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/commit/7c276e82f781d7ab6c5ad7fe2a18c53a618e24e0","sha":"7c276e82f781d7ab6c5ad7fe2a18c53a618e24e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/commits/7c276e82f781d7ab6c5ad7fe2a18c53a618e24e0"}],"sha":"a15fc4a72dbdee73eff8d3f9688cd460cf9e9256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/commits/a15fc4a72dbdee73eff8d3f9688cd460cf9e9256"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/commits/7c276e82f781d7ab6c5ad7fe2a18c53a618e24e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T14:19:57Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T14:19:57Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"fix: apply position/size from state.style in live view (renderWidgetBody)\n\nIn vis-2, the outer widget div only gets position/size set in edit mode.\nIn live view, built-in widgets rely on the widDiv DOM mechanism; external\nReact widgets must apply the positioning themselves via e.style inside\nrenderWidgetBody(). This fixes widgets being stretched full-screen and\nstacked vertically in the live view.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdc14919e9c7b503bc76313a976619c48e4dfade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/git/trees/bdc14919e9c7b503bc76313a976619c48e4dfade"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/git/commits/7c276e82f781d7ab6c5ad7fe2a18c53a618e24e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/commit/7c276e82f781d7ab6c5ad7fe2a18c53a618e24e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSMOAjNoAKDdjMjc2ZTgyZjc4MWQ3YWI2YzVhZDdmZTJhMThjNTNhNjE4ZTI0ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/commit/50fb08cf0ed6a540a3a41268af806ba6abbdb9ec","sha":"50fb08cf0ed6a540a3a41268af806ba6abbdb9ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-tibberlink/commits/50fb08cf0ed6a540a3a41268af806ba6abbdb9ec