ptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commit/111175200736b0cfe49456e474b5a4dfedde9a20","node_id":"C_kwDOSMPYM9oAKDExMTE3NTIwMDczNmIwY2ZlNDk0NTZlNDc0YjVhNGRmZWRkZTlhMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commit/c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522","sha":"c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commit/322f94e4dcb17b80e5c0873fb8f91af60159bd53","sha":"322f94e4dcb17b80e5c0873fb8f91af60159bd53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/322f94e4dcb17b80e5c0873fb8f91af60159bd53"}],"sha":"111175200736b0cfe49456e474b5a4dfedde9a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/111175200736b0cfe49456e474b5a4dfedde9a20"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/322f94e4dcb17b80e5c0873fb8f91af60159bd53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T19:44:49Z","email":"psaianish2001@gmail.com","name":"AR-base"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T19:44:49Z","email":"psaianish2001@gmail.com","name":"AR-base"},"message":"Redesign UI with light/dark themes and premium typography\n\nVisual overhaul:\n- New design system with warm neutrals, gold accent, full CSS custom\n  property theming for light + dark modes\n- Theme toggle in topbar with instant-apply script (no FOUC)\n- Premium font stack: Instrument Serif (brand), Inter (UI), JetBrains\n  Mono (code)\n- Clean text-only sidebar, modern bubble shapes, frosted-glass topbar\n- prefers-color-scheme respected on first visit, persisted to\n  localStorage thereafter\n\nBackend and UX hardening:\n- Enable Anthropic prompt caching on the system block (cuts repeat\n  request input tokens ~80%)\n- Replace all 7 alert() dialogs with toast notifications\n- Add 429 rate-limit toast and 401 session-expiry redirect in send()\n- aria-label on icon-only buttons (send, attach, menu, clear file)\n- Splash delay 2200ms -> 1400ms\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d80a63fc1725a4a12a17defc10476725dce6715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/git/trees/6d80a63fc1725a4a12a17defc10476725dce6715"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/git/commits/322f94e4dcb17b80e5c0873fb8f91af60159bd53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commit/322f94e4dcb17b80e5c0873fb8f91af60159bd53","node_id":"C_kwDOSMPYM9oAKDMyMmY5NGU0ZGNiMTdiODBlNWMwODczZmI4ZjkxYWY2MDE1OWJkNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commit/c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522","sha":"c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522"}],"sha":"322f94e4dcb17b80e5c0873fb8f91af60159bd53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/322f94e4dcb17b80e5c0873fb8f91af60159bd53"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T15:09:20Z","email":"psaianish2001@gmail.com","name":"AR-base"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T15:09:20Z","email":"psaianish2001@gmail.com","name":"AR-base"},"message":"Fix streaming cursor flashing by using CSS ::after instead of DOM span\n\nThe cursor span was being recreated on every token, resetting the blink\nanimation each time and causing a rapid flash. Now the cursor is a CSS\n::after pseudo-element on .bbl.streaming — it runs once and never resets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2de4c39a288b6afe625c7ab076bc6acdc55600a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/git/trees/2de4c39a288b6afe625c7ab076bc6acdc55600a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/git/commits/c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commit/c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522","node_id":"C_kwDOSMPYM9oAKGM5MGNiYjMxMjM0ODdkNzU0Njc0NTUxYWIwNjlmOGU1N2VmMDY1MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commit/11ed1460e40f7db0ebc034a3c161b868e8964852","sha":"11ed1460e40f7db0ebc034a3c161b868e8964852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/11ed1460e40f7db0ebc034a3c161b868e8964852"}],"sha":"c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/c90cbb3123487d754674551ab069f8e57ef06522"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/commits/11ed1460e40f7db0ebc034a3c161b868e8964852/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T14:58:52Z","email":"psaianish2001@gmail.com","name":"AR-base"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T14:58:52Z","email":"psaianish2001@gmail.com","name":"AR-base"},"message":"Fix security, docs, and dead code before production\n\n- Rate-limit GET /api/chat (password validation) to prevent brute-force\n- Update DEPLOY-VERCEL.md to document STUDENT_PASSWORD + FACULTY_PASSWORD\n- Remove stale root chat.js (was using old SCHOOL_PASSWORD)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34c7d4b523655f26f6876990dd81cf52b9793879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AR-base/esaip-ai-assistant/git/trees/3