25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui): guard AgentAvatar against undefined/null name prop (#578)\n\nCloses #563.\n\nAgentAvatar crashed with `TypeError: can''t access property ''trim''` when\nrendered with an undefined name — triggered by incomplete agent data\npushed during gateway WebSocket reconnection.\n\n- Make `name` prop optional (string | null | undefined)\n- Null-coalesce inside getInitials() and getAvatarColors()\n- Fallback aria-label to ''Agent'' when name is empty","tree":{"sha":"643977dbbd3c9f8e331c4f78df1c8629d31fdc60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/git/trees/643977dbbd3c9f8e331c4f78df1c8629d31fdc60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/git/commits/3c033570627a096c2738eee1846afabed4548861","verification":{"payload":"tree 643977dbbd3c9f8e331c4f78df1c8629d31fdc60\nparent ceee57d8d500c71db1d9ff946f7f672ce6e2db6f\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775843365 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775843365 +0700\n\nfix(ui): guard AgentAvatar against undefined/null name prop (#578)\n\nCloses #563.\n\nAgentAvatar crashed with `TypeError: can''t access property ''trim''` when\nrendered with an undefined name — triggered by incomplete agent data\npushed during gateway WebSocket reconnection.\n\n- Make `name` prop optional (string | null | undefined)\n- Null-coalesce inside getInitials() and getAvatarColors()\n- Fallback aria-label to ''Agent'' when name is empty","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TglCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAABcQAIp5hWX2F8mbgSap/RPlD112\nZf2VH4PgLRFkUvF1QNsP866uPhGk/+WL9wxz4q4g1UzEiFShYLsDGifDmCRmmoy4\nap0kd/LJ5HXxqnlNI1xaqlDvDXKTf67RpDQaI1ZmM/9LS9/1fZGebHEcSGu1I4Nt\nG6Z5fUcmP5xIHYUfVVck7XpwYrHurTWPMy+njIy8X3EgvGpsXuCtGVuvVTzAmjjN\n6JPfXSgUTorCT5DQH8uQjiYBnnkoQzR97/klUwhlVMeadDdJ43DVFRCeOSLbvSCE\n+c+iLH01oALeuNVOonGeV1A9bwUNzsvSsyRcaFI329qz0yA27PUbooYL91CejYev\nKvJxVRJ7EmA47