lSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/commit/3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d","node_id":"C_kwDOSMd0V9oAKDNiZDFlYjc2MDZhODA5NGE0ZTZlMTcyMWZlMDE4MWI3NmQxNGVhOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/commit/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52","sha":"d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/commits/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52"}],"sha":"3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/commits/3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/commits/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:35:44Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:35:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Hermes integration gaps + stale Claude Code task detection (#549)\n\n* fix(hermes): add missing /api/hermes/events endpoint + improve cron history\n\n- Create POST /api/hermes/events to receive hook events (session:start,\n  agent:start, agent:end). The hook was silently failing because this\n  endpoint didn''t exist.\n- Events logged to activity table and broadcast to SSE clients\n- Agent status updated on agent:start/agent:end events\n- Add session.updated event type to event bus\n- Add runCount to HermesCronJob (counts all execution output files)\n\n* fix(claude-tasks): detect stale in_progress tasks from dead sessions\n\nClaude Code team tasks written to ~/.claude/tasks/ often get stuck as\nin_progress when sessions crash or end without cleanup. Detect stale\ntasks by checking file mtime — if not modified in 60+ minutes while\nstill in_progress, mark as stale. UI shows these dimmed with \"stale\"\nlabel instead of the misleading \"in_progress\" badge.","tree":{"sha":"a7510fe2172895fb2ba58cc02195c556229f41f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/git/trees/a7510fe2172895fb2ba58cc02195c556229f41f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/git/commits/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52","verification":{"payload":"tree a7510fe2172895fb2ba58cc02195c556229f41f6\nparent 6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775212544 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775212544 +0700\n\nfix: Hermes integration gaps + stale Claude Code task detection (#549)\n\n* fix(hermes): add missing /api/hermes/events endpoint + improve cron history\n\n- Create POST /api/hermes/events to receive hook events (session:start,\n  agent:start, agent:end). The hook was silently failing because this\n  endpoint didn''t exist.\n- Events logged to activity table and broadcast to SSE clients\n- Agent status updated on agent:start/agent:end events\n- Add session.updated event type to event bus\n- Add runCount to HermesCronJob (counts all execution output files)\n\n* fix(claude-tasks): detect stale in_progress tasks from dead sessions\n\nClaude Code team tasks written to ~/.claude/tasks/ often get stuck as\nin_progress when sessions crash or end without cleanup. Detect stale\ntasks by checking file mtime — if not modified in 60+ minutes while\nstill in_progress, mark as stale. UI shows these dimmed with \"stale\"\nlabel instead of the misleading \"in_progress\" badge.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpz5gACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHE4QADyA7HtNoZb/AKYd3NkXUfjd\nfilBPlmbFa402Uh1vxYSEoWtpwE9otnh/2fOQDeehx5H7EbV4Kj4DCJurvcTGDj6\nLPNErTL9q14WFezzERcc/WbVpuHPObLiEBzQTc8YcPV9cMMJbkukN/CYNjGxEo6y\n2i1IGKte2jE99H2vf6qQH8bXj7oE+gpYnNdSWItHaoFLvj+Sx+JiKrOKrG6H3qG6\nRoN+IoZXX3O1f759xhfE1dpwZoA1cGbabbrJUaf8SjUljiJlquFwhuT5fkIeX+ar\nMoW9i8sJEQGvOvlNPAEOkgv43bAgvmn00ZSb0Ir3kShKm9E3vTpyUuHnlKI0U3Sj\nblnVjWIJCm7n+3nDlm/wuzN9ewvx8EfclWVUSoCHVBjgYyaCytj19by3r4YthD7u\nz1VnmSTTiGvV83Tfvf85fuFjBaaEPmgv/eOjndViVzvbadfNT7+C4TtD/W3teFOC\n4iukprGC2JGLzh12mr4NHZf0m68N9QODoU0nxiQfySx5wdh/BZ1yB9PnOoKkn2OQ\ndiKRWOXAwCmwtufghuHRHEzJwY37VWhC+w9AlRDvnElKTKtFkRSieC9T6AkgPrNn\n/cyQ1UXpgxdP333Txm8WcIX69SQfmNVFFBHCQYiJisoab12N+Qwb3Ko6GoDjxDFm\nQMc6XGpd9OedF+r4OoOa\n=fWnT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-25T16:58:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/