rs","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/commits/1acbf8e0537ca93c277ea603dc942e79f6d92c5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T12:06:07Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T12:06:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: auto-route inbox tasks to best available agent (#476)\n\nTasks in inbox status are now automatically assigned to the best\nmatching agent based on role affinity and capability scoring:\n\n- Role keywords: coder matches code/implement/fix, researcher matches\n  research/analyze/audit, etc.\n- Agent capabilities from config are matched against task text\n- Idle agents preferred over busy ones\n- Capacity limit: agents with 3+ in-progress tasks are skipped\n- Runs every 60s before task dispatch (inbox → assigned → dispatch)\n\nFlow: create task (inbox) → auto-route picks best agent (assigned)\n→ scheduler dispatches to Claude API (in_progress) → response stored\n(review) → Aegis approves (done). Fully hands-free.","tree":{"sha":"91f9cd859ae22af92811c30c3af400faa9393fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/git/trees/91f9cd859ae22af92811c30c3af400faa9393fa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElSpaniard97/hermes-mission-control/git/commits/1acbf8e0537ca93c277ea603dc942e79f6d92c5b","verification":{"payload":"tree 91f9cd859ae22af92811c30c3af400faa9393fa0\nparent 27f6a3d6c14849196a0b7f47794f4a4d484a0176\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774181167 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774181167 +0700\n\nfeat: auto-route inbox tasks to best available agent (#476)\n\nTasks in inbox status are now automatically assigned to the best\nmatching agent based on role affinity and capability scoring:\n\n- Role keywords: coder matches code/implement/fix, researcher matches\n  research/analyze/audit, etc.\n- Agent capabilities from config are matched against task text\n- Idle agents preferred over busy ones\n- Capacity limit: agents with 3+ in-progress tasks are skipped\n- Runs every 60s before task dispatch (inbox → assigned → dispatch)\n\nFlow: create task (inbox) → auto-route picks best agent (assigned)\n→ scheduler dispatches to Claude API (in_progress) → response stored\n(review) → Aegis approves (done). Fully hands-free.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv9svCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzOIQACurMt5iMnCEYwWs8GAT2FmW\n9JPfs5OZgViRdCYZ781RndIlznEqr9iJ44/lbFIn0XPID7B6FIAVTxU+zjdTx6UR\nXg9yCHgnpxGR36dWiuBus/pZFz1bUWFy5FgtpmxeUSk/WdJlSYNHctwIv9CPr5PA\nHk4Latt6EMNldVYjBtrUTL662UawNkc/L12DeiW8e+n6rxXGSOuTqav38qCrp8Mz\nnp/n2gLtGzEfqFtR52gp2YRz5ycQ/4PT1VQGJZIjZ5Rz9I1zSurLvJkY3P1EPAKl\nwtiOv39NwNT/Juu3+Q6WqCIK83yXPXroe6tjfpNNRQ40WX+S08NbMyK/M0ikmJ15\nYFDNAkqgNgK01HHYveicH6oRnO9/FZZQmXBZ9kRPguPTEcHCdShCtQsSwvx5f85S\nKRxwEVk9heCcrqwduxOMUQgpLZVBrlROLogN+QBOw1zZRyVjQBvxsSqaC5z9kt/z\nswlKe4I+jTVRyEfT/FM3ea/5bwOa2OHZeu3skkwa9HKBRG350cYHwftv23Re9NFb\njT6Uwmwok/EdNjvd5U5bzDUG1UTfVoixo+pVkyKDIx7+4RndsR+eB9TXpjelca6y\n0LosO21AxP/m6HgKt7gSQHTRTCYQgdG73yYSLcJxKK3TJpJU0BOnPNTc9+xOermU\n4oouEmpVqSZtDa6HyuHb\n=Zqp7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-25T16:58:45Z"}},"committer":{"a