-04T21:02:33Z","email":"lggousie46@gmail.com","name":"Laurence"},"message":"render: resolve reversal parity with one colour swap\n\nCell and screen reversal cancel when both are active. Resolve their parity once, preserving colour validation order and dimming after reversal while deleting two production lines.\n\nExisting renderer final-frame proofs, core/protocol/simulation/fuzz gates, and 207 Odin tests pass. Fourteen native alternating trials show no material CPU or warm memory regression; light output stays at 240 updates/s with zero skips. Idle and 64 loaded input receipts pass. Small throughput differences are not treated as a speed claim.","tree":{"sha":"d7ffa9cee2a824b5ce7bb6256c356a6f921c79d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LaurenceGuws/howl/git/trees/d7ffa9cee2a824b5ce7bb6256c356a6f921c79d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LaurenceGuws/howl/git/commits/572853893b2b0b8b575fc881f406d1da6df97e07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98704251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceGuws","id":98704251,"login":"LaurenceGuws","node_id":"U_kgDOBeIbew","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceGuws","user_vi