s,\ndeterministic, ~150 LOC. Exercises:\n\n- agentforge.plugins entry-point discovery\n- plugin.py:register() callback + router mount\n- GET /api/echo/status + POST /api/echo/echo\n- TopicBus emit (project.echo.echoed)\n- echo-agent AGENT.md + namespace project.echo\n- Deterministic runner (pure string reverse)\n\nPlugin-side tests via TestClient; AgentForge-side smoke lives in\nbackend/tests/test_plugin_smoke.py (separate commit).","tree":{"sha":"0918ad5884c74c68524ee7ada319c7d9ac3650fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wtthornton/agentforge-echo-plugin/git/trees/0918ad5884c74c68524ee7ada319c7d9ac3650fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wtthornton/agentforge-echo-plugin/git/commits/8fb67cb6f23f4f696368a0da400ad545f914e41f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52006304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wtthornton","id":52006304,"login":"wtthornton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDA2MzA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wtthornton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wtthornton/agentforge-echo-plugin/commit/8fb67cb6f23f4f696368a0da400ad545f914e41f","node_id":"C_kwDOSMjjnNoAKDhmYjY3Y2I2ZjIzZjRmNjk2MzY4YTBkYTQwMGFkNTQ1