abb6984b45a7488f0d79c3584ef4e382690"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/a97ed7377212c52b8fcfa1435400d6f07d5b798f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:53:16Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:53:16Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"message":"Add OptionCard primitive, two CSS/UX exercises, and npm run verify\n\n- Extract OptionCard into components/ui/ — a button-as-card primitive\n  for picker UIs. /interview''s track picker now consumes it instead\n  of an inline <button> with custom classes.\n- Add two exercises closing the HTML/CSS + UX coverage gap:\n  - tag-cloud (easy) — render a tag cloud with fontSize scaled by\n    weight; tests assert structure + inline styles.\n  - accessible-modal (medium) — modal with role=\"dialog\", aria-modal,\n    aria-labelledby, conditional aria-describedby, ESC handler with\n    cleanup, and backdrop-click-to-close.\n- Add `npm run verify` that runs the exercise harness and a Next.js\n  build in sequence — single command for catching content + build\n  regressions. 202/202 exercise tests + clean build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"502bbd725b3e049ce461b4bf74a62fb42a6809ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/502bbd725b3e049ce461b4bf74a62fb42a6809ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/a97ed7377212c52b8fcfa1435400d6f07d5b798f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/a97ed7377212c52b8fcfa1435400d6f07d5b798f","node_id":"C_kwDOSMlDG9oAKGE5N2VkNzM3NzIxMmM1MmI4ZmNmYTE0MzU0MDBkNmYwN2Q1Yjc5OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/f21fa65a884ee6699a584bed3829da9f6fede1cf","sha":"f21fa65a884ee6699a584bed3829da9f6fede1cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/f21fa65a884ee6699a584bed3829da9f6fede1cf"}],"sha":"a97ed7377212c52b8fcfa1435400d6f07d5b798f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/a97ed7377212c52b8fcfa1435400d6f07d5b798f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/f21fa65a884ee6699a584bed3829da9f6fede1cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:49:24Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:49:24Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"message":"Add Sort By, 12 new exercises, and a verification harness\n\n- /exercises now ships a Sort By dropdown (Title A→Z, Difficulty\n  easy↔hard, Time short↔long). Page split into a server data loader\n  plus a client ExercisesList.\n- Pull in the shadcn Select component (Base UI primitives) instead of\n  hand-rolling a native <select>.\n- 12 new exercises rounding out coverage from easy to hard:\n  - Medium: throttle, curry, deep-clone, memoize, event-emitter,\n    use-debounced-value\n  - Easy: flatten-array, valid-parentheses\n  - Hard: promise-all, async-pool, json-stringify, trie\n- Add scripts/verify-exercises.mjs, runnable via\n  `npm run test:exercises`. Shims Jest-style globals, transpiles\n  TypeScript exercises in-memory via the `typescript` package, sets up\n  jsdom + RTL with auto-cleanup for React exercises. 188/188 tests\n  green across all 26 exercises.\n- Add @testing-library/react and jsdom as devDependencies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc79ea94c5f2fe2d5b2045a811e9020e27e8d044","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/bc79ea94c5f2fe2d5b2045a811e9020e27e8d044"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/f21fa65a884ee6699a584bed3829da9f6fede1cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/f21fa65a884ee6699a584bed3829da9f6fede1cf","node_id":"C_kwDOSMlDG9oAKGYyMWZhNjVhODg0ZWU2Njk5YTU4NGJlZDM4MjlkYTlmNmZlZGUxY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/7c98ca48d67d3081148024192d46f569ce1db827","sha":"7c98ca48d67d3081148024192d46f569ce1db827","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/7c98ca48d67d3081148024192d46f569ce1db827"}],"sha":"f21fa65a884ee6699a584bed3829da9f6fede1cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/f21fa65a884ee6699a584bed3829da9f6fede1cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/7c98ca48d67d3081148024192d46f569ce1db827/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:49:11Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T06:49:11Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"message":"Add topic presets, rename, and delete to /interview\n\n- Replace single \"Start new\" button with a 7-track picker (JavaScript,\n  DSA, React, TypeScript, HTML/CSS, System Design, General). Each track\n  has its own system prompt and kickoff in lib/interviewSessions.ts.\n- AI route picks the system prompt by track; legacy sessions default to\n  javascript so existing transcripts keep working.\n- Add optional `title` field with inline rename in both the past-sessions\n  list and the active session header. Add Delete (with confirm) to the\n  sessions list.\n- Extract shared UI primitives so we stop reinventing the same form:\n  StatusPill (in-progress / ended / difficulty), InlineRename (Input +\n  Save + Cancel).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4065715db2bdfdc7067da996766e11af7c49592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/b4065715db2bdfdc7067da996766e11af7c49592"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/7c98ca48d67d3081148024192d46f569ce1db827","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balboni