49Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:59:49Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"message":"Add floating study assistant chatbot and fix MDX table rendering\n\n- Floating chat panel (bottom-right) persists across all pages via root layout;\n  auto-hides on /interview routes where dedicated AI chat already exists\n- Page context system (PageContextProvider + SetPageContext) feeds the bot the\n  current exercise or note title/tags so answers are immediately on-topic\n- New /api/ai/chat route with study-assistant system prompt, distinct from the\n  mock interviewer persona\n- Install remark-gfm + add GFM remarkPlugin to exercise and notes MDX pipelines\n  to fix broken table rendering (e.g. the five-violations table on a11y-refactor)\n- Add styled table/thead/tbody/tr/th/td components to MdxComponents\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc608707c137795f2b915e86b917f2ccd8d04494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/dc608707c137795f2b915e86b917f2ccd8d04494"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/54bb8ccb9535864c56b26c71034ff5ff4d69509c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gith