https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/10289254e4d6c247d74dcfa9a3ad2e13315268ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:41:00Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T23:41:00Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"message":"Add first-time setup guide and model RAM warnings\n\n- AGENTS.md: new first-time setup section (Node, npm install, Ollama,\n  MongoDB, start command) with a RAM-based model recommendation table\n  so AI assistants can guide new users to the right model. Cleaned up\n  stale Day 2+ priorities — replaced with a concise shipped-features\n  summary.\n- dev.sh: check if required model is pulled; auto-pull if missing.\n  On < 16 GB RAM with the default 14B model, warn the user with\n  alternative model suggestions and wait for confirmation before pulling.\n  RAM check works on macOS (sysctl) and Linux (/proc/meminfo).\n- README: add RAM/model selection table to prerequisites.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b874498dd12538a446bb97e2377f128c13e9c128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/b874498dd12538a446bb97e2377f128c13e9c128"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/10289254e4d6c247d74dcfa9a3ad2e13315268ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id"