ilig"},"message":"Add AI exercise assistant, spaced repetition review queue\n\nAI side-features: /api/ai/exercise route handles hint/review/explain actions\nusing Ollama (same model as interview). ExerciseSandbox gains an AiPanel\n(useSandpack for live code) that streams responses in-place.\n\nSpaced repetition: SM-2 lite scheduler in lib/spaced-repetition.ts,\nReviewQueue client component with Again/Hard/Good/Easy grading, localStorage\npersistence, /review RSC page auto-populating from all notes + exercises.\nAdded Review to nav.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4b494f49160ace00e15293cf7c806bb558ce05b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/f4b494f49160ace00e15293cf7c806bb558ce05b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/deef1b8a6ae867c4555dc9be0c0c05f37c58a0bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com