ises + dark mode toggle\n\nExercises: a11y-refactor (react), seo-meta-tags (vanilla-ts), mfe-registry (vanilla-ts),\nplus the previously-missing a11y exercise for the ux-ui subject gap.\n\nDark mode: ThemeToggle client component (Sun/Moon icons, localStorage persistence),\nbeforeInteractive script in layout for FOUC prevention, suppressHydrationWarning on <html>.\nRespects prefers-color-scheme on first visit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c68929019a6dad6c352e22054ba78c03caac309a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/c68929019a6dad6c352e22054ba78c03caac309a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/b1a28de6c92b3d9d0238ca3db45b4d89fdd573a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/b1a28de6c92b3d9d0238ca3db45b4d89fdd573a1","node_id":"C_kwDOSMlDG9oAKGIxYTI4ZGU2Yz