ast with explicit undefined guard in lru-cache solution\n- Add Node<T> field scaffold hint to linked-list starter\n- Document capital-S Starter import convention in use-toggle tests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3379b96aeb52262b2d3349500986548246e87aec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/3379b96aeb52262b2d3349500986548246e87aec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/bfcdd49f441051ea3e8704794ee2241ba026a129","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/bfcdd49f441051ea3e8704794ee2241ba026a129","node_id":"C_kwDOSMlDG9oAKGJmY2RkNDlmNDQxMDUxZWEzZTg3MDQ3OTRlZTIyNDFiYTAyNmExMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/89bfd745d362f86400b2005c62ac9c36b22bb8d7","sha":"89bfd745d362f86400b2005c62ac9c36b22bb8d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/89bfd745d362f86400b2005c62ac9c36b22bb8d7"}],"sha":"bfcdd49f441051ea3e8704794ee2241ba026a129","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/bfcdd49f441051ea3e8704794ee2241ba026a129"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/89bfd745d362f86400b2005c62ac9c36b22bb8d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T22:33:55Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T22:33:55Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"message":"Add Day 3 exercises: React, TypeScript, DSA depth\n\nFills the Sandpack-template content gaps from Day 2:\n\n- use-toggle (react template) — first React exercise, custom hook\n  with [value, toggle, setValue] signature. Tests via @testing-\n  library/react with a small harness component (avoids renderHook\n  version dependency).\n- type-safe-pick (vanilla-ts) — first TS exercise. pick<T, K extends\n  keyof T>() with strict generic constraints. Tests include a\n  @ts-expect-error compile-time smoke check.\n- linked-list (vanilla-ts) — doubly linked list with O(1) end-ops\n  (push/pop/shift/unshift) and in-place reverse.\n- tree-traversal (vanilla-ts) — preorder/inorder/postorder/\n  levelorder with shared DFS helper + BFS queue.\n- lru-cache (vanilla-ts) — Map insertion-order trick for O(1)\n  get/put with capacity-bounded eviction.\n\nAlso: exclude content/exercises/** from host tsconfig — the host\nhas no @types/jest and these files run in Sandpack''s own env, not\nthe Next.js compile graph. Including them produced spurious\n\"Cannot find name ''test''\" errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26f53637d900430f310c037eefd96b64be7627dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/26f53637d900430f310c037eefd96b64be7627dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/89bfd745d362f86400b2005c62ac9c36b22bb8d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/89bfd745d362f86400b2005c62ac9c36b22bb8d7","node_id":"C_kwDOSMlDG9oAKDg5YmZkNzQ1ZDM2MmY4NjQwMGIyMDA1YzYyYWM5YzM2YjIyYmI4ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commit/61aadda7b89ca9e720e8853e7d2230899f40afc7","sha":"61aadda7b89ca9e720e8853e7d2230899f40afc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/61aadda7b89ca9e720e8853e7d2230899f40afc7"}],"sha":"89bfd745d362f86400b2005c62ac9c36b22bb8d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/89bfd745d362f86400b2005c62ac9c36b22bb8d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"balbonits","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDIwMzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/commits/61aadda7b89ca9e720e8853e7d2230899f40afc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T22:21:08Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T22:21:08Z","email":"balbonits@users.noreply.github.com","name":"John Dilig"},"message":"Initial commit: Day 1 + Day 2 of coding-interview-reviewer\n\nLocal-only MVP for front-end interview prep, $0 recurring cost.\nStack: Next.js 16 (App Router, Turbopack), React 19, Tailwind v4,\nshadcn/ui, MDX (next-mdx-remote/rsc), Sandpack, Ollama (qwen2.5:14b).\n\nThree core features:\n- /exercises — Sandpack-powered with auto-graded tests, multi-template\n  support (vanilla, vanilla-ts, react, react-ts, node). 6 seeds:\n  two-sum, fizzbuzz, debounce, resilient-fetch, mongo-query-matcher,\n  rate-limiter.\n- /notes — MDX library with tag filtering at /tags/[tag]. 12 seeds\n  spanning JS core, React, TypeScript, REST, MongoDB, Node, UX/UI,\n  SEO, microservices/microfrontend, modern HTML/CSS/JS.\n- /interview — Streaming local Ollama JS interviewer with\n  localStorage transcripts. Memory caps: num_ctx=4096, keep_alive=2m,\n  oldest-message trimming to ~75% of context budget.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6b1c18212e1c2b75cfa0bc84e22c4d74d599a17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/trees/f6b1c18212e1c2b75cfa0bc84e22c4d74d599a17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/balbonits/coding-interview-reviewer/git/commits/61aadda7b89ca9e720e8853e7d2230899f40afc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3442038?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/balbonits/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/balbonits","id":3442038,"login":"