 intentionally\n    NOT in this branch; tracked in TASK_LIST group 14 and the README\n    in infra/terraform/demo-deploy/.\n\n* task(14): fix CI prettier -- root format:check covers tailwind.config.ts + compose yml\n\nFrontend-pr CI failed on root `yarn format:check` against two files my\nlocal verification missed:\n\n  apps/weekly-commit-ui/tailwind.config.ts  (pre-existing drift; predates\n                                              this branch -- the redesign\n                                              landed against a workspace-\n                                              scoped format:check that\n                                              skipped the tailwind config)\n  docker-compose.demo.yml                   (added in 0fdb5e3)\n\nLocal trap: `yarn workspace @wc/weekly-commit-ui run format:check` only\nchecks `src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}` per its package.json script. CI runs the\nROOT `yarn format:check` which globs `**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx,json,md,yml,yaml}`\n-- catches workspace-config files (tailwind.config.ts) and repo-root yaml\n(docker-compose.demo.yml).\n\nLesson: default to `yarn format:check` from the repo root (not the\nper-workspace one) when changes touch any non-src file. Same pattern as\nthe workspace-vs-root `yarn lint` trap from feedback_workspace_lint_scope.\n\nVerified locally:\n  - yarn format:check (root):  all matched files clean\n  - yarn lint (root, all 4 nx projects): clean\n  - mvn spotless:check (backend): clean\n\nThis fix also unbroke main: main''s frontend-pr CI has been red since the\npush of 76336e8..ff558ee (the redesign merge) because tailwind.config.ts\nwas already prettier-dirty. Squash-merging this PR formats the file in\nthe squashed commit and brings main back to green.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Xian Zheng <seeinplay@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8Am0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGMQQAGfjuRzMg/jxZmBZFNQqaHsb\nzzvb5x+8hANsEYvkdINf9lGAjJ7bBW+wv4Ow7GbH2ZRj/jr/cgAHI4Lj1a7Q