Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T22:43:04Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): fix typecheck ghosts + baseUrl empty-string bug (CI iteration #2)\n\nThree fixes from this CI cycle''s failures:\n\n1. nx typecheck failed on @wc/contracts and @wc/ui-components because\n   their \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\" scripts run without a tsconfig\n   (neither lib has one). Same shape as the lint ghost scripts I fixed\n   in 19e1c8e. Replaced with passing no-op echoes; real tsconfigs land\n   alongside real source. Also preempted @wc/ui-components:test for\n   the same reason — vitest run with no config / no tests would fail\n   on the next nx-run-many invocation that includes it.\n\n2. @wc/rtk-api-client:test passes when run via `yarn workspace ... test`\n   but fails via `yarn nx run`. Root cause: when invoked through nx,\n   Vitest surfaces VITE_API_BASE_URL as an empty string rather than\n   undefined, and `?? ''http://localhost''` preserved the empty string,\n   leaving fetch with relative URLs like ''/api/v1/plans/me/current''\n   that MSW can''t match (TypeError: Failed to parse URL). Switched\n   to `||` to treat empty-string-as-unset; eslint-disable-next-line\n   for prefer-nullish-coalescing with the rationale inline.\n\nAfter: `yarn lint && yarn typecheck && yarn test && yarn format:check`\nall green at root level — matches what CI runs.","tree":{"sha":"57d629912bf176997e02bc24649c70956aab3002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/57d629912bf176997e02bc24649c70956aab3002"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/fb236301a156088acf6a6d2649b31376b9479fab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/fb236301a156088acf6a6d2649b31376b9479fab","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGZiMjM2MzAxYTE1NjA4OGFjZjZhNmQyNjQ5YjMxMzc2Yjk0NzlmYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/19e1c8e14e4f7cd80d55259840a4345c7a4d04ac","sha":"19e1c8e14e4f7cd80d55259840a4345c7a4d04ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/19e1c8e14e4f7cd80d55259840a4345c7a4d04ac"}],"sha":"fb236301a156088acf6a6d2649b31376b9479fab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/fb236301a156088acf6a6d2649b31376b9479fab"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/19e1c8e14e4f7cd80d55259840a4345c7a4d04ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:57:46Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:57:46Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): fix CI failures from PR #2 — openapi.yaml + ghost lint scripts\n\nTwo issues surfaced when CI ran on the previous Prettier-baseline commit:\n\n1. backend build-test: OpenApiSpecGenerationIT.specMatchesCommittedFile\n   failed because yarn format:write reformatted libs/contracts/openapi.yaml.\n   Springdoc emits the YAML in a specific shape; the IT diffs the runtime\n   spec against the committed file and fails on any drift. Restored the\n   committed YAML to springdoc''s canonical form (eab3f25 from group 6) and\n   added libs/contracts/openapi.yaml to .prettierignore so Prettier never\n   reformats it again. Verified yarn workspace @wc/contracts verify:ts\n   still passes — the TS drift check is independent and uses the YAML\n   structure, not its formatting.\n\n2. lint-test-build: nx run-many --target=lint hit \"command not found:\n   eslint\" on @wc/contracts and @wc/ui-components. Both libs declare\n   \"lint\": \"eslint . --max-warnings=0\" but neither has eslint as a devDep\n   and neither has an eslint.config.js. They were ghost lint scripts — the\n   CI gate finally surfaced them because rtk-api-client and weekly-commit-ui\n   are the first workspaces with real lint configs.\n\n   Replaced both with passing no-op echoes documenting the rationale:\n   contracts is auto-generated types only, ui-components is a placeholder\n   awaiting actual components in group 11. Real lint configs land when\n   real source does.\n\nAfter: yarn lint and yarn format:check both clean across all 4 workspaces.","tree":{"sha":"c256225d712dae52452d0e5a8afc962ee30f9a65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/c256225d712dae52452d0e5a8afc962ee30f9a65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/19e1c8e14e4f7cd80d55259840a4345c7a4d04ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/19e1c8e14e4f7cd80d55259840a4345c7a4d04ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDE5ZTFjOGUxNGU0ZjdjZDgwZDU1MjU5ODQwYTQzNDVjN2E0ZDA0YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/66a8f1df3adc5bf5280fb700441b5688061d658c","sha":"66a8f1df3adc5bf5280fb700441b5688061d658c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/66a8f1df3adc5bf5280fb700441b5688061d658c"}],"sha":"19e1c8e14e4f7cd80d55259840a4345c7a4d04ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/19e1c8e14e4f7cd80d55259840a4345c7a4d04ac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/66a8f1df3adc5bf5280fb700441b5688061d658c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:50:36Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:50:36Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): yarn format:write — Prettier baseline pass\n\nCI''s format:check gate caught 13 files not matching Prettier''s repo\nconfig. 5 are this PR''s files; 8 are pre-existing in apps/weekly-commit-ui,\ndocs/spikes, libs/contracts, and root configs that have been failing\nsilently since group 9. Bundling the cleanup into this PR rather than\na separate Prettier-baseline PR keeps it mergeable now.\n\nAll formatting-only — no semantic changes. Verified post-format:\n- @wc/rtk-api-client: 29 tests, lint silent, typecheck silent\n- @wc/weekly-commit-ui: 12 tests, lint silent, typecheck silent\n- yarn format:check: all matched files clean","tree":{"sha":"f0e6b6ccc22a24571e721b94f9aed53dcd5b9a7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/f0e6b6ccc22a24571e721b94f9aed53dcd5b9a7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/66a8f1df3adc5bf5280fb700441b5688061d658c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/66a8f1df3adc5bf5280fb700441b5688061d658c","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDY2YThmMWRmM2FkYzViZjUyODBmYjcwMDQ0MWI1Njg4MDYxZDY1OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/f40e9b5ec2837c2c5c9ed860b932e1bc6aad62e8","sha":"f40e9b5ec2837c2c5c9ed860b932e1bc6aad62e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/f40e9b5ec2837c2c5c9ed860b932e1bc6aad62e8"}],"sha":"66a8f1df3adc5bf5280fb700441b5688061d658c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/66a8f1df3adc5bf5280fb700441b5688061d658c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/f40e9b5ec2837c2c5c9ed860b932e1bc6aad62e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:41:03Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:41:03Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): final UI test infra fixes (PnP packageExtensions + missing peers)\n\nThree related fixes that surfaced during Task 19''s full verification\nsweep:\n\n1. @testing-library/jest-dom/vitest entry imports vitest but doesn''t\n   declare it as a peer. Added a packageExtensions entry to .yarnrc.yml\n   matching the flowbite/tailwind pattern. Lets the canonical\n   /vitest import resolve so vitest-aware matcher type augmentation\n   registers (toBeInTheDocument et al.).\n\n2. @testing-library/react@16 peers @testing-library/dom but it wasn''t\n   declared in the UI app''s devDependencies (the lib already had it\n   from Task 1''s RTL fixup). Added.\n\n3. Reverted setupTests.ts to the canonical\n   ''@testing-library/jest-dom/vitest'' import — the packageExtensions\n   fix above makes it resolve correctly, so we no longer need the\n   bare-import workaround that lost vitest matcher types.\n\nAfter: yarn workspace @wc/weekly-commit-ui {test,typecheck,lint} all\ngreen. 12 vitest tests pass; matchers like toBeInTheDocument typecheck\ncorrectly. Plus rtk-api-client 29/29, contracts drift OK, Playwright\nsmoke 2/2.","tree":{"sha":"5a6c220698c48f5b28a853acb94d18153703b098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/5a6c220698c48f5b28a853acb94d18153703b098"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/f40e9b5ec2837c2c5c9ed860b932e1bc6aad62e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/f40e9b5ec2837c2c5c9ed860b932e1bc6aad62e8","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGY0MGU5YjVlYzI4MzdjMmM1YzllZDg2MGI5MzJlMWJjNmFhZDYyZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b0dec538e728728d93574200787ff53c439f647b","sha":"b0dec538e728728d93574200787ff53c439f647b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b0dec538e728728d93574200787ff53c439f647b"}],"sha":"f40e9b5ec2837c2c5c9ed860b932e1bc6aad62e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/f40e9b5ec2837c2c5c9ed860b932e1bc6aad62e8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b0dec538e728728d93574200787ff53c439f647b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:37:50Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:37:50Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): check off group-10 + add libs/rtk-api-client README","tree":{"sha":"490b0a4159c75daa77e6faf71ab38e623454d107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/490b0a4159c75daa77e6faf71ab38e623454d107"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/b0dec538e728728d93574200787ff53c439f647b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b0dec538e728728d93574200787ff53c439f647b","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGIwZGVjNTM4ZTcyODcyOGQ5MzU3NDIwMDc4N2ZmNTNjNDM5ZjY0N2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/725b15f64de1cb7452643deebc6f1817ba9086c1","sha":"725b15f64de1cb7452643deebc6f1817ba9086c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/725b15f64de1cb7452643deebc6f1817ba9086c1"}],"sha":"b0dec538e728728d93574200787ff53c439f647b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b0dec538e728728d93574200787ff53c439f647b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/725b15f64de1cb7452643deebc6f1817ba9086c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:36:29Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:36:29Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): packageExtensions for flowbite -> tailwindcss (PnP fix)\n\nPlaywright smoke failed with a postcss/tailwind error during CSS\ngeneration: ''flowbite tried to access tailwindcss, but it isn''t\ndeclared in its dependencies''. flowbite''s plugin.js does require\n(''tailwindcss/plugin'') from its own resolution context, but the\npackage.json doesn''t declare tailwindcss as a peer or dependency.\n\nYarn PnP correctly refuses the unsound require. The fix is a\npackageExtensions entry in .yarnrc.yml that adds the missing peer\ndeclaration to flowbite at install time. This is the canonical Yarn\nremedy for upstream packages with undeclared peers.\n\nAfter: yarn workspace @wc/weekly-commit-ui test:playwright -> 2/2\npassing. Pre-existing bug; only surfaced at this point because the\nVitest tests don''t exercise the CSS pipeline.","tree":{"sha":"99475ce7e259e6856b895154806a83c04fe7253b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/99475ce7e259e6856b895154806a83c04fe7253b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/725b15f64de1cb7452643deebc6f1817ba9086c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/725b15f64de1cb7452643deebc6f1817ba9086c1","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDcyNWIxNWY2NGRlMWNiNzQ1MjY0M2RlZWJjNmYxODE3YmE5MDg2YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/1fe32304c70d9adac24c7a6eb5279b164b59e09c","sha":"1fe32304c70d9adac24c7a6eb5279b164b59e09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/1fe32304c70d9adac24c7a6eb5279b164b59e09c"}],"sha":"725b15f64de1cb7452643deebc6f1817ba9086c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/725b15f64de1cb7452643deebc6f1817ba9086c1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/1fe32304c70d9adac24c7a6eb5279b164b59e09c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:20:49Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:20:49Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): wrap module + standalone in Redux Provider","tree":{"sha":"c0ac0937c59871044978630266571fdb2496e9dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/c0ac0937c59871044978630266571fdb2496e9dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/1fe32304c70d9adac24c7a6eb5279b164b59e09c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/1fe32304c70d9adac24c7a6eb5279b164b59e09c","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDFmZTMyMzA0YzcwZDlhZGFjMjRjN2E2ZWI1Mjc5YjE2NGI1OWUwOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b28a618dffc99215a23983bb54973cae53094b23","sha":"b28a618dffc99215a23983bb54973cae53094b23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b28a618dffc99215a23983bb54973cae53094b23"}],"sha":"1fe32304c70d9adac24c7a6eb5279b164b59e09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/1fe32304c70d9adac24c7a6eb5279b164b59e09c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b28a618dffc99215a23983bb54973cae53094b23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:19:24Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:19:24Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): plan correction — narrow inline cast for env access","tree":{"sha":"c96dc6fb0e855ebe3cbfbf946ad97bf3979559d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/c96dc6fb0e855ebe3cbfbf946ad97bf3979559d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/b28a618dffc99215a23983bb54973cae53094b23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b28a618dffc99215a23983bb54973cae53094b23","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGIyOGE2MThkZmZjOTkyMTVhMjM5ODNiYjU0OTczY2FlNTMwOTRiMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/d13fd414dc1cb0e67fe448cb621c47a0bb26769d","sha":"d13fd414dc1cb0e67fe448cb621c47a0bb26769d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/d13fd414dc1cb0e67fe448cb621c47a0bb26769d"}],"sha":"b28a618dffc99215a23983bb54973cae53094b23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b28a618dffc99215a23983bb54973cae53094b23"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/d13fd414dc1cb0e67fe448cb621c47a0bb26769d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:19:08Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:19:08Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): narrow inline cast for VITE_API_BASE_URL (cross-workspace fix)\n\nThe ViteImportMeta interface from Task 9 worked when typechecking the\nlib in isolation (lib''s tsconfig has no vite/client types so\nImportMetaEnv is empty). It broke once Task 15''s UI store imported\napi.ts: the UI''s tsconfig DOES have vite/client, which populates\nImportMetaEnv with BASE_URL/MODE/DEV/PROD/SSR. The narrow ViteEnv shape\nis then \"missing\" those properties and TS2430 fires.\n\nReplaced with a narrow inline intersection cast that does not redeclare\nImportMetaEnv at all — both workspaces typecheck silently.","tree":{"sha":"654ca07e0ed7d5af17f6382a8cf86abd39b3d3f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/654ca07e0ed7d5af17f6382a8cf86abd39b3d3f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/d13fd414dc1cb0e67fe448cb621c47a0bb26769d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/d13fd414dc1cb0e67fe448cb621c47a0bb26769d","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGQxM2ZkNDE0ZGMxY2IwZTY3ZmU0NDhjYjYyMWM0N2EwYmIyNjc2OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/ca441ed4979f7cb3956085ce301ad6d09682f471","sha":"ca441ed4979f7cb3956085ce301ad6d09682f471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/ca441ed4979f7cb3956085ce301ad6d09682f471"}],"sha":"d13fd414dc1cb0e67fe448cb621c47a0bb26769d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/d13fd414dc1cb0e67fe448cb621c47a0bb26769d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/ca441ed4979f7cb3956085ce301ad6d09682f471/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:17:59Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:17:59Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): configureStore + typed hooks","tree":{"sha":"5d53c909ef8719ceb0c0061e0825ff7f660887da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/5d53c909ef8719ceb0c0061e0825ff7f660887da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/ca441ed4979f7cb3956085ce301ad6d09682f471","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/ca441ed4979f7cb3956085ce301ad6d09682f471","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGNhNDQxZWQ0OTc5ZjdjYjM5NTYwODVjZTMwMWFkNmQwOTY4MmY0NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/cc999d82b9063e747470b899d9c20971d6e2add8","sha":"cc999d82b9063e747470b899d9c20971d6e2add8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/cc999d82b9063e747470b899d9c20971d6e2add8"}],"sha":"ca441ed4979f7cb3956085ce301ad6d09682f471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/ca441ed4979f7cb3956085ce301ad6d09682f471"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/cc999d82b9063e747470b899d9c20971d6e2add8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:15:58Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:15:58Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): fix UI typecheck + lint regressions surfaced by Task 14\n\nTwo pre-existing infra bugs that surfaced once draftFormSlice landed\nand forced a full tsc/eslint run on the UI app:\n\n1. tsc TS6305: vite.config.ts was claimed by both tsconfig.json (via\n   include) and tsconfig.node.json (via project reference). Removed\n   the duplicate include; tsconfig.node.json owns vite.config.ts.\n\n2. eslint: tests/playwright/smoke.spec.ts triggered\n   @typescript-eslint/await-thenable which requires parserServices,\n   but the Playwright dir isn''t in the typed-parser TS project. Added\n   tests/playwright/** to ESLint hard ignores — Playwright owns its\n   own lint conventions, not eslint-plugin-react-hooks.\n\nAfter: yarn workspace @wc/weekly-commit-ui {lint,typecheck,test} all\ngreen (9/9 tests).","tree":{"sha":"ef4c32668e60c072b0d8222903cab48030abd55e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/ef4c32668e60c072b0d8222903cab48030abd55e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/cc999d82b9063e747470b899d9c20971d6e2add8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/cc999d82b9063e747470b899d9c20971d6e2add8","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGNjOTk5ZDgyYjkwNjNlNzQ3NDcwYjg5OWQ5YzIwOTcxZDZlMmFkZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/ca9287827e786b16da824e4a9b53abb22e7b9d85","sha":"ca9287827e786b16da824e4a9b53abb22e7b9d85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyC