"},"message":"task(10) RED: draftFormSlice for commit-editor local state","tree":{"sha":"5bdf3e563e3c5d2af9ea1979d489dace643577cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/5bdf3e563e3c5d2af9ea1979d489dace643577cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/63dc76560a6be2866e10c6cb6dbd813ac6838094","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/63dc76560a6be2866e10c6cb6dbd813ac6838094","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDYzZGM3NjU2MGE2YmUyODY2ZTEwYzZjYjZkYmQ4MTNhYzY4MzgwOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/40b885ffe04569d15aa43c3639466e3b9506769a","sha":"40b885ffe04569d15aa43c3639466e3b9506769a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/40b885ffe04569d15aa43c3639466e3b9506769a"}],"sha":"63dc76560a6be2866e10c6cb6dbd813ac6838094","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/63dc76560a6be2866e10c6cb6dbd813ac6838094"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/40b885ffe04569d15aa43c3639466e3b9506769a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:12:58Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:12:58Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): UI vitest infra fixes for upcoming draftFormSlice tests\n\nTwo infra fixes needed before Task 13''s RED test runs:\n\n1. @testing-library/jest-dom@6.9.x added a transitive ''vitest'' import\n   that Yarn PnP refuses to satisfy from jest-dom''s resolution context.\n   Switching the matcher import from ''@testing-library/jest-dom/vitest''\n   to plain ''@testing-library/jest-dom'' sidesteps this — matchers\n   register the same way.\n\n2. Vitest''s default test file glob picks up tests/playwright/smoke.spec.ts\n   (a @playwright/test file). Adding tests/playwright/** to test.exclude\n   restores the intended boundary: vitest owns src/, Playwright owns\n   tests/playwright/.","tree":{"sha":"15f181b2ec83767bdb145e1bec2914f25ebf2d10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/15f181b2ec83767bdb145e1bec2914f25ebf2d10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/40b885ffe04569d15aa43c3639466e3b9506769a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/40b885ffe04569d15aa43c3639466e3b9506769a","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDQwYjg4NWZmZTA0NTY5ZDE1YWE0M2MzNjM5NDY2ZTNiOTUwNjc2OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/88af5631e88c56554c00777d74e761e329b9d1cd","sha":"88af5631e88c56554c00777d74e761e329b9d1cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/88af5631e88c56554c00777d74e761e329b9d1cd"}],"sha":"40b885ffe04569d15aa43c3639466e3b9506769a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/40b885ffe04569d15aa43c3639466e3b9506769a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/88af5631e88c56554c00777d74e761e329b9d1cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:05:51Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:05:51Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): public exports surface for libs/rtk-api-client","tree":{"sha":"22a56c389e5db3800c9428b8ebfb6bfe3544259a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/22a56c389e5db3800c9428b8ebfb6bfe3544259a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/88af5631e88c56554c00777d74e761e329b9d1cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/88af5631e88c56554c00777d74e761e329b9d1cd","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDg4YWY1NjMxZTg4YzU2NTU0YzAwNzc3ZDc0ZTc2MWUzMjliOWQxY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/76cc12b8e07a52aa13d1e67eb741c109435df1d5","sha":"76cc12b8e07a52aa13d1e67eb741c109435df1d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/76cc12b8e07a52aa13d1e67eb741c109435df1d5"}],"sha":"88af5631e88c56554c00777d74e761e329b9d1cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/88af5631e88c56554c00777d74e761e329b9d1cd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/76cc12b8e07a52aa13d1e67eb741c109435df1d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:04:55Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T17:04:55Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): drop Object.assign workaround, assert API_CONFIG directly (review fixup)\n\nThe original test ''expect(api.refetchOnFocus).toBe(true)'' was the wrong\nshape — RTK Query doesn''t expose api-level config as enumerable\nproperties on the returned slice, so the implementer worked around by\nwrapping the api in Object.assign(baseApi, { refetchOnFocus: ... }).\nThat ships dead code paths (nothing in production reads api.refetchOnFocus)\nand couples the export to a bespoke pattern.\n\nInstead, export API_CONFIG as a named const and assert against it.\nThe api export is now plain createApi(...) result again, matching\ncanonical RTK usage.","tree":{"sha":"7251b38ef2ba22ad527976d9af3741ea7fdadc26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/7251b38ef2ba22ad527976d9af3741ea7fdadc26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/76cc12b8e07a52aa13d1e67eb741c109435df1d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned",