menter''s pre-flight contract check caught\nthem before any test code was written against the wrong URLs.","tree":{"sha":"133523a56d1f21a577a248c0462ab869a3ad5575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/133523a56d1f21a577a248c0462ab869a3ad5575"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/83a9fecfd8e5c867fd4b8289e3d349ed081a43cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/83a9fecfd8e5c867fd4b8289e3d349ed081a43cb","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDgzYTlmZWNmZDhlNWM4NjdmZDRiODI4OWUzZDM0OWVkMDgxYTQzY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/1b576e992a80e63ba17721add76da276884e6420","sha":"1b576e992a80e63ba17721add76da276884e6420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/1b576e992a80e63ba17721add76da276884e6420"}],"sha":"83a9fecfd8e5c867fd4b8289e3d349ed081a43cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/83a9fecfd8e5c867fd4b8289e3d349ed081a43cb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/1b576e992a80e63ba17721add76da276884e6420/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T05:01:25Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T05:01:25Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): explicit rootDir=../.. in lib tsconfig (review fixup)\n\nReviewer flagged that omitting rootDir falls back to the base\ntsconfig''s \"rootDir\": \".\" (monorepo root), which silently widens the\nsource set. Setting rootDir=\"../..\" explicitly preserves that\nboundary while still allowing cross-workspace imports from\n@wc/contracts. Plan Task 1 updated so re-execution doesn''t\nre-introduce \"./src\".","tree":{"sha":"d3afb1183f8afbac33b67f9d33faa6d90f17a2ac","url":"https://api.gith