s","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T04:12:42Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T04:12:42Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): extract DEFAULT_CONFLICT_CODE constant (review fixup)\n\nCode-quality reviewer flagged the magic string \"CONFLICT_OPTIMISTIC_LOCK\"\nin conflictRetry.ts as a maintenance hazard. Extracting it as a named\nexport from conflictToastSlice (where it semantically belongs as the\ndefault conflict reason) means a future rename or per-endpoint fallback\nis a single-site change, and the connection between the slice''s state\nshape and the enhancer''s fallback is self-documenting.\n\nProduction code only — test files keep literal strings (those represent\nthe wire format and reducer test inputs, not the production fallback).","tree":{"sha":"a3129fbdd2d94681ec35834d8d461a7d1ecfcc87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/a3129fbdd2d94681ec35834d8d461a7d1ecfcc87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/986900d4e655e91002c1400e0840475333d0020a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/986900d4e655e91002c1400e0840475333d0020a","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDk4NjkwMGQ0ZTY1NWU5MTAwMmMxNDAwZTA4NDA0NzUzMzNkMDAyMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b785564be0ebeb71c21f5c5e49193b706ba1008d","sha":"b785564be0ebeb71c21f5c5e49193b706ba1008d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b785564be0ebeb71c21f5c5e49193b706ba1008d"}],"sha":"986900d4e655e91002c1400e0840475333d0020a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/986900d4e655e91002c1400e0840475333d0020a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b785564be0ebeb71c