0de33d2ac95b591d739a6f111bd15218778"}],"sha":"dcf5c554207ba6d3f3ea243d75bafdf9e3a0b89e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/dcf5c554207ba6d3f3ea243d75bafdf9e3a0b89e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/8f5230de33d2ac95b591d739a6f111bd15218778/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T01:36:43Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T01:36:43Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(10): rtk-api-client scaffold + UI workspace dep","tree":{"sha":"01d7da9ada687810a73dba0f8d309a3609faf598","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/01d7da9ada687810a73dba0f8d309a3609faf598"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/8f5230de33d2ac95b591d739a6f111bd15218778","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/8f5230de33d2ac95b591d739a6f111bd15218778","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDhmNTIzMGRlMzNkMmFjOTViNTkxZDczOWE2ZjExMWJkMTUyMTg3Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b96b64f7d2a785c428c70a791077d233c7bd1200","sha":"b96b64f7d2a785c428c70a791077d233c7bd1200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b96b64f7d2a785c428c70a791077d233c7bd1200"}],"sha":"8f5230de33d2ac95b591d739a6f111bd15218778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/8f5230de33d2ac95b591d739a6f111bd15218778"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b96b64f7d2a785c428c70a791077d233c7bd1200/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T01:16:59Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T01:16:59Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"docs(plan): group-10 RTK Query + typed client implementation plan\n\n19-task TDD plan for libs/rtk-api-client + UI store wiring. Each\nproduction-code task has a RED/GREEN pair; endpoint definitions are\nhand-written (not codegen) so per-endpoint tag invalidation policy\ncan be expressed.\n\nKey decisions documented inline:\n- baseQuery enhancer for 409 retry (not Redux middleware) — sees\n  response before lifecycle so refetch produces clean data\n- Module owns its Redux Provider in the federated path (Module\n  Federation pattern — host & remote keep independent stores)\n- ConflictToast UI component deferred to group 11 polish; this layer\n  ships the action + slice + Vitest assertion that it dispatches\n- RCDO tag declared but no endpoint until group 11 RCDOPicker lands","tree":{"sha":"05fca6d6bdd32dd738c98dbd6b7577663818b281","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/05fca6d6bdd32dd738c98dbd6b7577663818b281"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/b96b64f7d2a785c428c70a791077d233c7bd1200","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b96b64f7d2a785c428c70a791077d233c7bd1200","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGI5NmI2NGY3ZDJhNzg1YzQyOGM3MGE3OTEwNzdkMjMzYzdiZDEyMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f","sha":"59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f"}],"sha":"b96b64f7d2a785c428c70a791077d233c7bd1200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b96b64f7d2a785c428c70a791077d233c7bd1200"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/be88c4f199969cd68e4ef3fa6b349b0b99349e23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:41:25Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:41:25Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"docs: v1-aligned mockups for IC and manager surfaces\n\nReference HTML mockups in docs/mockups/ replacing the first-pass\n\"enterprise strategy dashboard\" designs that didn''t match v1 scope.\n\n- weekly-planning.html: 5 IC state variants (Blank, DRAFT, LOCKED\n  pre-day-4, LOCKED reconciliation, RECONCILED) + conflict-toast slot\n- manager-rollup.html: team rollup (flagged-first cards) + IC drawer\n  overlay with streak chain visualization and plan-level comment\n- README.md: v1 MVP traceability matrix; documents what was cut\n  (per-commit comments, multi-collaborators, Run/Change/Disrupt\n  taxonomy, historical trend deltas) and what was added (chess tier\n  control, RCDO breadcrumb, reconciliation tri-state, carry-forward\n  controls, carry-streak/stuck flag, Top Rock indicator)","tree":{"sha":"b973121ecb965621bc59c2a042cc2a1769f47532","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/b973121ecb965621bc59c2a042cc2a1769f47532"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/be88c4f199969cd68e4ef3fa6b349b0b99349e23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/be88c4f199969cd68e4ef3fa6b349b0b99349e23","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGJlODhjNGYxOTk5NjljZDY4ZTRlZjNmYTZiMzQ5YjBiOTkzNDllMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f","sha":"59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f"}],"sha":"be88c4f199969cd68e4ef3fa6b349b0b99349e23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/be88c4f199969cd68e4ef3fa6b349b0b99349e23"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:39:00Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:39:00Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(9): Vitest test block + setupTests + sample test\n\nThe Vitest subagent stopped at commit time on package.json contention\nwith the parallel Tailwind/ESLint/Playwright agents and never landed its\nartifacts -- this commit recovers them. (Vitest devDeps were already in\nHEAD; the Tailwind subagent''s commit had swept up all four agents''\npackage.json edits.)\n\nvite.config.ts: adds /// <reference types=\"vitest\" /> at the top and a\n`test:` block alongside `define`. Single config file (no parallel\nvitest.config.ts) so the `define` block stays single-source for both\nbuild and test runs -- the placeholder''s {__WC_GIT_SHA__} expression\nresolves to ''dev'' under unit tests with no extra wiring.\n\nsrc/setupTests.ts: imports @testing-library/jest-dom/vitest to register\nthe toBeInTheDocument / toHaveTextContent matchers.\n\nsrc/WeeklyCommitModule.test.tsx: sample smoke using MemoryRouter (not\nHashRouter; we drive the URL via initialEntries in tests). Asserts both\ndata-testid hooks. Replace with real coverage when groups 11-12 land\nthe IC/manager/admin surfaces.\n\nCoverage thresholds: 80% on lines/statements/branches/functions per\ndocs/TESTING_STRATEGY.md. Excludes main.tsx (Playwright owns it) and\n*.d.ts files. yarn install not run -- toolchain mismatch.","tree":{"sha":"d0cb0cb3ca8bce34831dd70ef39a65a20698993b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/d0cb0cb3ca8bce34831dd70ef39a65a20698993b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDU5ZTI2M2EwOGFmZjE0NDBmZWRkZjU5YjcyZDg0YzQ4ZmU2ODBhNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/4640918c1bbb1e480a3fb4d133a19fa854554e72","sha":"4640918c1bbb1e480a3fb4d133a19fa854554e72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/4640918c1bbb1e480a3fb4d133a19fa854554e72"}],"sha":"59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/59e263a08aff1440feddf59b72d84c48fe680a4f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/4640918c1bbb1e480a3fb4d133a19fa854554e72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:37:51Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:37:51Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(9): ESLint 9 flat config + Prettier scripts\n\nThe ESLint subagent stopped at commit time on package.json contention with\nthe parallel Tailwind/Vitest/Playwright agents and never landed its\nartifacts -- this commit recovers them from its report.\n\neslint.config.js: ESM flat config using tseslint.config(...) helper,\nwires @eslint/js recommended + typescript-eslint recommendedTypeChecked\n+ stylisticTypeChecked + eslint-plugin-react recommended/jsx-runtime +\neslint-plugin-react-hooks + eslint-plugin-react-refresh\nonly-export-components. Hard ignores: dist, node_modules, *.config.{js,ts}.\nProject-scoped block targets src/**/*.{ts,tsx} with parserOptions.project\npointing at ./tsconfig.json. @typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars allows\n^_-prefixed args.\n\npackage.json: adds 8 ESLint/Prettier devDeps (eslint, @eslint/js,\ntypescript-eslint, eslint-plugin-react, eslint-plugin-react-hooks,\neslint-plugin-react-refresh, globals, prettier) and three new scripts\n(lint:fix, format:check, format:write). Existing `lint` keeps the\n--max-warnings=0 strict gate. Prettier config remains at repo root only;\nno app-level fork.\n\nyarn install not run -- toolchain mismatch (system yarn 1.22 vs\npackageManager yarn@4.5.0) blocks runtime verification of the deps until\nCI provisions a clean toolchain.","tree":{"sha":"b787421743a5f252dceb2f8a66d9db941fe1fe9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/b787421743a5f252dceb2f8a66d9db941fe1fe9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/4640918c1bbb1e480a3fb4d133a19fa854554e72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/4640918c1bbb1e480a3fb4d133a19fa854554e72","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDQ2NDA5MThjMWJiYjFlNDgwYTNmYjRkMTMzYTE5ZmE4NTQ1NTRlNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/2bcb8ca7e765e1407a0ec81e8cf5cc9844ca77c7","sha":"2bcb8ca7e765e1407a0ec81e8cf5cc9844ca77c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/2bcb8ca7e765e1407a0ec81e8cf5cc9844ca77c7"}],"sha":"4640918c1bbb1e480a3fb4d133a19fa854554e72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/4640918c1bbb1e480a3fb4d133a19fa854554e72"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/2bcb8ca7e765e1407a0ec81e8cf5cc9844ca77c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:22:41Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:22:41Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(9): Playwright smoke skeleton\n\nAdd the standalone-isolation Playwright skeleton for the weekly-commit\nremote per group 9 subtask 6 (CLAUDE.md tech-stack lock: Playwright is\nthe remote-in-isolation harness; Cypress + Cucumber is the in-host one,\nlanding separately).\n\nTwo tests asserting data-testid hooks (resilient to copy churn):\n- placeholder route renders with version stamp\n- nested /weekly-commit/* paths still mount the module\n\nSingle Chromium project. Adding Firefox/WebKit doubles CI time for a\ntier-of-trust we don''t yet need; revisit when the IC/manager/admin\nsurfaces ship in groups 11-13.\n\nTests target /#/weekly-commit (HashRouter -- the standalone entry).\nThe webServer hook boots `yarn dev` on :4184 and reuses an existing\nserver locally / starts a fresh one in CI.\n\ndevDep: @playwright/test ^1.47.0. Browsers NOT downloaded -- developer\nruns `playwright install chromium` (~150MB) once after `yarn install`.\nyarn install itself not run -- toolchain mismatch (system yarn 1.22 vs\npackageManager yarn@4.5.0) as documented in subtask 1.\n\nNOTE on parallel-subagent collision: while landing this commit, sibling\nsubagents (Tailwind, ESLint, Vitest) were churning shared files\n(package.json, docs/TASK_LIST.md) and at one point landed all four\ngroups'' work into a single commit titled \"Tailwind + Flowbite React\"\n(reset and redone). HEAD ended at 9f61a71 with the Playwright TASK_LIST\ncheck-off already incorporated -- so this commit''s TASK_LIST diff is\nintentionally empty. The new files (playwright.config.ts,\ntests/playwright/smoke.spec.ts) and the @playwright/test devDep are\nthis commit''s actual contribution.","tree":{"sha":"c52ec09e055718359e186f4d9f368ffa90ed89d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/c52ec09e055718359e186f4d9f368ffa90ed89d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/2bcb8ca7e765e1407a0ec81e8cf5cc9844ca77c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/2bcb8ca7e765e1407a0ec81e8cf5cc9844ca77c7","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDJiY2I4Y2E3ZTc2NWUxNDA3YTBlYzgxZThjZjVjYzk4NDRjYTc3Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/9f61a71b4c1c013c3a3131be975268eca70c00aa","sha":"9f61a71b4c1c013c3a3131be975268eca70c00aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/9f61a71b4c1c013c3a3131be975268eca70c00aa"}],"sha":"2bcb8ca7e765e1407a0ec81e8cf5cc9844ca77c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/2bcb8ca7e765e1407a0ec81e8cf5cc9844ca77c7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/9f61a71b4c1c013c3a3131be975268eca70c00aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:20:30Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:20:30Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(9): Tailwind + Flowbite React + index.css\n\nWire baseline theme integration for the weekly-commit remote per\nADR-0004 (Tailwind preset override is the primary host-token mechanism).\n\ndevDeps: tailwindcss ^3.4.0, postcss ^8.4.0, autoprefixer ^10.4.0,\nflowbite ^2.5.0. Runtime dep: flowbite-react ^0.10.0.\n\nNew files:\n- tailwind.config.ts uses flowbite-react/tailwind preset; theme.extend\n  reserved for the host preset injection wired at env-time, not as a\n  static dep on @host/design-system (per ADR-0004 / spike findings).\n- postcss.config.js (.js not .ts -- PostCSS loader prefers plain JS\n  and there''s no value in typing 4 lines).\n- src/index.css holds ONLY the three @tailwind directives.\n  CLAUDE.md''s tech-stack lock forbids any other CSS file in this module.\n\nModified:\n- main.tsx imports ./index.css and wraps the existing HashRouter in a\n  <Flowbite> provider with default theme. Sentry init + standalone-only\n  comment block preserved untouched.\n- WeeklyCommitModule placeholder now renders a Flowbite <Card> with\n  Tailwind utility classes so subtask 6''s Playwright smoke can confirm\n  Flowbite + Tailwind both load. data-testid hooks preserved.\n\nNot run: yarn install -- system yarn 1.22 vs packageManager yarn@4.5.0\nmismatch documented in subtask 1 commit. CI runs the install.","tree":{"sha":"029e904f24576bf01d8451b14dd73b3834894a6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/029e904f24576bf01d8451b14dd73b3834894a6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/9f61a71b4c1c013c3a3131be975268eca70c00aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/9f61a71b4c1c013c3a3131be975268eca70c00aa","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDlmNjFhNzFiNGMxYzAxM2MzYTMxMzFiZTk3NTI2OGVjYTcwYzAwYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/4cd07f2e35b6f9323150e5d54b37e2bfa8c02f7b","sha":"4cd07f2e35b6f9323150e5d54b37e2bfa8c02f7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/4cd07f2e35b6f9323150e5d54b37e2bfa8c02f7b"}],"sha":"9f61a71b4c1c013c3a3131be975268eca70c00aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/9f61a71b4c1c013c3a3131be975268eca70c00aa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/4cd07f2e35b6f9323150e5d54b37e2bfa8c02f7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:10:37Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:10:37Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(9): Vite + React + TS strict + Module Federation + Sentry scaffold\n\nScaffolds apps/weekly-commit-ui/ as a Vite 5 + React 18 + TypeScript-strict\nModule Federation remote per ADR-0003. Covers group 9 subtasks 1, 2, 7, 8;\nTailwind/ESLint/Vitest/Playwright land in parallel sibling commits.\n\nFiles:\n- vite.config.ts: federation plugin (name=weekly_commit, exposes\n  ./WeeklyCommitModule, port 4184, shared singletons React/Router/RTK\n  with eager:false), build target esnext, modulePreload off, single-CSS\n  bundle. define injects __WC_GIT_SHA__ from process.env.GIT_SHA (CI) with\n  ''dev'' fallback locally.\n- tsconfig.json: extends repo tsconfig.base.json; strict + noImplicitAny\n  + strictNullChecks + noUncheckedIndexedAccess re-asserted per CLAUDE.md\n  tech-stack lock; @wc/contracts path alias for future RTK Query work.\n- tsconfig.node.json: composite, types:[node] for vite.config.ts.\n- index.html + src/main.tsx: standalone (vite dev / Playwright) entry\n  inside HashRouter; Sentry init gated on VITE_SENTRY_DSN so the host\n  doesn''t double-init in production-federation mode.\n- src/WeeklyCommitModule.tsx: federated component stub with Routes shell\n  and data-testid hooks for the Playwright smoke landing in subtask 6.\n- src/vite-env.d.ts: typing for the build-time defines and import.meta.env.\n\nDeps pinned per ADR-0003: react/react-dom ^18.3.1, react-router-dom\n^6.26.2, @reduxjs/toolkit ^2.2.7, @sentry/react ^8.30.0, vite ^5.4.0,\n@vitejs/plugin-react ^4.3.0, @originjs/vite-plugin-federation ^1.3.5,\ntypescript 5.6.2 (matches repo root). No Tailwind/ESLint/Vitest/Playwright\ndeps yet -- those scope to sibling subtasks.\n\nEnv: GIT_SHA added to .env template + docs/TECH_STACK.md (build-time only,\nnot VITE_-prefixed since Vite reads it in node context). VITE_SENTRY_DSN\nalready present.\n\nyarn install was NOT run -- local toolchain has system yarn 1.22 vs the\nrepo''s packageManager:yarn@4.5.0 mismatch; runtime verification ships when\nCI provisions a clean Node 20 + Corepack toolchain. JSON files validated\nlocally via node JSON.parse.","tree":{"sha":"b231cad1dd75801be19359ea26e427467127859c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/b231cad1dd75801be19359ea26e427467127859c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/4cd07f2e35b6f9323150e5d54b37e2bfa8c02f7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/4cd07f2e35b6f9323150e5d54b37e2bfa8c02f7b","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDRjZDA3ZjJlMzViNmY5MzIzMTUwZTVkNTRiMzdlMmJmYThjMDJmN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/07d65df4d49f8dc147e6588e61ed07db021e75ac","sha":"07d65df4d49f8dc147e6588e61ed07db021e75ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/07d65df4d49f8dc147e6588e61ed07db021e75ac"}],"sha":"4cd07f2e35b6f9323150e5d54b37e2bfa8c02f7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/4cd07f2e35b6f9323150e5d54b37e2bfa8c02f7b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/07d65df4d49f8dc147e6588e61ed07db021e75ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:02:56Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T00:02:56Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8): check off remaining 5 group-8 subtasks (subagent-completed)\n\nThe lint subagent updated only the lint subtask line. AutoLock/Archival/\nDigest/Shedlock/JobMetrics commits all landed but the corresponding\nchecklist lines hadn''t been ticked. No code change here, just task list\nhygiene with notes on each subtask''s design decisions for future readers.","tree":{"sha":"a41eb069a77ebf9cda00205e5b48d029c2bec919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/a41eb069a77ebf9cda00205e5b48d029c2bec919"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/07d65df4d49f8dc147e6588e61ed07db021e75ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/07d65df4d49f8dc147e6588e61ed07db021e75ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDA3ZDY1ZGY0ZDQ5ZjhkYzE0N2U2NTg4ZTYxZWQwN2RiMDIxZTc1YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/06128dce923da24677bdf7f8334e8090872adf54","sha":"06128dce923da24677bdf7f8334e8090872adf54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/06128dce923da24677bdf7f8334e8090872adf54"}],"sha":"07d65df4d49f8dc147e6588e61ed07db021e75ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/07d65df4d49f8dc147e6588e61ed07db021e75ac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/06128dce923da24677bdf7f8334e8090872adf54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:59:38Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:59:38Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8): threshold-Instant lint rule + Java executor\n\nEnforces the MEMO week-math rule (never NOW() in SQL for threshold\ncomparisons; always pass an application-computed Instant -- pod clock\nskew + NOW() in SQL = inconsistent thresholds across replicas under\nHPA).\n\nscripts/lint-now-thresholds.sh greps src/main/java + db/migration for\n\\bNOW\\b / \\bCURRENT_TIMESTAMP\\b. Allowlists, applied via independent\ngrep -v passes for readability:\n  - DEFAULT now(...) column defaults (insert-time, not threshold)\n  - SQL line comments (--), Java line/block comments (//, *)\n  - Java time-API calls (Instant.now(...), LocalDate.now(clock), ...)\n  - \"now\" string-literal map keys (envelope/meta timestamp keys)\n\nBaseline audit: 3 legitimate now() column defaults in V4/V5/V7\nmigrations; zero forbidden threshold uses. Repository javadoc that\nmentions NOW() for context (WeeklyPlanRepository, NotificationDltRepository)\nis correctly skipped by the comment-line allowlist.\n\nNowThresholdLintTest invokes the script via ProcessBuilder so mvnw test\nruns the lint automatically -- CI catches drift even if a developer\nskips running the script by hand. Script header documents that no\nseparate CI workflow step is needed.","tree":{"sha":"c4c0c28e59e0e1b11e246869b78098ca7298a50d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/c4c0c28e59e0e1b11e246869b78098ca7298a50d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/06128dce923da24677bdf7f8334e8090872adf54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/06128dce923da24677bdf7f8334e8090872adf54","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDA2MTI4ZGNlOTIzZGEyNDY3N2JkZjdmODMzNGU4MDkwODcyYWRmNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/9d81df119e45cd9ffc099dd5ee85a3f672aa82bf","sha":"9d81df119e45cd9ffc099dd5ee85a3f672aa82bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/9d81df119e45cd9ffc099dd5ee85a3f672aa82bf"}],"sha":"06128dce923da24677bdf7f8334e8090872adf54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/06128dce923da24677bdf7f8334e8090872adf54"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/9d81df119e45cd9ffc099dd5ee85a3f672aa82bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:54:17Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:54:17Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8): JobMetrics + per-job success/failure counters\n\nAdd a JobMetrics helper bean that wraps each scheduled job''s @Scheduled\nrun() body with Micrometer instrumentation. Two metric families per run:\n\n  weekly_commit.scheduled.job.runs_total{job,outcome}      counter\n  weekly_commit.scheduled.job.duration_seconds{job,outcome} timer\n\nThe outcome=failure label fires when runOnce() throws (job-level fault:\nDB drop, lock-acquire error). Per-item batch failures stay logged at\nWARN inside each job''s existing try/catch -- those are not job-level\nfailures.\n\nWrapping is on run(), not runOnce(), so existing unit tests of business\nlogic stay focused (no metric assertions threaded through every test).\nPer-job tests gain one new run_publishesSuccessCounter test that calls\nthe public run() method and inspects the SimpleMeterRegistry.\n\nCloudWatch picks the metrics up automatically via the Micrometer\nregistry configured in group 7. Alarm wiring (alarm-on-absence,\n100%-failure-rate) is deferred -- this commit is observability only.","tree":{"sha":"a2c0301b6aa66369fff659718d362b71fd3ee061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/a2c0301b6aa66369fff659718d362b71fd3ee061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/9d81df119e45cd9ffc099dd5ee85a3f672aa82bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/9d81df119e45cd9ffc099dd5ee85a3f672aa82bf","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDlkODFkZjExOWU0NWNkOWZmYzA5OWRkNWVlODVhM2Y2NzJhYTgyYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/bf9f47400c6d4fa930337e0f8a881be53685ac0c","sha":"bf9f47400c6d4fa930337e0f8a881be53685ac0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/bf9f47400c6d4fa930337e0f8a881be53685ac0c"}],"sha":"9d81df119e45cd9ffc099dd5ee85a3f672aa82bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/9d81df119e45cd9ffc099dd5ee85a3f672aa82bf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/bf9f47400c6d4fa930337e0f8a881be53685ac0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:43:48Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:43:48Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8) GREEN: UnreviewedDigestJob skip-level grouping (dispatch deferred)\n\nMonday 09:00 UTC weekly cron, default 72h threshold, coordinated via\nSchedulerLock(\"UnreviewedDigestJob\"). Computes skip-level grouping:\n\n- Owner -> direct manager (Employee.managerId) -> skip-level (manager''s manager)\n- Plans whose owner has no direct manager land in an \"unmanaged\" bucket\n  (logged at WARN) so they are visible rather than silently dropped.\n- Plans whose direct manager has no manager (org-leaf) land in a\n  \"no-skip-level\" bucket (also WARN).\n- Per-plan employee-lookup failures (transient DB blip, missing Auth0 sync\n  row) are caught and skipped -- the batch is not aborted.\n\nDigestRunSummary record exposes {plansFound, skipLevelGroups,\nunmanagedCount, noSkipLevelCount} for the test contract and structured logs.\n\nNotification dispatch deferred: notification-svc has no digest contract yet\nand NotificationClient/NotificationSender only handle state-transition events.\nAdding a half-shaped sendDigest(...) here would force a noop in the logging\nfallback and a no-contract HTTP call in the resilient sender. Marked with a\nclass-level Javadoc and a TODO(group-11) at the dispatch site so the\nfollow-up scope finds it. See ADR-0002.\n\nConfiguration:\n- weekly-commit.scheduled.unreviewed-digest-cron (default \"0 0 9 * * MON\")\n- weekly-commit.scheduled.unreviewed-threshold-hours (default 72)\n- Inherits weekly-commit.scheduled.enabled gate from AutoLockJob.\n\nTests: 6/6 passing (full suite 245/245). Spotless applied.","tree":{"sha":"acf5085956148825fa2fe3dbed6660a245efa874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/acf5085956148825fa2fe3dbed6660a245efa874"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/bf9f47400c6d4fa930337e0f8a881be53685ac0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/bf9f47400c6d4fa930337e0f8a881be53685ac0c","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGJmOWY0NzQwMGM2ZDRmYTkzMDMzN2UwZjhhODgxYmU1MzY4NWFjMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/6aa4c2adcdf55194228c3cc788dbd36d71d57e29","sha":"6aa4c2adcdf55194228c3cc788dbd36d71d57e29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/6aa4c2adcdf55194228c3cc788dbd36d71d57e29"}],"sha":"bf9f47400c6d4fa930337e0f8a881be53685ac0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/bf9f47400c6d4fa930337e0f8a881be53685ac0c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/6aa4c2adcdf55194228c3cc788dbd36d71d57e29/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:42:17Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:42:17Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8) GREEN: ArchivalJob nightly cron","tree":{"sha":"076d05d1af711d45cf020adba69d6d972fdef348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/076d05d1af711d45cf020adba69d6d972fdef348"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/6aa4c2adcdf55194228c3cc788dbd36d71d57e29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/6aa4c2adcdf55194228c3cc788dbd36d71d57e29","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDZhYTRjMmFkY2RmNTUxOTQyMjhjM2NjNzg4ZGJkMzZkNzFkNTdlMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b7074e0c1b5f442da3ae6cea9256919fed61ad5c","sha":"b7074e0c1b5f442da3ae6cea9256919fed61ad5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b7074e0c1b5f442da3ae6cea9256919fed61ad5c"}],"sha":"6aa4c2adcdf55194228c3cc788dbd36d71d57e29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/6aa4c2adcdf55194228c3cc788dbd36d71d57e29"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b7074e0c1b5f442da3ae6cea9256919fed61ad5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:39:48Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:39:48Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8) RED: UnreviewedDigestJob skip-level grouping\n\nSix MockitoExtension cases pinning the contract for the Monday 09:00 UTC\nunreviewed-72h digest job:\n\n- groupsBySkipLevelManager: 3 plans across 2 skip-levels collapse to 2 groups\n- thresholdMath_72h: ArgumentCaptor pins the Instant to clock.instant() - 72h\n- unmanagedEmployee: owner with null managerId -> unmanaged bucket, not a group\n- directManagerHasNoSkipLevel: owner -> manager -> null -> no-skip-level bucket\n- emptyResult: empty repo result, EmployeeRepository never queried\n- employeeRepoLookupFailure: per-plan exception does not abort the batch\n\nDefines the public DigestRunSummary record shape via assertions:\n{plansFound, skipLevelGroups, unmanagedCount, noSkipLevelCount}.\n\nPer ADR-0002 the digest dispatch (notificationClient.sendDigest) is\ndeferred to a future scope -- v1 verifies the grouping logic only and\nleaves a TODO(group-11) at the dispatch site.\n\nTest-compile fails as expected: cannot find symbol: class UnreviewedDigestJob.","tree":{"sha":"2119d45bc2f9d8cc0112dd3b30aa8e9515853896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/2119d45bc2f9d8cc0112dd3b30aa8e9515853896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/b7074e0c1b5f442da3ae6cea9256919fed61ad5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b7074e0c1b5f442da3ae6cea9256919fed61ad5c","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGI3MDc0ZTBjMWI1ZjQ0MmRhM2FlNmNlYTkyNTY5MTlmZWQ2MWFkNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b7ad4508210051adb43c9b48f609c93270c0c151","sha":"b7ad4508210051adb43c9b48f609c93270c0c151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b7ad4508210051adb43c9b48f609c93270c0c151"}],"sha":"b7074e0c1b5f442da3ae6cea9256919fed61ad5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b7074e0c1b5f442da3ae6cea9256919fed61ad5c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b7ad4508210051adb43c9b48f609c93270c0c151/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:38:44Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:38:44Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8) RED: ArchivalJob.runOnce contract","tree":{"sha":"2b0ea9ea8cbb8a70b7eaa886753001aadf85aaf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/2b0ea9ea8cbb8a70b7eaa886753001aadf85aaf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/b7ad4508210051adb43c9b48f609c93270c0c151","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b7ad4508210051adb43c9b48f609c93270c0c151","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGI3YWQ0NTA4MjEwMDUxYWRiNDNjOWI0OGY2MDljOTMyNzBjMGMxNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/68a689e705f312e612562d445e860776370ba4aa","sha":"68a689e705f312e612562d445e860776370ba4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/68a689e705f312e612562d445e860776370ba4aa"}],"sha":"b7ad4508210051adb43c9b48f609c93270c0c151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b7ad4508210051adb43c9b48f609c93270c0c151"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/68a689e705f312e612562d445e860776370ba4aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:36:26Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:36:26Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8) GREEN: AutoLockJob + ShedlockTwoPodsIT, drop redundant V8\n\nRemoves the V8 migration committed in the previous task(8) commit -- V6\nalready creates the shedlock table (I missed the comment header\n\"V6: performance-critical indexes + Shedlock table\"). FlywayMigrationIT\nreverted to expecting 7 migrations.\n\nAutoLockJob:\n- @Component @ConditionalOnProperty(weekly-commit.scheduled.enabled)\n- @Scheduled(cron = ${...auto-lock-cron}) + @SchedulerLock(name=AutoLockJob,\n  lockAtMostFor=PT5M, lockAtLeastFor=PT30S) -- 30s minimum prevents\n  multiple pods racing on the same tick within drift tolerance\n- runOnce() exposed for unit tests (bypasses the @Scheduled proxy)\n- Per-plan failure does NOT abort the batch -- a transient\n  optimistic-lock conflict on plan 1 must not block plans 2..N\n- Cutoff math: clock.now() - cutoffHours -> Monday on/before -> ask repo\n  for DRAFTs at that weekStart or earlier. 4 unit tests pin the math.\n\nShedlockTwoPodsIT:\n- @SpringBootTest constructs two JdbcTemplateLockProvider instances\n  pointed at the same DB (the production \"two-pod\" topology) and asserts\n  one acquire succeeds, the other returns Optional.empty(), and after\n  unlock the second can re-acquire. Closest we can get to a true\n  multi-pod test inside one JVM. The Spring-proxy @SchedulerLock path\n  is exercised end-to-end by the per-job unit tests.\n\n231 unit tests + 33 ITs, all green under ./mvnw verify.","tree":{"sha":"9bf05928bd54a26512716220cfa8c78ae38e9c19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/9bf05928bd54a26512716220cfa8c78ae38e9c19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/68a689e705f312e612562d445e860776370ba4aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/68a689e705f312e612562d445e860776370ba4aa","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDY4YTY4OWU3MDVmMzEyZTYxMjU2MmQ0NDVlODYwNzc2MzcwYmE0YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/783ed69eeaf63e2717db027184933f1f9165beef","sha":"783ed69eeaf63e2717db027184933f1f9165beef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/783ed69eeaf63e2717db027184933f1f9165beef"}],"sha":"68a689e705f312e612562d445e860776370ba4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/68a689e705f312e612562d445e860776370ba4aa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/783ed69eeaf63e2717db027184933f1f9165beef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:25:07Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:25:07Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8) RED: AutoLockJob.runOnce contract\n\n4 unit tests pin the auto-lock semantics:\n- transitions every DRAFT plan returned by findDraftsPastCutoff to LOCKED\n  with system actor (null actorId) and returns count\n- empty result -> 0 transitions, no state machine calls\n- one transition failing (e.g. ObjectOptimisticLockingFailureException)\n  does NOT abort the remaining batch -- a single conflict shouldn''t\n  block N-1 plans for an hour\n- cutoff math: now - cutoffHours -> the Monday <= that instant. Verified\n  for two clock positions to nail down the LocalDate calculation\n\nPredicted failure: AutoLockJob class does not exist; test-compile fails.","tree":{"sha":"9a399ed6b8b984df2c4e95e9aa2021b3b42911c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/9a399ed6b8b984df2c4e95e9aa2021b3b42911c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/783ed69eeaf63e2717db027184933f1f9165beef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/783ed69eeaf63e2717db027184933f1f9165beef","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDc4M2VkNjllZWFmNjNlMjcxN2RiMDI3MTg0OTMzZjFmOTE2NWJlZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/aaa5536e89f28c89281143f0417412fb6531ec69","sha":"aaa5536e89f28c89281143f0417412fb6531ec69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/aaa5536e89f28c89281143f0417412fb6531ec69"}],"sha":"783ed69eeaf63e2717db027184933f1f9165beef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/783ed69eeaf63e2717db027184933f1f9165beef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/aaa5536e89f28c89281143f0417412fb6531ec69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T15:39:51Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T15:39:51Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(8): Shedlock JDBC provider + V8 shedlock migration\n\nV8: shedlock table per the JDBC provider''s schema (name PK, lock_until,\nlocked_at, locked_by). Uses TIMESTAMPTZ for parity with the rest of the\nschema; the provider compares correctly across either type.\n\nSchedulingConfig:\n- @Configuration with @EnableSchedulerLock(defaultLockAtMostFor=PT10M)\n- JdbcTemplateLockProvider bean using usingDbTime() so lock TTL is\n  evaluated against the database server clock, not JVM clocks (prevents\n  pod-to-pod skew from causing accidental concurrent execution)\n- @ConditionalOnProperty(shedlock.enabled=true, matchIfMissing=true) so\n  test profiles can disable scheduling cleanly\n\napplication.yml:\n- weekly-commit.scheduled.enabled flag (per-job @Scheduled gate, used in\n  subtask 2+)\n- shedlock.enabled flag for the LockProvider bean\n- both default to true; SHEDLOCK_ENABLED + SCHEDULED_JOBS_ENABLED env\n  overrides\n\nFlywayMigrationIT updated to expect 8 migrations applied.","tree":{"sha":"0f98e421d29a2d110de0915deff7611b9e186717","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/0f98e421d29a2d110de0915deff7611b9e186717"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/aaa5536e89f28c89281143f0417412fb6531ec69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/aaa5536e89f28c89281143f0417412fb6531ec69","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGFhYTU1MzZlODlmMjhjODkyODExNDNmMDQxNzQxMmZiNjUzMWVjNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b0e3cc598f7977cef5ea2d85aa36bf2505c368d5","sha":"b0e3cc598f7977cef5ea2d85aa36bf2505c368d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b0e3cc598f7977cef5ea2d85aa36bf2505c368d5"}],"sha":"aaa5536e89f28c89281143f0417412fb6531ec69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/aaa5536e89f28c89281143f0417412fb6531ec69"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b0e3cc598f7977cef5ea2d85aa36bf2505c368d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T15:25:57Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T15:25:57Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(7): AdminDltReplayIT end-to-end + fix two latent IT regressions\n\nAdminDltReplayIT closes the group-7 loop:\n- Boots @SpringBootTest with WireMock notification-svc + Postgres testcontainer\n- @TestConfiguration registers a @Primary ResilientNotificationSender to\n  bypass the @Profile(\"prod\") gate without flipping the global profile\n- Drives a 503 failure through the real sender; asserts a notification_dlt\n  row appears with eventType=PLAN_LOCKED and payload matching the\n  NotificationEvent JSON (DltReplayService contract)\n- POSTs /api/v1/admin/notifications/dlt/{id}/replay as ROLE_ADMIN; asserts\n  the row is deleted and a successful retry POST hit notification-svc\n- Verifies the producer (ResilientNotificationSender from group 7) and\n  consumer (DltReplayService from group 6) actually agree on the DLT\n  payload contract\n\nTwo latent IT bugs surfaced by running ./mvnw verify and fixed inline:\n\n1. LoggingNotificationSender: removed @ConditionalOnMissingBean(NotificationSender.class).\n   The annotation was self-conflicting -- the class implements\n   NotificationSender, and Spring''s missing-bean check counts the bean\n   itself as \"already present\" and skips registration. After group 6''s\n   DltReplayService introduced a NotificationSender dependency, every\n   @SpringBootTest that didn''t @MockBean the sender failed to load\n   (WeeklyPlanStateMachineIT was the canary). Profile guards\n   (@Profile(\"!prod\") on logger, @Profile(\"prod\") on resilient) are\n   sufficient mutual exclusion -- the conditional was redundant.\n\n2. application.yml: defaulted RCDO_BASE_URL and NOTIFICATION_SVC_BASE_URL\n   to empty strings. The Spring placeholder syntax `${VAR}` without a\n   default fails context load when the env var isn''t set, even if\n   nothing actually uses the resulting empty WebClient. ITs that don''t\n   activate the test profile (which provides values via\n   application-test.yml) hit this. Empty-string default lets context\n   boot; any actual call to a misconfigured client fails loudly at\n   request time, which is the right failure mode.\n\nAlso: gitignore .claude/ (Claude Code internal cache directory).\n\nFinal tally: 231 unit tests, 32 ITs (added AdminDltReplayIT), all green\nunder ./mvnw verify.","tree":{"sha":"67a7eb1ba2167ffa629ae660c2c1f2106f34076d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/67a7eb1ba2167ffa629ae660c2c1f2106f34076d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/b0e3cc598f7977cef5ea2d85aa36bf2505c368d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/b0e3cc598f7977cef5ea2d85aa36bf2505c368d5","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGIwZTNjYzU5OGY3OTc3Y2VmNWVhMmQ4NWFhMzZiZjI1MDVjMzY4ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/675163a0e127e2b1cfbd7de0f24f399cde4f4b57","sha":"675163a0e127e2b1cfbd7de0f24f399cde4f4b57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/675163a0e127e2b1cfbd7de0f24f399cde4f4b57"}],"sha":"b0e3cc598f7977cef5ea2d85aa36bf2505c368d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/b0e3cc598f7977cef5ea2d85aa36bf2505c368d5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/675163a0e127e2b1cfbd7de0f24f399cde4f4b57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T08:18:56Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T08:18:56Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(7): CloudWatch alarms (Terraform) + DltMetricsPublisher gauge\n\nJava side -- DltMetricsPublisher:\n- @Component that registers a Micrometer Gauge named\n  weekly_commit.notification.dlt.recent_count\n- @Scheduled(fixedDelay=60s) refresh queries\n  NotificationDltRepository.countCreatedSince(now - 1h) and updates\n  an AtomicLong backing the gauge\n- 2 unit tests pin the metric name + the now-1h query window\n\napplication.yml: wired management.cloudwatch.metrics.export so the\nMicrometer CloudWatch registry knows the namespace, step, and enabled\nflag (env-overridable; default disabled so dev/test runs don''t try to\npush without AWS creds).\n\nTerraform side -- infra/terraform/monitoring:\n- versions.tf (AWS provider >= 5.0, terraform >= 1.5)\n- variables.tf (environment, namespace, application dimension, SNS\n  ARNs for alarm actions, tags)\n- cloudwatch_alarms.tf:\n  * notification_dlt_recent: 1 datapoint, 1 minute, threshold > 0 --\n    even one dropped notification on a 175-employee org pages\n  * circuit_breaker_open (for_each over notification + rcdo):\n    2 consecutive 1-minute datapoints to avoid HALF_OPEN flap\n- outputs.tf, main.tf, README.md\n\n`terraform validate` passes; `terraform fmt -check -recursive` clean.\n\n231 unit tests passing (was 229, +2 DltMetricsPublisher).","tree":{"sha":"83952b3c5dee437268189ce4271d38969ef4db5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/83952b3c5dee437268189ce4271d38969ef4db5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/675163a0e127e2b1cfbd7de0f24f399cde4f4b57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/675163a0e127e2b1cfbd7de0f24f399cde4f4b57","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDY3NTE2M2EwZTEyN2UyYjFjZmJkN2RlMGYyNGYzOTljZGU0ZjRiNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/8062481f94708f812c0f267bbf1d995ef8a115cb","sha":"8062481f94708f812c0f267bbf1d995ef8a115cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/8062481f94708f812c0f267bbf1d995ef8a115cb"}],"sha":"675163a0e127e2b1cfbd7de0f24f399cde4f4b57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/675163a0e127e2b1cfbd7de0f24f399cde4f4b57"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/8062481f94708f812c0f267bbf1d995ef8a115cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T08:08:14Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T08:08:14Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(7): RcdoClientResilienceIT pins @Retry annotation wiring\n\nFull @SpringBootTest IT that proves the @Retry @CircuitBreaker annotations\non RcdoClient resolve to the ''rcdo'' instance configured in application.yml.\nWireMock returns 503 unconditionally; the test verifies 3 wire calls\nhit the stub (matching application.yml''s rcdo.maxAttempts=3). Without\nthis IT, a typo in the resilience instance name would silently disable\nretry in prod -- unit tests construct RcdoClient directly so they bypass\nthe AOP proxy that the annotations rely on.\n\nManual WireMockServer lifecycle (not @WireMockTest) because\n@DynamicPropertySource only accepts a single registry arg, so the\nWireMock URL has to be known before the property source fires.\n\nMocks NotificationSender to side-step LoggingNotificationSender''s\nself-conflicting @ConditionalOnMissingBean (same pattern as\nOpenApiSpecGenerationIT).\n\nWireMock contract tests subtask: covered by RcdoClientTest (5 cases),\nNotificationClientTest (5 cases), ResilientNotificationSenderTest\n(5 cases via mocked client), plus this resilience IT. Fixture-\nvalidation against docs/spikes/*.json explicitly deferred -- those\nare stub data flagged for replacement when the real services land.","tree":{"sha":"caf82e94e21029d7743a9376ee7ca0f10b737d6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/caf82e94e21029d7743a9376ee7ca0f10b737d6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/8062481f94708f812c0f267bbf1d995ef8a115cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/8062481f94708f812c0f267bbf1d995ef8a115cb","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDgwNjI0ODFmOTQ3MDhmODEyYzBmMjY3YmJmMWQ5OTVlZjhhMTE1Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/de7606cec753d48b65d8c3003b718f48f3aa1660","sha":"de7606cec753d48b65d8c3003b718f48f3aa1660","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/de7606cec753d48b65d8c3003b718f48f3aa1660"}],"sha":"8062481f94708f812c0f267bbf1d995ef8a115cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/8062481f94708f812c0f267bbf1d995ef8a115cb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/de7606cec753d48b65d8c3003b718f48f3aa1660/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T08:02:24Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T08:02:24Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(7) GREEN: ResilientNotificationSender + bean wiring\n\nResilientNotificationSender wraps NotificationClient with the existing\n''notification'' Resilience4j Retry + CircuitBreaker instances. Decorator\nchain is built programmatically (no Decorators helper in resilience4j-\ncore 2.2): CircuitBreaker on the inside, Retry on the outside. Matches\nthe @Retry @CircuitBreaker annotation default order.\n\nFailure semantics swallow exceptions (the dispatcher already committed\nthe state transition; throwing here would echo 5xx on a successful\nLOCKED) and route to DLT:\n\n- NotificationValidationException (400): WARN log, no DLT\n- WebClientResponseException after retries: DLT with attempts +\n  status code in lastError\n- CallNotPermittedException (circuit open): immediate DLT\n- Any other RuntimeException: ERROR log + DLT (defensive catch-all)\n\nDLT payload is `objectMapper.valueToTree(event)` -- matches the\nNotificationEvent JSON shape that DltReplayService.replay deserializes\n(group 6 contract).\n\nNotificationWebClientConfig:\n- Builds the WebClient with base URL, Netty connect/read timeouts,\n  bearer token from NOTIFICATION_SVC_SERVICE_TOKEN\n- Provides NotificationClient as a bean\n- Provides ResilientNotificationSender as @Profile(\"prod\") so non-prod\n  keeps LoggingNotificationSender as the fallback when no real\n  notification-svc is on the other end\n\n229 unit tests passing (was 219, +5 NotificationClient + 5\nResilientNotificationSender). OpenAPI spec drift IT still passes.","tree":{"sha":"188b26d5c5f7e20630b032391b1d85d70d9b76a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/188b26d5c5f7e20630b032391b1d85d70d9b76a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/de7606cec753d48b65d8c3003b718f48f3aa1660","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/de7606cec753d48b65d8c3003b718f48f3aa1660","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGRlNzYwNmNlYzc1M2Q0OGI2NWQ4YzMwMDNiNzE4ZjQ4ZjNhYTE2NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/bf2593f9c3311984c1385b2f974acb6f115faef7","sha":"bf2593f9c3311984c1385b2f974acb6f115faef7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/bf2593f9c3311984c1385b2f974acb6f115faef7"}],"sha":"de7606cec753d48b65d8c3003b718f48f3aa1660","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/de7606cec753d48b65d8c3003b718f48f3aa1660"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/bf2593f9c3311984c1385b2f974acb6f115faef7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:57:11Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:57:11Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(7) RED: ResilientNotificationSender contract\n\nWraps NotificationClient with Resilience4j Retry + CircuitBreaker, and\nwrites a NotificationDlt row when the call ultimately fails. Tests\nassert the full surface:\n\n- happy path: single send, no DLT\n- 5xx then success: retries, no DLT\n- 5xx exhausted: client invoked maxAttempts times, DLT row saved with\n  eventType \"PLAN_LOCKED\", attempts==2, lastError containing \"503\",\n  payload as JSON-of-NotificationEvent (matches DltReplayService''s\n  payload contract from group 6)\n- 400 validation: single attempt, no retry, no DLT (per ADR-0002)\n- send() never throws -- the state transition has already committed\n  by the time the dispatcher fires; throwing here would echo a 5xx\n  back to the IC after their LOCKED succeeded\n\nPredicted failure: ResilientNotificationSender does not exist;\ntest-compile fails.","tree":{"sha":"f3139bd3c56f2d11dd5fc14a6a3e2d13ddae50ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/f3139bd3c56f2d11dd5fc14a6a3e2d13ddae50ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/bf2593f9c3311984c1385b2f974acb6f115faef7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/bf2593f9c3311984c1385b2f974acb6f115faef7","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGJmMjU5M2Y5YzMzMTE5ODRjMTM4NWIyZjk3NGFjYjZmMTE1ZmFlZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/eef303d1c5bdcfe279bbff0ecfe9d87231cf8153","sha":"eef303d1c5bdcfe279bbff0ecfe9d87231cf8153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/eef303d1c5bdcfe279bbff0ecfe9d87231cf8153"}],"sha":"bf2593f9c3311984c1385b2f974acb6f115faef7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/bf2593f9c3311984c1385b2f974acb6f115faef7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/eef303d1c5bdcfe279bbff0ecfe9d87231cf8153/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:55:42Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:55:42Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(7) GREEN: NotificationClient -- raw HTTP wrapper for notification-svc\n\nSingle send() method per ADR-0002 contract:\n- maps PlanState transition to (eventType, templateId): LOCKED ->\n  WEEKLY_PLAN_LOCKED, RECONCILED -> WEEKLY_PLAN_RECONCILED_TO_MANAGER\n- transitions outside that v1 set (ARCHIVED) are no-op''d before any\n  HTTP call -- saves a 400 round-trip for events the upstream doesn''t\n  define\n- X-Idempotency-Key set deterministically: wc-plan-{planId}-{to}-v{ver}\n- 202 success: returns\n- 409 success: duplicate idempotency key == already delivered\n- 400 -> NotificationValidationException so the wrapping sender can\n  skip both retry and DLT (non-recoverable; retry won''t fix bad data)\n- 5xx / 401 propagate as WebClientResponseException for the\n  resilience wrapper to retry/DLT\n\nv1 deferral from ADR: recipientEmployeeId is NOT in the request payload.\nnotification-svc resolves recipient from metadata.planId. Documented in\nclass javadoc; revisit when notification-svc is real.\n\n5 WireMock-driven contract tests pin the request shape (full equalToJson\nbody match) and the four status-code behaviors. Predicted-failure was\ntest-compile failure (NotificationClient + NotificationValidationException\ndidn''t exist); now both exist and tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"93f55131932a6b9ee68a06086b5e2247afabb8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/93f55131932a6b9ee68a06086b5e2247afabb8ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/eef303d1c5bdcfe279bbff0ecfe9d87231cf8153","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/eef303d1c5bdcfe279bbff0ecfe9d87231cf8153","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKGVlZjMwM2QxYzViZGNmZTI3OWJiZmYwZWNmZTlkODcyMzFjZjgxNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/8ff52861f55293788af60e35de77b727f87ba3ff","sha":"8ff52861f55293788af60e35de77b727f87ba3ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/8ff52861f55293788af60e35de77b727f87ba3ff"}],"sha":"eef303d1c5bdcfe279bbff0ecfe9d87231cf8153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/eef303d1c5bdcfe279bbff0ecfe9d87231cf8153"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/8ff52861f55293788af60e35de77b727f87ba3ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:52:44Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:52:44Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(7) GREEN: RcdoClient + WebClient + service-token wiring\n\n- RcdoClient: read-only WebClient wrapper for the upstream RCDO service.\n  Two methods: findSupportingOutcome (single hydration; 404 -> empty)\n  and findActiveSupportingOutcomes (picker list). @Retry + @CircuitBreaker\n  annotations bind to the existing ''rcdo'' Resilience4j instance.\n- SupportingOutcomeView: typed projection with full breadcrumb (rallyCry\n  / definingObjective / coreOutcome / supportingOutcome). UUID-typed IDs\n  matching our schema; @JsonIgnoreProperties(ignoreUnknown=true) on\n  nested records so upstream additions don''t break deserialization.\n- RcdoEnvelope: package-private generic shim for the {data, meta}\n  response wrapper. meta is intentionally untyped.\n- RcdoWebClientConfig: Spring @Configuration that builds the WebClient\n  with base URL, connect/read timeouts (Netty), and the bearer token\n  default header. Token is empty in dev/test (WireMock doesn''t validate)\n  but required in prod -- new RCDO_SERVICE_TOKEN + NOTIFICATION_SVC_SERVICE_TOKEN\n  env vars wired into application.yml; documented in TECH_STACK.md.\n\nTests pin the contract per ADR-0001: 200 with hydrated breadcrumb, 404\nmapping to Optional.empty, 5xx propagation for retry, list and empty-list\nshapes. 219 unit tests passing (was 214, +5).\n\nNote for reviewer: `.env` updated locally (gitignored) to add the two new\nservice-token vars with empty values. Other contributors should mirror\nthe additions per docs/TECH_STACK.md.","tree":{"sha":"bc8206e12e32f15bf82b288323af403f6cff28f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/bc8206e12e32f15bf82b288323af403f6cff28f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/8ff52861f55293788af60e35de77b727f87ba3ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/8ff52861f55293788af60e35de77b727f87ba3ff","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDhmZjUyODYxZjU1MjkzNzg4YWY2MGUzNWRlNzdiNzI3Zjg3YmEzZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/343ee5116e9557fbb617eed9eb643dc863358002","sha":"343ee5116e9557fbb617eed9eb643dc863358002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/343ee5116e9557fbb617eed9eb643dc863358002"}],"sha":"8ff52861f55293788af60e35de77b727f87ba3ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/8ff52861f55293788af60e35de77b727f87ba3ff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/343ee5116e9557fbb617eed9eb643dc863358002/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:46:29Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:46:29Z","email":"seeinplay@gmail.com","name":"Xian Zheng"},"message":"task(7) RED: RcdoClient contract tests against WireMock\n\nPins RcdoClient behavior against the contract in docs/adr/0001-rcdo-contract.md:\n- findSupportingOutcome 200 -> Optional with hydrated breadcrumb (rallyCry,\n  definingObjective, coreOutcome, supportingOutcome each with id+label),\n  Authorization: Bearer header passed through\n- findSupportingOutcome 404 -> Optional.empty (deleted upstream is the\n  expected case, not an error)\n- findSupportingOutcome 5xx -> WebClientResponseException propagates so\n  the Resilience4j retry/circuit breaker AOP can observe it\n- findActiveSupportingOutcomes 200 -> List<SupportingOutcomeView>\n- findActiveSupportingOutcomes empty data array -> empty list\n\nUUID-typed IDs throughout (matches our schema). Resilience4j cross-cutting\nbehavior is left for a separate full-context IT.\n\nPredicted failure: RcdoClient + SupportingOutcomeView do not exist yet;\ntest-compile fails.","tree":{"sha":"adb42a6d4810d6629a9d503c03334d214229e181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/trees/adb42a6d4810d6629a9d503c03334d214229e181"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/git/commits/343ee5116e9557fbb617eed9eb643dc863358002","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/343ee5116e9557fbb617eed9eb643dc863358002","node_id":"C_kwDOSMr5q9oAKDM0M2VlNTExNmU5NTU3ZmJiNjE3ZWVkOWViNjQzZGM4NjMzNTgwMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commit/215af919f90b9df34f89dd3f4148d346ed91bae7","sha":"215af919f90b9df34f89dd3f4148d346ed91bae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/215af919f90b9df34f89dd3f4148d346ed91bae7"}],"sha":"343ee5116e9557fbb617eed9eb643dc863358002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits/343ee5116e9557fbb617eed9eb643dc863358002"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/seeincodes/WeeklyCommit/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=6c2b1e841310fec511d4bc25ba74b50abc58cb47&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A59%3A24.873Z"}');
