eat: auto-populate team logos and color schemes from FBS logo set\n\nParse the CFB26 Dynasty Sheet logo HTML, copy primary logo per school\nto frontend/public/teams/<slug>.png, and extract vivid primary/secondary\ncolors via ColorThief. The generated teams.ts powers a TeamLogo component\n(with initials fallback) wired into Layout sidebar, DynastySwitcher,\nDynasties cards + create modal, Schedule rows + opponent input, Recruits\ncards/form, and the Dashboard header.\n\nNew dynasty creation auto-fills accent_color from the matched team''s\nprimary color unless the user customizes it. School/opponent inputs gain\ndatalist autocomplete from the 112-school catalog.\n\nLogo PNGs and teams.generated.ts are committed so docker compose up\n--build works on a fresh clone without needing the source asset folder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1f65b5c08024986d606a947b1e1d63832e43c40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jthickma/dynasty-hq/git/trees/e1f65b5c08024986d606a947b1e1d63832e43c40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jthickma/dynasty-hq/git/commits/30daf411df00ced1f2f03608b9c06381d7f8d2a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181776265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jthickma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jthickma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jthickma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jthickma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jthickma","id":181776265,"login":"jthickma","node_id":"U_kgDOCtWviQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jthickma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jthickma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jthickma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user