count":{"login":"kingsonseang","providerType":"User"},"email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"authoredDate":"2026-04-26T02:01:01Z","committedDate":"2026-04-26T02:01:03Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"kingsonseang","providerType":"User"},"email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:47:45.349Z","repositoryId":1221294014,"sha":"b33ba2e872fba1378c5d038e877d3138416e0dde"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:47:45.349Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang","id":86928786,"login":"kingsonseang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTI4Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/3e3a2f3fad9d76bf2d4f5c6cb3de89edd01c5c07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:46:32Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:46:32Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"message":"feat(ledger-service): add GetEntryByReference lookup\n\n- Add sqlc query GetEntryByReference, returns pgx.ErrNoRows mapped to\n  gRPC Code.NotFound when no entry exists for a given reference\n- Used by payments-service reconciliation to detect missing ledger entries\n  without needing a separate \"exists\" flag on the journal_entries table\n\nfeat(payments-service): add payment reconciliation (manual + scheduled)\n\n- Add ReconcilePayments rpc: scans completed payments, checks each\n  against ledger-service via GetEntryByReference, posts a missing\n  PostEntry where the ledger entry doesn''t exist, no-ops where it does\n  (idempotent — safe to run repeatedly)\n- Add a background reconciliation loop (Schedule.fixed, 5 min interval),\n  forked as a daemon fiber on the handler''s existing ManagedRuntime via a\n  runReconciliation wrapper, rather than building a second runtime with\n  duplicated layers\n- Closes the previously documented gap: a webhook''s DB status update to\n  ''completed'' succeeding while the subsequent ledger PostEntry call fails\n  (e.g. ledger-service briefly unreachable) no longer leaves a silent,\n  permanent mismatch between payments and the ledger\n- ReconcilePayments is intentionally NOT exposed via the gateway — same\n  operational-only reasoning as PostEntry; reachable via grpcurl directly\n  against payments-service for now, candidate for an admin/staff surface\n  once that role concept exists\n\nfix: export type annotations on runtime-adjacent values (reconciliationLoop,\nrunReconciliation) to avoid \"inferred type cannot be named\" errors caused by\nunreferenceable protobuf-es v2 generated types — same root cause and fix\npattern as the earlier `app` export in api-gateway''s main.ts\n\nfix(payment-providers): rebuild was resolving a stale mixed dist/ output\n(duplicate flat + dist/src/ nested structure from an earlier build config\nchange) — cleared and rebuilt clean, confirmed via runtime import check\nrather than relying on grep against re-export statements","tree":{"sha":"371ce753524bf73c13c80059744f29e5301229f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/trees/371ce753524bf73c13c80059744f29e5301229f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/commits/3e3a2f3fad9d76bf2d4f5c6cb3de89edd01c5c07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang","id":86928786,"login":"kingsonseang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTI4Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commit/3e3a2f3fad9d76bf2d4f5c6cb3de89edd01c5c07","node_id":"C_kwDOSMt3vtoAKDNlM2EyZjNmYWQ5ZDc2YmYyZDRmNWM2Y2IzZGU4OWVkZDAxYzVjMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commit/5d0277585f6f19d87666ebe2e5ebfe1d8d5728cd","sha":"5d0277585f6f19d87666ebe2e5ebfe1d8d5728cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/5d0277585f6f19d87666ebe2e5ebfe1d8d5728cd"}],"sha":"3e3a2f3fad9d76bf2d4f5c6cb3de89edd01c5c07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/3e3a2f3fad9d76bf2d4f5c6cb3de89edd01c5c07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang","id":86928786,"login":"kingsonseang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTI4Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/5d0277585f6f19d87666ebe2e5ebfe1d8d5728cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:00:15Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:00:15Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"message":"feat(payments-service): add webhook confirmation and ledger posting on\ndeposit completion\n\n- Add ConfirmWebhook rpc to payments.proto (provider, raw_body,\n  signature)\n- libs/payment-providers: add verifyWebhookSignature (HMAC-SHA512,\n  timingSafeEqual)\n  and parseWebhookEvent to PaymentProvider interface, implemented for\n  Paystack\n  per charge.success/charge.failed event types\n- Add providerByName lookup to ProviderRegistry (webhook routing is by\n  provider name, unlike initializeDeposit which routes by currency)\n- Add fromMinorUnits helper (integer kobo/cents -> decimal string),\n  mirrors\n  the existing toMinorUnits conversion used on the deposit-creation side\n- payments-service gains an internal LedgerClient (service-to-service\n  gRPC,\n  not exposed via gateway) to call PostEntry on confirmed deposits\n- confirmWebhook is idempotent: payments already completed/failed\n  short-circuit\n  as a no-op rather than posting a duplicate ledger entry on webhook\n  retry\n- Amount is verified against the webhook payload (via fromMinorUnits)\n  before\n  the payment status is updated or the ledger entry is posted — a\n  mismatch\n  leaves the payment pending rather than marking it completed without\n  crediting\n  the ledger, avoiding a state where DB and ledger silently disagree\n\nfeat(api-gateway): add public webhook ingress\n\n- Add POST /webhooks/:provider, intentionally unauthenticated\n  (requireAuth\n  does not apply — trust comes from signature verification inside\n  payments-service, not a user JWT)\n- Always responds 200 to the provider regardless of internal outcome, to\n  avoid Paystack''s retry-on-non-2xx behavior turning a real failure into\n  a retry storm against an endpoint that will keep failing for the same\n  reason\n\nknown gap (not yet addressed): if the DB status update to ''completed''\nsucceeds but the subsequent ledger PostEntry call fails, the payment is\nleft completed with no corresponding ledger entry. Needs either a\nsaga/compensating-transaction pattern or a reconciliation job; deferred\nfor now as a documented edge case rather than added complexity.","tree":{"sha":"2b31539c965adc3f44727dd552e0b5046fdc436b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/trees/2b31539c965adc3f44727dd552e0b5046fdc436b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/commits/5d0277585f6f19d87666ebe2e5ebfe1d8d5728cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang","id":86928786,"login":"kingsonseang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTI4Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commit/5d0277585f6f19d87666ebe2e5ebfe1d8d5728cd","node_id":"C_kwDOSMt3vtoAKDVkMDI3NzU4NWY2ZjE5ZDg3NjY2ZWJlMmU1ZWJmZTFkOGQ1NzI4Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commit/aba82d229bfea7bb7dcad29f121847b52aadc8f5","sha":"aba82d229bfea7bb7dcad29f121847b52aadc8f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/aba82d229bfea7bb7dcad29f121847b52aadc8f5"}],"sha":"5d0277585f6f19d87666ebe2e5ebfe1d8d5728cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/5d0277585f6f19d87666ebe2e5ebfe1d8d5728cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang","id":86928786,"login":"kingsonseang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTI4Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/aba82d229bfea7bb7dcad29f121847b52aadc8f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T14:56:52Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T14:56:52Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"message":"feat(payment-providers): add real Paystack integration, mock USD/Stripe\nplaceholder\n\n- New libs/payment-providers: PaymentProvider interface,\n  ProviderRegistry\n  resolves currency -> provider (NGN -> Paystack, USD -> mock pending\n  Stripe)\n- Paystack client wraps /transaction/initialize and /transaction/verify\n  via\n  Effect.tryPromise, errors normalized to ProviderError\n- USD deposits continue through a mock provider (mockUsdProvider) until\n  Stripe integration begins — consistent response shape, no live\n  dependency\n- payments-service: createDepositIntent now calls the real provider\n  registry\n  instead of mockInitiatePaystackPayment (removed)\n- Add toMinorUnits helper (string decimal -> integer kobo/cents)\n  avoiding\n  floating point amount conversion\n- Add @org/payment-providers as a buildable lib (same dist/\n  build-before-run\n  requirement as @org/protos when running services via tsx directly)\n- Confirmed real Paystack checkout URL returned via grpcurl and through\n  api-gateway POST /api/v1/payments/deposit","tree":{"sha":"015734adff62b72430c6d91a028d178a2392f663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/trees/015734adff62b72430c6d91a028d178a2392f663"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/commits/aba82d229bfea7bb7dcad29f121847b52aadc8f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang","id":86928786,"login":"kingsonseang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTI4Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commit/aba82d229bfea7bb7dcad29f121847b52aadc8f5","node_id":"C_kwDOSMt3vtoAKGFiYTgyZDIyOWJmZWE3YmI3ZGNhZDI5ZjEyMTg0N2I1MmFhZGM4ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commit/62c6ed73e3eb0ac21667f891aacdc547596371cc","sha":"62c6ed73e3eb0ac21667f891aacdc547596371cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/62c6ed73e3eb0ac21667f891aacdc547596371cc"}],"sha":"aba82d229bfea7bb7dcad29f121847b52aadc8f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/aba82d229bfea7bb7dcad29f121847b52aadc8f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kingsonseang","id":86928786,"login":"kingsonseang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTI4Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/62c6ed73e3eb0ac21667f891aacdc547596371cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:20:34Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:20:34Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"message":"feat(ledger-service): implement double-entry ledger in Go with sqlc +\npgx\n\n- Add journal_entries schema (debit/credit entry_type enum, account_id,\n  currency)\n- Add sqlc queries: PostEntry, GetBalance (computed via SUM, not\n  stored), ListEntries\n- Add LedgerService business logic layer wrapping generated sqlc queries\n- Add dbtypes helpers for pgtype<->string conversion (UUID, Numeric,\n  Text)\n- Add gRPC handler implementing LedgerServiceServer\n- Add Currency enum to ledger.proto (was previously a bare string)\n- toDbCurrency now returns (string, error) and rejects\n  CURRENCY_UNSPECIFIED\n  explicitly, rather than silently defaulting to NGN on any unmatched\n  value\n  (this silent-default bug caused several corrupted test rows during\n  development)\n- Pin protoc-gen-go, protoc-gen-go-grpc, sqlc as Go tool dependencies in\n  go.mod\n  rather than global installs, for cross-machine reproducibility\n- Confirmed PostEntry, GetBalance, ListEntries working via grpcurl\n\nfeat(api-gateway): wire ledger-service into gateway (read-only)\n\n- Add LedgerClient gRPC layer\n- Add GET /ledger/balance/:currency, GET /ledger/entries\n- Strip $typeName and map proto enums (Currency, EntryType) to plain\n  string\n  labels before returning HTTP responses\n- PostEntry intentionally NOT exposed via gateway — deferred until\n  payments-service moves off the mocked Paystack integration and can\n  call\n  ledger-service internally on payment completion\n\nfix: libs/protos must be rebuilt (nx run protos:build), not just\nregenerated\n\n- Services run via `tsx` directly (bypassing Nx) resolve @org/protos\n  through\n  dist/ at runtime, not the @org/source TypeScript-only condition\n- Nx normally rebuilds this automatically as a project graph dependency;\n  running tsx directly skips that step, causing stale enum/field\n  mismatches\n  that surfaced as \"Cannot read properties of undefined\" and binary\n  parse errors\n\ndocs: note Bruno gRPC client does not correctly encode proto3 enum\nfields\n(sends 0/unspecified regardless of UI value) — confirmed via server-side\nlogging; use grpcurl for any gRPC method with enum-typed fields","tree":{"sha":"3a32692cd42a09988cbc7fc629584ca16ac7574b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/trees/3a32692cd42a09988cbc7fc629584ca16ac7574b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/commits/62c6ed73e3eb0ac21667f891aacdc547596371cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/