.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/commits/bb0d968e0ac99cf7e36e5a1be81d7b52ad01608b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:26:06Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:26:06Z","email":"kingsonseang@gmail.com","name":"kingsonseang"},"message":"feat(payments-service): implement payment intents with mocked Paystack integration\n\n- Add Drizzle schema for payments table (deposit/withdrawal, status, reference)\n- Add Currency enum to payments.proto (previously missing, used string)\n- Implement createDepositIntent, createWithdrawIntent, getPaymentStatus, listPayments\n- getPaymentStatus scoped to requesting user (ownership check), returns NotFound rather than\nForbidden to avoid leaking payment existence to non-owners\n- Mock Paystack call via mockInitiatePaystackPayment, to be replaced by a real provider client once\nthis slice is validated end-to-end\n- ConnectRPC handler with proto<->DB enum mapping (currency, status, type)\n- Add PaymentsClient gRPC layer\n- Add routes: POST /payments/deposit, POST /payments/withdraw, GET /payments/:paymentId, GET\n/payments\n- Strip protobuf-es $typeName field from all HTTP responses by explicitly shaping response bodies\nrather than passing gRPC client responses through directly","tree":{"sha":"ae58d864c4dc8e91c2b0c233a1a2a0945e3f8e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/trees/ae58d864c4dc8e91c2b0c233a1a2a0945e3f8e50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kingsonseang/nexacore-financial/git/commits/bb0d968e0ac99cf7e36e5a1be81d7b52ad01608b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86928786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingsonseang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us